<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">EN_CLT cua_Tiếng⋅Co_ltr Thu Feb 13 2025 16:49:22 GMT+0700 (Indochina Time) tc</book>
  <para style="usfm">3.0</para>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">Luke</para>
  <para style="toc1">Hêêl Kaxay Lu-ka</para>
  <para style="toc2">Lu-ka</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luk</para>
  <para style="mt">Lu-ka</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />Vii kơq 'ngưng adro heq raanq kông valơk achêêp phon valơk taboon truh kaluh varơuq jah payôôch katul wat haay, <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />tyauq đaji khơl adro xing tuôôy kapa tep jêêk vlôh khơl adro xanưk ka đnư ji xapok ku đaauq Lôôk heq taboon hlê ka haay, <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />đơu tuôôy heq xưh xadrah tôôy varơuq xing patep kach rơơt rol, gô hloq dik tolh ka gô xôq valơk hlê tyauq tong varơuq ka nhu kadraq, kuh kadraq Thê-ô-phi-lơ thier vado, <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />xôq ka nhu kadraq hnoq e xet truh varơuq kajưk dik ku kaluh apok pato đơu nhu heq jah pato dayq.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />Đom đơơy Hê-rôt, vuua dêh Ju-đê, e muuyq thơy tơơk tưp hơq anơng laa Xa-cha-ri, thuôk bing A-bi-ja. Kadrê kơy thuôk adrơơk khơl koot kadrê A-rôn, ji anơng mo laa Ê-li-sa-bet. <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Kaah vaarq kadrê kanau raay hyioh jăk kangưưr Kơy Plêêk, vii riirh leh aduq trek ik đom tôôy varơuq ganeen kung kaluh ganuun ku Lôôk. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Oot leh e koot vii Ê-li-sa-bet biq thoon, ji hloay vaarq 'miêh heq 'ngưng tuuyh.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Varơuq heq xalih vlôh muut tuôôy ku kơy dưk dơơp phon varơuq tơơk tưp kangưưr Kơy Plêêk đom kahnoq kadih ku bing kơy, <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />Tyauq varơuq 'miêh ku bing tơơk tưp, kơy heq hruut palăk kahlôôp muut pi 'lăp hnhư hơu ku Kơy Plêêk xôq tơơk tưp kagul. <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Dêq bing karôp manih tamooy măn pi gôk xadrook apôôy đom tuôôy tơơk tưp kagul. <verse eid="LUK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Tuôôy nưq, muuyq kơy yaak ku Lôôk rama vlôh dii kơy, dưk pi akoh para hơu vuh kagul. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Xa-cha-ri biq xôôl dôôl tuôôy hloq kơy yaak, ji varơuq yôq varaal kariik klum tol kơy. <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Bơh kơy yaak đnooy dii kơy; “Xa-cha-ri, te yôq, vii apok xadrook apôôy ku kơy heq jah nhonq, ji kadrê kơy, Ê-li-sa-bet, hnoq pa iir ka kơy muuyq koot kanau, ji kơy hnoq vlăk anơng koot laa Jăng. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Nưq hnoq laa xuum hlah hlaak, tơơl dal ka kơy, ji 'ngưng adro hnoq rayơh rayơơy gamưh varơuq pa iir vlôh ku oh de. <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />Vii oh hnoq jah vanê vado kangưưr Kơy Plêêk, oh dong dik leh hôôch lok long tuôông kajoq dơơp ăm vuul, ji oh hnoq jah viik ngăk Lôôk Phool hiel hloay kaah xing đom klaak ku miq ni. <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />Ni hnoq khienq 'ngưng koot xau I-sơ-ra-ên wiit xuq kung Lôôk laa Kơy Plêêk ku oot. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />Kadih ni hnoq hooy kangưưr Lôôk dii danưng kooy ji taay yaak ku Ê-li, xôq khienq xuum vaq wih hlê dii koot, ji adro leh tameng truh dii varơuq khôôt xet ku manih hyioh jăk — xôq palauq ralauq ka Lôôk muuyq tamooy heq jah 'meq ralauq.”<verse eid="LUK 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Xa-cha-ri tơơl dii kơy yaak: “Bơơn kach aleq đơu gô hnoq nhonq xok ik varơuq nưq? Vii gô heq karaq, ji kadrê gô heq 'ngưng tuuyh.” <verse eid="LUK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />Xôq tơơl hlê, yaak plêêk đnooy dii kơy: “Gô laa Gap-ri-ên, laa adro dưk tangưưr kangưưr Kơy Plêêk, gô jah patăk truh đnooy dii kơy ji xagook hêêl kaxay neq ka kơy. <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Dayh 'yo ranih neq, kơy hnoq biq hôp ji leh đnooy ik dong truh hngơy kaluh varơuq hơq xalih vlôh, vii kơq kơy heq leh tuôq apok gô, laa kaluh apok hnoq jah jêêk muut klip katuôôy ku ni.” <verse eid="LUK 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Manih karôp 'miêh đong takôô Xa-cha-ri, ji oot hloq akêh tuôôy kơy măn xiik đom hnhư hơu. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Bơh tuôôy hooy vlôh, kơy leh hnoq đnooy athêêk ik dii oot, đơu oot hlolh đaneq kơy heq hloq kahnoq vlôh đom hnhư hơu, măn kơy kưq vlôh hlêêl ka oot đơu măn biq hôp. <verse eid="LUK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Varơuq xalih vlôh tuôôy kaluh hngơy dưk dơơp kaluh varơuq tơơk tưp ku kơy heq dêq, kơy dưk hooy xuq hnhư kơy.<verse eid="LUK 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Bơh atêq kaluh hngơy nưq, kadrê kơy, Ê-li-sa-bet, măn bonq, ji mo padu xăk đom dăp xiêk, đnooy <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />đaneq: “Lôôk heq dơơp đanưq ka gô, đom kaluh hngơy đơu Kadraq 'yo xiaq gô, xôq tơơk ka'lăk varơuq kamưưl ier ku gô katul tôôy adro.”<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Truh xiêk thưq drơu, kơy yaak Gap-ri-ên jah Kơy Plêêk patăk truh muuyq theng ku dêh Ga-li-lê anơng ku theng laa Na-xa-ret, <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />tavơh muuyq khơl drê tadăp heq tavek xarooy dii muuyq dro e anơng laa Jô-sep, thuôk adrơơk Đa-vik, măn anơng ku mư tadăp laa Ma-ri. <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Tuôôy truh tavơh mư, kơy yaak đnooy: “Dik hlah ka mư vii jah ha ơơr vanong! Lôôk măn kung mư.” <verse eid="LUK 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Bơh mư biq xôôl dôôl xing kaluh apok nưq ji ravơq biit 'yo apok hrok neq e iq kajoq. <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Yôôch kơy yaak đnooy dii mư: “Mư Ma-ri, xiin te yôq, vii mư heq jah vanong kangưưr Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />'Yo neq, mư hnoq măn bonq đom klaak mư yôôch pa iir muuyq koot kanau, ji mư hnoq vlăk anơng ku koot de laa Jê-xu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />Koot kanau nưq hnoq jah yơơt vado ji hnoq jah taayh laa Koot ku Kơy Thier Yơơt, ji Lôôk laa Kơy Plêêk hnoq kahniq ka Kadraq ngôôy Đa-vik, mo kơy Kadraq. <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />Kadraq hnoq xanok tol hnhư Ja-kôp dong truh đơơy đơơy, ji daak ku Kadraq hnoq laa miet miet.” <verse eid="LUK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Ma-ri đnooy dii kơy yaak: “Varơuq nưq hnoq xalih vlôh đaleq, tuôôy gô koq nhonq xet muuyq dro khơl kanau?” <verse eid="LUK 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Xôq tơơl hlê, kơy yaak đnooy dii mư: “Lôôk Phool Hiel hnoq truh tol mư ji taay yaak ku Kơy Thier Yơơt hnoq klum katuh mư. Vii anưq, Koot Vah pa iir vlôh hnoq jah taayh laa Koot Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Dayh 'yo hơq, Ê-li-sa-bet, manih oh ay ku mư — mo kung heq măn bonq muuyq koot kanau tuôôy mo 'ngưng tuuyh, ji bonq nưq đong jah drơu xiêk đom mo, laa adro biq pơq apok thoon. <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />Vii be apok heq xanoh leq hnoq jêêk vlôh lưp dơơp ik đôôyq dii Kơy Plêêk.” <verse eid="LUK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Tuôôy nưq, Ma-ri tơơl: “Gô neq, adro xapok kadrê ku Lôôk. Apôôy varơuq xalih vlôh ka gô tyauq đaji apok ku Kadraq.” Yôôch kơy yaak chuh klơlh mư.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Đom kaluh hngơy nưq, Ma-ri dưk tok dii xuum pơl wol, mư hooy tok ma gôk, truh muuyq theng thuôk Ju-đa, <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />Yôôch mư hooy muut đom hnhư Xa-cha-ri ji vôôch hlơq Ê-li-sa-bet. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Varơuq xalih vlôh tuôôy Ê-li-sa-bet tameng apok hrok ku Ma-ri, koot de đom klaak mo axe we hlah hlaak, măn Ê-li-sa-bet jah galơh galaay Lôôk Phool Hiel. <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />Mo taayh kalh apok đơu đnooy: “Mư jah vanong hloay katul wat khơl kadrê, bonq de đom klaak mư kung jah vanong. <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Xing leq đơu varơuq neq truh ka gô, nưq laa miq ku Lôôk gô heq truh dii gô? <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Vii 'yo hơq, hloay tuôôy apok hrok ku mư truh aduq tôôr gô, adro de đom klaak gô heq axe we đom hlah hlaak. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Vanong ka mư tuôq đaneq kaluh apok xing Lôôk heq jah xanoh dii mư hnoq jah jêêk.” <verse eid="LUK 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />Yôôch Ma-ri đnooy:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">“Phool hiel gô ayuôôt laat Lôôk,<verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />danưng kooy gô dêq paraat hlah hlaak aduq Kơy Plêêk laa Wơơt Lôôk ku gô.<verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />Bơyh kơq Kadraq heq 'yo truh xăk xamơk de dik ku xapok kadrê Kadraq.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">Vii 'yo hơq, kê xing juneq, tôôy adrơơk hnoq kheng gô e vanong,<verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />bơyh Kơy Taay Yaak heq dơơp kaluh varơuq kôt ka gô,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:49">yal Kadraq laa vah,<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />xuum biit angơuq ku Kadraq padoh xing adrơơk neq truh adrơơk kadrơy đôôyq dii khơl leq kuh yôq Kadraq.<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />Kadraq heq dưk dơơp kaluh varơuq taay yaak bơơn pla ti ku Kadraq;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:51">Kadraq heq dơơp ka khơl adro katơơk galơh hyaak hyul tyauq kaluh iq biit aduq xuum oot.<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />Kadraq taluq ka'lăk khơl vuua padrok klơlh ngôôy oot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:52">ji tapôôk khơl xăk xamơk lêq de tok yơơt.<verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />Kadraq khienq manih pangoot phiq viik tuôông tolh,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:53">ji druyh adro karoh hooy xuq ti hloh.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />Kadraq heq wơơt waak I-sơ-ra-ên, adro xapok Kadraq,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:54">xôq jah dong văch hlê xuum biit angơuq,<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />dang đaji Kadraq heq xanoh dii khơl mo kơy 'wot — dii Ap-ra-ham ji dii adrơơk kơy truh đơơy đơơy.”<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Ma-ri măn dii mo đom pe xiêk, yôôch mư wiit xuq hnhư mư.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Katuôôy hngơy ku Ê-li-sa-bet xôq mo pheq pa iir koot heq truh, ji mo heq pa iir vlôh muuyq koot kanau. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Kaluh palơy pla ji oh ay ku mo tameng đaneq Lôôk heq kahnoq vanong xuum angơuq ku Kadraq kach kôt galơh ka mo, yôôych oot kung hlah hlaak dii mo.<verse eid="LUK 1:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />Varơuq xalih vlôh đom hngơy thưq thơơm, oot truh xôq goch kađuh ka oh de, ji oot xung taayh oh tyauq anơng vaq ku oh, laa Xa-cha-ri. <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />Tơơl hlê varơuq nưq, miq oh đnooy: “Leh aalq, bơh oh de hnoq jah taayh laa Jăng.” <verse eid="LUK 1:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Oot đnooy dii mo đaneq: “Leh e kơyq đom wat oh ay ku mo đơu jah vlăk anơng đanưq.” <verse eid="LUK 1:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Oot vlôh hlêêl ka vaq oh, 'yo thưh kơy xung vlăk anơng ka oh laa kajoq. <verse eid="LUK 1:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Atêq tuôôy dăt xok muuyq tômq tapaat, kơy valơk đaneq: “Anơng oh de laa Jăng.” Dêq hloay raay thier tưng hưng. <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Hloay lunưq, huuy ji kapiet kơy luh vlôh, yôôch kơy đnooy tok apok ayuôôt laat Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Varơuq varaal hwaal truh tol dêq hloay khơl adro măn gah gih oot, ji dêq hloay kaluh varơuq nưq jah taboon vlôh đom loch dêh đoot gôk ku Ju-đê. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Tôôy manih tameng tek yôôych xôq muut xuum oot, kadih vôôch: “Kơn têq, oh de neq hnoq jêêk vlôh đaleq?” Vii dik ti Lôôk măn dii oh.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Xa-cha-ri, vaq oh de, jah galơh galaay Lôôk Phool Hiel, ji đnooy apok hlit, đaneq:<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />“Đangq ayuôôt laat Lôôk laa Kơy Plêêk ku I-sơ-ra-ên,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:68">vii Kadraq heq hlơq hlôôp ji dưk dơơp varơuq wơơt xok ka koot tamooy Kadraq.<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />Kadraq heq tơơk tok ka 'wot muuyq akê wơơt xok</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:69">đom hnhư Đa-vik, xapok Kadraq<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />(đaji Kadraq heq xanoh xing tuôôy hnu xing huuy khơl hlit vah ku Kadraq),<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />laa varơuq wơơt xok klơlh khơl tachơơl ku 'wot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:71">ji klơlh ti ku tôôy adro 'yarơ 'wot;<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />xôq kahnoq xuum biit angơuq đôôyq dii mo kơy 'wot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:72">ji xôq jah ajơ văch hlê tavek vah ku Kadraq,<verse eid="LUK 1:72" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />'ngưq laa apok tavek đơu Kadraq heq paleek kung Ap-ra-ham, mo kơy 'wot, xôq kahniq ka 'wot<verse eid="LUK 1:73" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />tuôôy heq jah wơơt xok vlôh klơlh ti khơl tachơơl 'wot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:74">xôq ka hơu varơuq Kadraq kach leh yôq varaal,<verse eid="LUK 1:74" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />đom varơuq hlăng vah ji hyioh jăk kangưưr Kadraq, dêq kaluh hngơy ku 'wot.<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />Măn koot, koot de lơơy, koot hnoq jah taayh laa adro hlit ku Kơy Thier Yơơt,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:76">vii koot hnoq hooy kangưưr Lôôk xôq deep trôôk ku Kadraq,<verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />xôq xagook varơuq nhonq xet vanong wơơt xok ka tamooy Kadraq</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:77">đom varơuq tha ka'lăk kaluh kadrôôp maroh ku oot,<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />gamưh xuum biit angơuq galơh galaay ku Kơy Plêêk haay,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:78">bơyh nưq, mot hngơy vlok xing tol taalh hnoq hlơq hlôôp haay,<verse eid="LUK 1:78" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />xôq xaraar ahnhe khơl leq đong 'ngôôy đom kamơng jaluk ji đom long lơuq ku varơuq kaxêêt,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:79">xôq atăq jarooy pla jôôk haay muut trôôk hrok hrol.”<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Koot de kôt tok ji jah kajưk kalh đom danưng kooy, oh măn đom wăngq we dong truh hngơy kadih anưq kahnoq vlôh ku ni kangưưr tamooy I-sơ-ra-ên.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Varơuq xalih vlôh đom kaluh hngơy nưq, nưq laa muuyq apok tanưưl xing Sê-sa Au-gut-tơ heq đnooy vlôh loch dêq dêh araak xôq jauq hlê sôôq tamooy. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Varơuq jauq hlê sôôq tamooy patep dik neq xalih vlôh tuôôy Qi-ri-ni-u đong jư xakaq dêh Si-ri. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Dêq hloay raay dưk hooy xôq valơk anơng muut rahlăp, tôôy adro wih xuq dêh katu ku đêh oot. <verse eid="LUK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Jô-sep kung hooy xing dêh Ga-li-lê, chuh theng Na-xa-ret truh dêh Ju-đê, muut theng Đa-vik, aduq jah taayh laa Bêt-lê-hem, vii kơy thuôk truh rong nooy ji adrơơk Đa-vik, <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />Xôq valơk anơng muut rahlăp kung dii Ma-ri, laa manih heq tavek xarooy dii kơy, đong măn bonq. <verse eid="LUK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />Varơuq xalih vlôh đom tuôôy baarq đong măn đnen, nưq laa hngơy mư jiq pa iir heq truh. <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />Mư pa iir muuyq koot kanau, laa koot adroyq ku mư, ji mư anung koot bơơn kaluh xađneeh khanh vaayh, yôôch xôq koot de muut muuyq vook rek, vii leh e aduq ka baarq đom hnhư padơy.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Kung đom dêh nưq, e khơl dro jư trưưu đong măn ma gôk, đom klôôy kamơng parol jư bơy trưưu ku oot. <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Muuyq kơy yaak ku Lôôk rama vlôh kangưưr oot, tađnah tađnaak Lôôk xaraar jaraak rawiit oot, ji oot biq varaal hwaal dii varơuq yôq varaal paq ik. <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Kơy yaak đnooy dii oot: “Te yôq, vii 'yo nee, gô xagook ka khơl ay tuôq hêêl kaxay thier hlah hlaak, hêêl nưq hnoq deng ka tôôy adro. <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />Vii hngơy neng, aduq theng Đa-vik, Kơy Wơơt Xok heq jah pa iir vlôh ka khơl ay, Kadraq laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, laa Lôôk! <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Ji neq laa dơuq hlêêl deng ka khơl ay: Khơl ay hnoq axek tavơh muuyq oh de anung bơơn kaluh xađneeh khanh vaayh, vik đom vook rek.” <verse eid="LUK 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Tưng hưng, muuyq bing yaak kuun rama vlôh kung dii kơy yaak nưq ayuôôt laat Kơy Plêêk, đaneq:<verse eid="LUK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />“Tađnah tađnaak rawiit axuq Kơy Plêêk đom aduq thier yơơt,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:14">ji tol vari, hrok hrol đom khơl manih thuôk truh iq tamaq kaxay ku Lôôk.”<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Varơuq xalih vlôh hloay tuôôy khơl kơy yaak heq hooy klơlh oot tok plêêk, khơl adro jư trưưu đnooy dii mamuuyq: “Dong dik, haay duh hooy truh aduq Bêt-lê-hem ji 'yo hêêl nưq laa varơuq vơơ xalih vlôh, đơu Lôôk heq kahnoq vlôh ka haay.” <verse eid="LUK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Oot pơl wol dưk hooy, yôôch tavơh jah kaah Ma-ri ji Jô-sep, kung dii oh de đong vik đom vook rek. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Atêq tuôôy 'yo hloq, oot đnooy vlôh truh apok plêêk heq jah padoh taboon ka oot truh oh de neq. <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />Atoh kơyq tameng kung raay biq tưng hưng truh kaluh kajoq jah taboon hlê ka oot xing khơl adro xakaq trưưu. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Măn Ma-ri kưq biit văch kaluh apok nưq, đong biit đom xuum mư. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Yôôch khơl adro xakaq trưưu wiit xuq, vanê ayuôôt ji ayuôôt laat Kơy Plêêk vii kaluh varơuq đơu oot heq tameng ji hloq, dang đaji hêêl hlah heq jah padoh taboon ka oot.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />Tuôôy kawat thơơm hngơy xôq goch kađuh ka koot de heq jah dưk dơơp, yôôych anơng koot de nưq jah taayh laa Jê-xu, laa anơng heq jah xôq xing kơy yaak adroyq tuôôy koot de jah bonq jêêk đom klaak miq.<verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />Ji tuôôy kaluh hngơy pa ah ku oot tyauq ganuun Môi-se heq jah tameng tyauq, baarq xagook koot de tok Jê-ru-sa-lem xôq tơơk tưp ka Lôôk <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />(đaji heq valơk đom ganuun ku Lôôk, đaneq: “Tôôy koot kanau adroyq dik hnoq jah taayh laa vah ka Lôôk”), <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />ji xôq tơơk tưp ôq lêh tyauq đaji varơuq jah pato đom ganuun ku Lôôk, “muuyq đôôy xêêp katrơu long vaarq poop xêêp katrơu de”. <verse eid="LUK 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Ji 'yo hơq, e muuyq adro đom Jê-ru-sa-lem, anơng ku kơy laa Si-mê-ôn, manih khơl kanau neq hyioh jăk ji talăng jăk, đong takôô varơuq hlơq hlôôp tamooy ku I-sơ-ra-ên, ji Lôôk Phool Hiel măn kung kơy. <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />Varơuq heq jah kahnoq vlôh ka kơy xing Lôôk Phool hiel laa hnoq leh hloq varơuq kaxêêt adroyq tuôôy kơy hnoq e hloq Kơy Wơơt Dêh ku Lôôk. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Ji xing Lôôk Phool Hiel, kơy hooy muut hnhư hơu, tuôôy miq vaq xagook koot de Jê-xu truh xôq oot dưk dơơp tyauq varơuq jah đinq đom ganuun apiq truh koot de nưq, <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />kơy tapôôk oh de tol ti, ayuôôt laat Kơy Plêêk, ji kơy đnooy:<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />“Kuh Lôôk, juneq, Kadraq đong ăm xapok Kadraq vlôh hooy đom hrok hrol tyauq đaji apok ku Kadraq.<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />Vii mot koot heq hloq varơuq wơơt xok ku Kadraq,<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />đơu Kadraq heq ralauq palauq adroyq kangưưr manih karôp:<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />Xaraar tađnah ka varơuq hloq adroyq truh dii kaluh tamooy daak kadrơy, ji tađnah tađnaak ka tamooy I-sơ-ra-ên ku Kadraq.”<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Vaq ji miq koot de yôôych dơơp akêh adroyq kaluh kajoq kơy đnooy truh koot de. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Yôôch Si-mê-ôn chuk vanong ka oot ji đnooy dii Ma-ri, miq oh de: “'Yo hơq, oh de neq heq đinq ka varơuq gưlh pôôt long dưk tok ku 'ngưng adro đom I-sơ-ra-ên, ji dơơp muuyq dơuq hlêêl biq khơl kadrơy đnooy tachơơl — <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />panưh kadrơy, muuyq pla xieh hnoq tăp hlal phool hiel ku kadih mư — xôq ka xuum klaak iq biit pi 'lăp 'ngưng xuum klaak jah kahnoq vlôh.” <verse eid="LUK 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Aduq nưq kung e mo hlit An-ne, oh kadrê ku Pha-nu-ên, thuôk rong nooy A-se. Mo thier 'ngưng tuuyh, hmưq riirh dii kanau pơh xanưm jauq xing tuôôy măn tadăp blaay ku mo, <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />yôôch mo măn valơu truh juneq heq thơơm kưl poot tuuyh, đơu leh chuh hnhư hơu, kưq hơu varơuq hngơy ji klôôy dii varơuq deek xa ji xadrook apôôy. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Tuôôy e mot muut kadih wat nưq, mo e apok kuh qway Kơy Plêêk, ji đnooy truh oh de ka tôôy adro đong takôô varơuq wơơt xok ku Jê-ru-sa-lem. <verse eid="LUK 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />Tuôôy oot heq dơơp payôôch tôôy varơuq tyauq ganuun ku Lôôk, oot wiit hlê dêh Ga-li-lê, xuq theng ku oot laa Na-xa-ret.<verse eid="LUK 2:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Oh de kôt tok ji jêêk vlôh kalh paraat, jah viik varơuq khôôt xet, ji vanong plêêk ku Kơy Plêêk măn tol oh de nưq.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />Tôôy xanưm, miq vaq Kadraq hooy truh Jê-ru-sa-lem xôq jưq lêh Dalơh Hlê. <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Tuôôy Kadraq jah kưl vaarq tuuyh, oot tok đnư tyauq varơuq ragơy ku hngơy lêh. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Atêq tuôôy taleq hngơy lêh heq payôôch, tuôôy oot đong hooy trôôk wiit xuq, oh de Jê-xu hloay e măn aduq Jê-ru-sa-lem đơu miq vaq Kadraq leh lưp xet. <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />Bơh vii biit Kadraq măn đom khơl hooy tyauq, đơu oot heq hooy muuyq hngơy trôôk, yôôch đơơu axek Kadraq đom katul oh ay ji khơl 'wơyq. <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />Ji tuôôy axek leh hloq, oot wiit kaxơơlh xuq Jê-ru-sa-lem, xatyauq đnoyq axek akhiim Kadraq. <verse eid="LUK 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Varơuq xalih vlôh nưq laa atêq pe hngơy, oot axek hloq Kadraq đom hnhư hơu, đong 'ngôôy măn katul khơl pato ganuun, vơơ domq tameng oot vơơ vôôch tagêh oot. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />Tôôy adro tameng Kadraq raay tưng hưng truh varơuq hlolh xet kung đaji apok tơơl hlê ku Kadraq. <verse eid="LUK 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Miq vaq dơơp akêh tuôôy hloq Kadraq, ji miq Kadraq đnooy dii Kadraq: “Koot lơơy, aleq koot laay xa dơơp dii miq vaq đanưq? 'Yo nee, vaq koot ji miq heq jiq hlu pơơl hwơơl akhiim axek koot.” <verse eid="LUK 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Vii aleq miq vaq axek akhiim koot? Miq vaq heq leh xet đaneq koot pheq măn đom hnhư Vaq ku koot ih?” <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Bơh oot leh hlolh apok đơu Kadraq đnooy dii oot. <verse eid="LUK 2:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Yôôch Kadraq hooy pôôt kung dii miq vaq, xuq truh theng Na-xa-ret, ji chiuq tameng oot. Măn miq Kadraq biit văch tôôy varơuq nưq đom xuum mo.<verse eid="LUK 2:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />Lôôk Jê-xu kưq kathôp truh đom varơuq khôôt xet ji xăk xamơk, kung đaji đom varơuq kaxay xuum kangưưr Kơy Plêêk ji khơl drơy.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Muut xanưm thưq kưl dăp 'laarq đơơy Sê-sa Ti-be-rơ — đom tuôôy Bôn-xơ Phi-lat dơơp padrok xanok dêh Ju-đê, Hê-rôt dơơp vuua xakaq dêh Ga-li-lê, măn Phi-lip, oh kanau kơy nưq dơơp vuua xakaq dêh I-tu-rê kung dii dêh Tra-kô-nik, ji Li-sa-ni-a dơơp vuua xakaq dêh A-bi-len, <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />đom kawat An-ne kung Kai-phe đong dơơp thơy tơơk tưp kôt — apok Kơy Plêêk heq truh dii Jăng, koot kanau Xa-cha-ri, đom wăngq we. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Ji yôôch, kơy hooy truh loch kaluh aduq gah gih daak Jô-đanh, padoh taboon pheep bap-tem truh varơuq wiit xuum xôq jah vanong ka'lăk kadrôôp. <verse eid="LUK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />Đaji varơuq heq jah valơk đom rahlăp truh kaluh apok ku kơy hlit Ê-sai:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">“E apok taayh kôt đom wăngq we:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">‘Dayh adoot deep trôôk ka Lôôk,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">dơơp pahyioh kaluh trôôk ku Kadraq.<verse eid="LUK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />Tôôy ahnuk huuk hnoq jah galôp viik,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">tôôy gôk đoot hnoq jah xiel pôôt,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">trôôk gwong gweng hnoq vlôh hyioh hyek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">trôôk ragưp ragôh hnoq vlôh manay kling,<verse eid="LUK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />ji tôôy xăk xamơk hnoq hloq varơuq wơơt xok ku Kơy Plêêk.’”<verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />Nưq, Jăng đnooy dii bing manih truh xôq chiuq kơy dơơp bap-tem: “Adrơơk nooy voolh taweek hơq, kơyq heq đnooy tauq ka êêp xôq xadăk klôônq klơlh đơơt tôq jaraq jeq truh? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Vii anưq, dayh vlôh play taxưngq dik dii varơuq wiit xuum, ji te kưq đnooy dii kadih xăk xamơk haay: ‘Haay e Ap-ra-ham laa mo kơy’ vii gô đnooy dii êêp đaneq Kơy Plêêk hnoq ik tơơk tok koot xau Ap-ra-ham xing kaluh kuk phơu neq. <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />Panưh kadrơy, poop xuôôk kung đong xôq angôôlh ka ưk ôôlh yôôch. Jo anưq ưk leq leh e play tolh yôôych biq kơl ji taweek muut ôôlh.” <verse eid="LUK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Manih karôp vôôch kơy đaneq: “Nưq, 'wot duh pheq dơơp kajoq?” <verse eid="LUK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Xôq tơơl apok, kơy đnooy dii oot: “Kơyq e vaarq aau pheq ahlook aklah dii adro leh e, ji kơyq e tuôông xa, adro nưq kung dayh dơơp đanưq.” <verse eid="LUK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />Khơl xok xơu kung truh xôq chiuq bap-tem, ji oot tơơl kung kơy: “Tơơl thơy, 'wot duh pheq dơơp kajoq?” <verse eid="LUK 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Kơy đnooy dii oot: “Te xok 'ngưng iaq mưk heq jah đnooy ka oh ay.” <verse eid="LUK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Muuyq sôôq bing kuun kung vôôch kơy, đaneq: “Măn 'wot, 'wot duh pheq dơơp kajoq?” Kơy đnooy dii oot: “Te parayh xok thưq kajoq, kung te pahnhiq bơyq, ji dayh hlah xuum dii jêêt hngơy ku êêp.”<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Panưh kadrơy, vii manih karôp đong takôô ji vii dêq hloay raay biit kadih đom xuum oot truh Jăng, leh xet kơy e aalq laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh be, <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Jăng heq tơơl hlê tuôôy đnooy dii tôôy adro: “Gô dơơp bap-tem ka oh ay bơơn daak, bơh Kơy jeq truh e taay yaak iaq gô, laa Kơy đơu gô leh taxưngq dik luh talơy kaxôôp ku Kadraq. Kadraq hnoq dơơp bap-tem ka oh ay bơơn Kơy Phool Hiel ji bơơn ôôlh, <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />laa Kơy e apoop kapưk đom ti Kadraq xôq kapưyh thier xarêh chaal va kadraq, ji xôq va qwaay muut đom pơ ku kadraq, bơh Kadraq hnoq huur vuh hre va bơơn ôôlh be hnoq dơơp poch ik.”<verse eid="LUK 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Lunưq, dong dik đom tuôôy pato nhăk 'ngưng varơuq kadrơy, kơy padoh taboon hêêl kaxay ka manih karôp. <verse eid="LUK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Bơh vuua xakaq Hê-rôt, atêq tuôôy biq Jăng toah trek truh varơuq Hê-rô-đia, kadrê ku ma oh vuua, ji truh kaluh varơuq xơk kadrơy đơu Hê-rôt heq dơơp, <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />pheq đnooy heq athêêp varơuq neq muut dêq hloay varơuq xơk ku kơy: nưq laa kơy nưq ăm rôp Jăng karuk muut tu.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Lunư đom tuôôy tôôy adro chiuq bap-tem, varơuq xalih vlôh nưq laa Lôôk Jê-xu kung chiuq bap-tem, ji đom tuôôy Kadraq đong xadrook apôôy, kaluh tal plêêk jah luh vlôh, <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />yôôch Kơy Phool Hiel kahri pôôt tol Kadraq đom long lơuq pi gôk dang đaji xêêp katrơu, ji muuyq apok xanoh truh xing plêêk: “Koot laa Koot xung xiaq ku Gô. Gô hlah xuum truh Koot.”<verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Tuôôy xarôp dơơp varơuq, xăk xamơk Lôôk Jê-xu jah kơh pe kưl tuuyh, (tyauq đaji oot măn biit) Kadraq laa koot ku Jô-sep, Jô-sep koot Hê-li, <verse eid="LUK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />Hê-li koot Mat-tat, Mat-tat koot Lê-vi, Lê-vi koot Mên-chi, Mên-chi koot Ja-nê, Ja-nê koot Jô-sep, <verse eid="LUK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />Jô-sep koot Ma-ta-thia, Ma-ta-thia koot A-môt, A-môt koot Na-hum, Na-hum koot Êch-li, Êch-li koot Na-gê, <verse eid="LUK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />Na-gê koot Ma-at, Ma-at koot Ma-ta-thia, Ma-ta-thia koot Sê-mê-in, Sê-mê-in koot Jô-sêch, Jô-sêch koot Jô-đa, <verse eid="LUK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />Jô-đa koot Jô-a-nan, Jô-a-nan koot Rê-sa, Rê-sa koot Xô-rô-ba-bên, Xô-rô-ba-bên koot Sa-la-thi-ên, Sa-la-thi-ên koot Nê-ri, <verse eid="LUK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />Nê-ri koot Mên-chi, Mên-chi koot A-đi, A-đi koot Kô-sam, Kô-sam koot Ên-ma-đam, Ên-ma-đam koot Ê-rơ, <verse eid="LUK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />Ê-rơ koot Jô-suê, Jô-suê koot Ê-li-ê-se, Ê-li-ê-se koot Jô-rim, Jô-rim koot Mat-that, Mat-that koot Lê-vi, <verse eid="LUK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />Lê-vi koot Si-mê-ôn, Si-mê-ôn koot Ju-đa, Ju-đa koot Jô-sep, Jô-sep koot Jô-nam, Jô-nam koot Ê-li-a-kim, <verse eid="LUK 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />Ê-li-a-kim koot Mê-lê-a, Mê-lê-a koot Men-na; Men-na koot Mat-ta-tha, Mat-ta-tha koot Na-than, Na-than koot Đa-vik, <verse eid="LUK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />Đa-vik koot Je-sê, Je-sê koot Ô-bêt, Ô-bêt koot Bô-ô, Bô-ô koot Sanh-môn, Sanh-môn koot Na-ach-son, <verse eid="LUK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />Na-ach-son koot A-mi-na-đap, A-bi-na-đap koot At-min, At-min koot A-rơ-ni, A-rơ-ni koot Êch-rôm, Êch-rôm koot Pha-rê, Pha-rê koot Ju-đa, <verse eid="LUK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />Ju-đa koot Ja-kôp, Ja-kôp koot I-sak, I-sak koot Ap-ra-ham, Ap-ra-ham koot Tha-rê, Tha-rê koot Na-kô, <verse eid="LUK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />Na-kô koot Sê-ruk, Sê-ruk koot Rê-hu, Rê-hu koot Bê-lek, Bê-lek koot Hê-be, Hê-be koot Sa-la, <verse eid="LUK 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />Sa-la koot Kai-nam, Kai-nam koot A-bak-sat, A-bak-sat koot Sem, Sem koot Nô-ê, Nô-ê koot Lê-mek, <verse eid="LUK 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />Lê-mek koot Mê-tu-sê-la, Mê-tu-sê-la koot Hê-nok, Hê-nok koot Jê-rêt, Jê-rêt koot Ma-ha-la-ên, Mê-ha-la-ên koot Kê-nan, <verse eid="LUK 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />Kê-nan koot Ê-not, Ê-not koot Sêt, Sêt koot A-đam, A-đam koot Kơy plêêk.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Lôôk Jê-xu, galơh galaay Kơy Phool Hiel, wiit xuq xing daak Jô-đanh, ji jah Phool Hiel jarooy muut wăngq we, <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />xôq chiuq kamuuych adô aluut đom poot kưl hngơy. Tuôôt kaluh hngơy nưq, Kadraq leh xa paq kê kajoq lunưq Kadraq pangoot atêq tuôôy kaluh hngơy neq payôôch. <verse eid="LUK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Yôôch kamuuych đnooy dii Kadraq: “Atoh kơy laa Koot Kơy Plêêk, yôôych dayh đnooy dii phơu neq xôq ni jêêk vlôh tôôp yơu.” <verse eid="LUK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />Lôôk Jê-xu tơơl kung ni: “E apok valơk đaneq: ‘Koot manih riirh leh vơ gamưh tôôp đơu heq.’” <verse eid="LUK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Yôôch tuôôy heq jarooy Kadraq tok yơơt, ni pato ka Kadraq dêq hloay kaluh daak dêh tol dêh araak đom muuyq jơy. <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />Kamuuych đnooy dii Kadraq: “Gô hnoq ăm kơy tôôy da uh qwuyen neq kung tađnah tađnaak ku ni, vii ni heq jah pahnăp ka gô, ji gô e hnoq pahnăp ni ăm paq kê kơyq atoh gô trôôch. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Lunưq, atoh kơy kul akuh kangưưr gô, yôôych dêq hloay hnoq laa ku kơy.” <verse eid="LUK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />Xôq tơơl apok, Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii ni: “E apok valơk: ‘May pheq ayuôôt laat Lôôk laa Kơy Plêêk ku may, ji vơ hơu varơuq Kadraq đơu heq.’” <verse eid="LUK 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Nưq yôôch, ni jarooy Kadraq truh Jê-ru-sa-lem, xôq Kadraq tol tavuk ku hnhư hơu, ji ni đnooy dii Kadraq: “Atoh kơy laa Koot Kơy Plêêk, dayh katruyh xăk pôôt xing aduq neq. <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" />Vii e apok valơk, đaneq:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:10">‘Kadraq hnoq vlôh tanưưl ka khơl kơy yaak Kadraq truh koot, xôq xakaq 'yo koot,’<verse eid="LUK 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />ji đaneq: ‘Oot hnoq tapôôk koot tol ti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:11">nưq koot xatôôlh jôôk koot muut phơu.’”<verse eid="LUK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />Xôq tơơl hlê, Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii ni, đaneq: “E apok xanoh: ‘May leh ik thưh Lôôk laa Kơy Plêêk ku may.’”<verse eid="LUK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Atêq tuôôy dưk dơơp dêq tôôy kach adô aluut, kamuuych chuh klơlh Kadraq, takôô ajơ kadrơy.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Lôôk Jê-xu wiit xuq Ga-li-lê đom taay yaak ku Kơy Phool Hiel, ji hêêl truh Kadraq ahna vlôh loch dêh gah gih. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />Kadraq pato dayq đom kaluh hnhư hơu ku manih karôp, jah tôôy adro ayuôôt laat.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Kadraq hooy truh Na-xa-ret, aduq Kadraq heq jah văch xiap, ji tyauq katik ragơy ku kadraq, Kadraq hooy muut hnhư hơu đom hngơy Sa-bat yôôch dưk tok đok kalh xarooy. <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />Rahlăp ku kơy hlit Ê-sai jah palo ka Kadraq, ji tuôôy luh rahlăp vlôh, Kadraq axek hloq aduq đơu dong kajoq jah valơk đaneq:<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />“Kơy Phool Hiel ku Lôôk măn tol gô,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">vii Kadraq heq para jơu ka gô xôq padoh taboon hêêl kaxay ka manih adrah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Kadraq heq dăt patăk gô xôq đnooy vlôh varơuq rayơh rayơơy ka khơl adro biq rôp karuk,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">ji varơuq dơơp tađnah hlê mot ka khơl adro apul,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">xôq jarooy khơl adro biq rôp toop truh varơuq rayơh rayơơy,<verse eid="LUK 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />ji xôq padoh vlôh xanưm kaxay ku Lôôk.”<verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Atêq tuôôy gwonq rahlăp hlê ăm ka adro dơơp varơuq, Kadraq 'ngôôy pôôt. Tôôy kalook mot đom hnhư hơu raay 'yo atrêêk Kadraq. <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />Nưq yôôch, Kadraq xarôp đnooy dii oot, đaneq: “Hngơy neng, apok Rahlăp Vah truh aduq tôôr oh ay nưq heq jah jêêk yuôôr.” <verse eid="LUK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Tôôy adro raay dơơp xanưk tolh truh Kadraq ji oot tưng hưng adroyq kaluh apok viik galaay vanong vlôh xing huuy Kadraq, ji oot tajauq: “Neq be aalq laa koot kanau ku Jô-sep ih?” <verse eid="LUK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Kajưk dik oh ay hnoq đnooy dii gô apok đnooy hnu neq: ‘Thơy jarơơu lơơy, dayh kadih wơơt paxêêk kadih xăk. Xet toleq varơuq đơu 'wot heq tameng xalih vlôh aduq Ka-bê-na-um, yôôych kơy kung dayh dơơp kađnen, aduq katu hnhư kơy nưq yuh.’” <verse eid="LUK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />Nưq yôôch Kadraq đnooy: “Dong dik, gô đnooy dii oh ay, đaneq leh e kơy hlit leq jah đoonq nhonq aduq katu hnhư ku kơy. <verse eid="LUK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />Gô đnooy dii oh ay ganưq tol varơuq dik, đaneq 'ngưng mo valơu 'miêh măn aduq I-sơ-ra-ên đom đơơy ku Ê-li, tuôôy plêêk biq kađnoch galip đom pe xanưm drơu xiêk, tuôôy nưq, naanq pangoot kôt xalih vlôh đom loch dêh, <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" />đơu Ê-li jah patăk truh dii be kơyq đom sôôq oot, đêh vlôh truh Sa-rep-ta, aduq theng Si-đôn, truh kung muuyq mo valơu kanau. <verse eid="LUK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />Kung e 'ngưng manih jiq paruh măn aduq I-sơ-ra-ên đom đơơy kơy hlit Ê-li-sê, ji be kơyq đom sôôq oot jah payơh, đêh vlôh Na-a-man, manih Si-ri.” <verse eid="LUK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Tuôôy tameng kaluh apok nưq, tôôy adro đom hnhư hơu galơh galaay thier jaraq. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Atêq tuôôy dưk tok, oot hnen xagook Kadraq vlôh pi gôk theng, ji hwa Kadraq truh apưt ku ngok đoot đơu theng ku oot măn tol nưq, xôq taweek Kadraq pôôt. <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />Bơh Kadraq ka'lăk hooy atêq tuôôy hooy dalơh hlê katul oot.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Kadraq hooy pôôt Ka-bê-na-um, muuyq theng thuôk dêh Ga-li-lê, ji Kadraq pato dayq ka manih karôp đom hngơy Sa-bat. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />Oot thier akêh adroyq varơuq pato dayq ku Kadraq, vii apok Kadraq kahnoq vlôh kung dii taay yaak. <verse eid="LUK 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />Đom hnhư hơu, e muuyq adro biq garu xi ku kamuuych klơơr 'yêq nhôp muut, ji adro nưq alo kôt xarooy: <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />“A! Jê-xu Na-xa-ret, 'wot dii Kadraq e apiq truh kajoq? Kadraq truh xôq păk kaxêêt 'wot ih? Gô xet Kadraq laa kơyq — laa Kơy Vah ku Kơy Plêêk!” <verse eid="LUK 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Lôôk Jê-xu toah trek ni, đaneq: “Dayh hnhep yơu, ji vlôh klơlh adro neq!” Nưq laa atêq tuôôy amik ay nưq pôôt vari hloay katul manih karôp, kamuuych vlôh klơlh ay nưq, leh dơơp ka ay neq xưr xôôh kajoq. <verse eid="LUK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Varơuq kadrăch varaal truh tol tôôy adro, ji oot tajauq dii mamuuyq, đaneq: “Đaauq kajoq neq, truh nôôy dii da uh qwuyen ji taay yaak, kơy nưq vlôh tanưưl ka kamuuych 'moh, ji oot pheq vlôh klơlh?” <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Hêêl truh Kadraq ahna vlôh loch dêh gah gih.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Atêq nưq, tuôôy heq dưk tok chuh hnhư hơu, Kadraq muut đom hnhư ku Si-môn. Lunư, miq kadrê ku Si-môn đong chiuq jiq jiêh dii jiq tanget dik, ji oot apôôy vôôch Kadraq truh mo. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Dưk garê xăk tol mo, Kadraq toah jiq tanget, ji ni chuh klơlh mo, yôôch mo hloay jơnưq dưk tok hơu varơuq oot.<verse eid="LUK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Tuôôy mot hngơy lôp, dêq hloay tôôy adro paq kê biq jiq jiêh dii đu kaluh loayq bingq tăk, manih nưq jarooy oot truh ka Kadraq, yôôch Kadraq paxêêk yơh oot tuôôy xôq ti tol tưng adro đom sôôq nưq. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />Kaluh kamuuych kung vlôh klơlh 'ngưng adro, tuôôy taayh kalh đơu đnooy đaneq: “Kadraq laa Koot Kơy Plêêk!” Ji bơơn kach toah trek, Kadraq leh ăm pheep oot đnooy, vii oot heq xet Kadraq laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Tuôôy xarôp hngơy đơơu, atêq tuôôy vlôh klơlh aduq nưq, Kadraq hooy truh muuyq aduq wăngq we, măn manih karôp kưq akhiim axek Kadraq, ji oot heq hooy dong truh tuôôy tavơh Kadraq yôôych raanq jư Kadraq hlê, leh ăm hooy klơlh oot. <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Bơh Kadraq đnooy dii oot, đaneq: “Gô kung pheq padoh taboon hêêl kaxay truh daak dêh ku Kơy Plêêk ka 'ngưng theng kadrơy, xing gô jah patăk truh vii varơuq neq.”<verse eid="LUK 4:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Yôôch Kadraq athêêp đnoyq pato dayq đom kaluh hnhư hơu dêh Ju-đê.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />Varơuq xalih vlôh tuôôy bing manih karôp pahnen rawiit Kadraq xôq domq tameng apok Kơy Plêêk, ji Kadraq đong dưk gah hlôôk daak Gê-nê-xa-rêt, <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Kadraq hloq vaarq poop ge đong vek neeo gah hlôôk daak, măn khơl hmơt kaa, tuôôy nưq heq pôôt klơlh ge yôôch, oot đong arôôh lươyq. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Kadraq tok muuyq đom vaarq poop ge, đơu ge nưq laa ku Si-môn, Kadraq dăt kơy awaayh vlôh xangưưy gah muuyq xiik. Atêq tuôôy 'ngôôy ieen viq, Kadraq padoh pato ka bing manih xing tol ge. <verse eid="LUK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Tuôôy Kadraq padoh payôôch, Kadraq đnooy dii Si-môn: “Dayh awaayh ge vlôh aduq daak jaruq yôôch avih lươyq ku ay pôôt xôq rôp muuyq xit kaa.” <verse eid="LUK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Tuôôy tơơl apok, Si-môn đnooy: “Tơơl thơy, ju dơơp varơuq tuôôt kaah klôôy, 'wot heq be rôp jah kajoq, bơh ganưq tyauq apok thơy, gô hnoq avih lươyq.” <verse eid="LUK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />Atêq tuôôy dơơp varơuq nưq, oot rôp jah thier 'ngưng kaa, măn lươyq ku oot yôôych jeq hyaak. <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Oot avlôh hlêêl ka khơl 'wơyq rôp kaa măn poop ge kadrơy truh waak oot, khơl adro nưq truh ji duuy kaa tok viit dêq vaarq ge truh nôôy oot jeq karăp. <verse eid="LUK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Lunư, tuôôy hloq anưq, Si-môn Phi-e-rơ kuu xăk pôôt aduq takuul Lôôk Jê-xu, tơơl: “Kuh Lôôk, xiin chuh klơlh gô, vii gô laa adro kadrôôp maroh.” <verse eid="LUK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Vii varơuq varaal vari kariik klum kơy ji dêq hloay khơl adro măn kung kơy xing kơq lươyq kaa đơu oot heq dơơp rôp jah, <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />Kung dang đanưq đôôyq dii Ja-kơ ji Jăng, laa khơl koot kanau ku Xê-bê-đê, oot laa khơl 'wơyq rôp kaa ku Si-môn. Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii Si-môn: “Te yôq! Xing neng kơn têq ay hnoq laa ti hmơt lươyq manih.” <verse eid="LUK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Atêq tuôôy awaayh ge muut gah, ji ka'lăk tôôy thưq, oot hooy tyauq Kadraq.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Varơuq xalih vlôh tuôôy Kadraq đong măn aduq muuyq theng hơq, ji 'yo hơq, muuyq adro xăk viik jiq paruh. Tuôôy hloq Lôôk Jê-xu, ay kuu mot pôôt apôôy xiin Kadraq, đaneq: “Kuh Lôôk, atoh Kadraq trôôch, Kadraq hnoq ik khienq gô jah xarêh.” <verse eid="LUK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Kadraq palo ti vlôh avêq muut ay, đnooy: “Gô trôôch, dayh xarêh yơu.” Hloay jơnưq, jiq paruh vlôh klơlh ay nưq. <verse eid="LUK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Yôôch Kadraq đnooy panhăk ay te đnooy dii kơyq, wih hlê: “Dayh hooy kahnoq vlôh kadih xăk ka thơy tơơk tưp ji tơơk kuah lêh truh varơuq jah xarêh ku ay tyauq đaji Môi-se heq pato dayq, xôq dơơp xanưk ka oot.” <verse eid="LUK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Lunư, hêêl taboon truh Kadraq laay măn lơy ranưh iaq đnoyq, nưq laa bing manih karôp lơyq garuk mamuuyq truh xôq tameng Kadraq pato dayq ji jah payơh klơlh kaluh jiq jiêh ku oot. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Bơh Kadraq ragơy hooy muut aduq wăngq we ji xadrook apôôy.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Varơuq xalih vlôh muut muuyq hngơy hơq, đom tuôôy Kadraq đong pato dayq, yôôych e khơl manih Pha-ri-si ji thơy pato ganuun 'ngôôy ka đnư, laa khơl adro heq truh xing loch kaluh palơy đom dêh Ga-li-lê ji Ju-đê, kung đaji xing theng Jê-ru-sa-lem, ji taay yaak ku Lôôk măn tol Kadraq paxêêk yơh jiq jiêh. <verse eid="LUK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />'Yo hơq, muuyq sôôq manih xakôôk muuyq adro khơl kanau vik tol chanưng, nưq laa adro biq jiq talêêt, oot đong axek kach xakôôk ay nưq muut pi 'lăp xôq amik kangưưr Kadraq. <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />Tuôôy leh axek ik kach xakôôk ay nưq muut vii kơq bing karôp, yôôych gamưh hooy tok tol tavuk hnhư, hluh hlê apo hnhư, oot heq raduk ay nưq vik tol chanưng pôôt katul tôôy adro, kangưưr Lôôk Jê-xu. <verse eid="LUK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Tuôôy hloq xuum tuôq ku oot, Kadraq đnooy: “Nee ay, kadrôôp maroh ay heq jah ka'lăk.” <verse eid="LUK 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Khơl thơy pato ganuun ji manih Pha-ri-si xarôp tagêh apleh, đaneq: “Adro neq laa kơyq đơu đnooy apok katơơk galơh đahơq? Kơyq e qwuyen ka'lăk kadrôôp đêh vlôh muuyq adro Kơy Plêêk?” <verse eid="LUK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Bơh Lôôk Jê-xu xet varơuq biit ku oot, đơu xôq tơơl hlê, Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Aleq khơl kơy tagêh apleh đom xuum êêp đanưq? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />Apok leq laa klêq đnooy iaq: ‘Kadrôôp maroh ay heq jah ka'lăk’ long đnooy: ‘Dayh dưk tok ji tawaak hooy’? <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />Bơh xôq khơl kơy xet đaneq Koot Manih tol vari e qwuyen ka'lăk kadrôôp,” — Kadraq đnooy dii adro biq talêêt — “Gô dăt ay, dayh dưk tok, doot deep chanưng ay ji dayh hooy xuq hnhư ku ay.” <verse eid="LUK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Hloay jơnưq, ay nưq dưk tok kangưưr oot, atêq tuôôy deep chanưng đơu ay 'miêh vik pi taalh, yôôych ay hooy xuq hnhư ay, xôq tađnah tađnaak ka Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Varơuq tưng hưng kariik klum tôôy adro, ji oot ayuôôt laat Kơy Plêêk, xuum viik yôq varaal, đnooy đaneq: “Hngơy neng haay heq hloq kaluh varơuq akêh.”<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Atêq kaluh varơuq nưq, Kadraq chuh klơlh đnư ji 'yo anhinq muuyq adro xok xơu anơng Lê-vi đong 'ngôôy ka aduq xok xơu, yôôch Kadraq đnooy dii kơy: “Dayh tyauq gô!” <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Nưq laa atêq tuôôy dưk tok, ka'lăk hlê tôôy thưq, kơy hooy tyauq Kadraq.<verse eid="LUK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Lê-vi adoot muuyq waal xa kôt deng ka Kadraq aduq hnhư kơy, ji e muuyq bing karôp manih xok xơu kung khơl manih kadrơy đong 'ngôôy măn para xa kung dii oot. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" />Măn kaluh manih pha-ri-si ji thơy pato ganuun ku oot ramôôl xôôl dii khơl xatyauq ku Kadraq, đaneq: “Vii kơq kajoq đơu khơl kơy xa hôôch achung dii khơl xok xơu ji khơl adro kadrôôp maroh?” <verse eid="LUK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Xôq tơơl hlê, Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii oot: “Manih kalh paraat leh e varơuq duh truh thơy jarơơu, bơh manih jiq jiêh yôôych duh. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />Gô leh truh xôq tawooyh taayh manih hyioh jăk, đơu laa adro e kadrôôp truh dii varơuq wiit xuum.”<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />Bơh yôôch, oot đnooy dii Kadraq: “Khơl xatyauq ku Jăng ragơy deek xa ji tơơk tưp kaluh apok xadrook apôôy, khơl xatyauq ku manih Pha-ri-si kung anưq. Măn manih ku khơl kơy kưq xa dii hôôch.” <verse eid="LUK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Kadraq tơơl kung oot: “Êêp kơy lưp hnoq ik rôp 'wơyq jưq waal pajêêk nhiinq xa đom tuôôy koot ok đong măn dii oot, jơq be? <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Bơh dik hnoq truh hngơy tuôôy đơu koot ok jah xagook hooy klơlh oot. Tuôôy nưq, muut kaluh hngơy nưq, oot hnoq deek xa.” <verse eid="LUK 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Yôôch Kadraq kung taboon ka oot muuyq kadook atoh đaneq: “Leh kơyq kaval tol poop aau duut apek vaayh chieh vlôh xing poop aau đơơu. Bơh atoh dơơp anưq, yôôych hnoq phaq tahyaak aau đơơu, ji apek vaayh đơu xok xing aau đơơu kung hnoq leh tamuut dii aau duut. <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />Ji leh kơyq tađnưk lok đơơu đom bơu kađuh duut. Bơh atoh dơơp anưq, yôôych lok đơơu hnoq dơơp vadah bơu kađuh, lok hnoq hoot vlôh pi gôk, bơu kung hnoq biq hư. <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Wih hlê, pheq tađnưk lok đơơu đom bơu kađuh đơơu. <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />Atêq tuôôy hôôch lok duut, leh kơyq trôôch lok đơơu, vii adro nưq đnooy đaneq: ‘Lok duut laa juq iaq.’”<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />Varơuq xalih vlôh muut muuyq hngơy Sa-bat, Lôôk Jê-xu đong hooy dalơh kaluh manay va qwaay, ji khơl xatyauq Kadraq kađnek 'môôk va, raniaq tol ti, yôôch xa. <verse eid="LUK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Bơh taleq dro Pha-ri-si đnooy: “Aleq khơl ay dơơp varơuq leh ik ăm pheep đom hngơy Sa-bat?” <verse eid="LUK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />Tuôôy tơơl apok oot, Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy kung oot: “Khơl kơy koq hmưq đok truh varơuq đơu Đa-vik heq dơơp tuôôy vuua ji khơl adro măn kung vuua biq pangoot ih? <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" />Đaleq vuua heq muut đom hnhư Kơy Plêêk, xok tôôp tơơk tưp, vuua xa ji ahlook ka khơl adro kung hooy dii vuua, đơu tôôp nưq leh ik pheep xa, đêh vlôh đôôyq dii khơl thơy tơơk tưp đơu heq.” <verse eid="LUK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Yôôch Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Koot Manih laa Lôôk ku hngơy Sa-bat.”<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Varơuq xalih vlôh muut muuyq hngơy Sa-bat kadrơy, Kadraq muut đom hnhư hơu xôq pato dayq, ji aduq nưq e muuyq dro khơl kanau, pla ti akoh ku ay nưq biq kavăp. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Măn khơl thơy pato ganuun ji manih Pha-ri-si 'yo atrêêk tavooy tyauq Kadraq, 'yo Kadraq e paxêêk yơh đom hngơy Sa-bat be, xôq oot axek jah kơq rôp kadrôôp Kadraq. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Bơh Kadraq xet varơuq biit ku oot, yôôch Kadraq đnooy dii adro biq kavăp ti: “Dayh dưk tok ji vlôh dưk măn katul tôôy adro.” Ay nưq dưk tok ji vlôh dưk đnư. <verse eid="LUK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii oot: “Gô vôôch êêp kơy, atoh troq tyauq ganuun đom hngơy Sa-bat yôôych dơơp kaxay long dơơp xơuq, wơơt riirh long păk kaxêêt yơu?” <verse eid="LUK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Atêq tuôôy 'yo tôôy adro gah gih, Kadraq đnooy dii ay nưq: “Dayh tơơk ti ku ay vlôh.” Ay dơơp tyauq ji ti ay jah paxêêk yơh. <verse eid="LUK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Bơh oot viik xuum tôq jaraq ji tajauq dii mamuuyq 'yo oot hnoq ik dơơp kajoq dii Lôôk Jê-xu.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />Varơuq xalih vlôh đom kaluh hngơy nưq, nưq laa Kadraq hooy tok gôk xôq xadrook apôôy, ji Kadraq heq parol klôôy mưng đom varơuq xadrook apôôy dii Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Tuôôy hngơy đơơu heq truh, Kadraq taayh khơl xatyauq kadraq, ji rơơlh kưl vaarq adro vlôh xing oot, đơu Kadraq kung taayh kưl vaarq adro nưq laa khơl jah rơơlh, anguk: <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />Si-môn, adro đơu Kadraq kung vlăk anơng laa Phi-e-rơ, oh kanau kơy laa Anh-rê, Ja-kơ, Jăng, Phi-lip, Ba-thê-lê-mi, <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />Ma-thi-ơ, Thô-ma, Jăng koot A-phê, Si-môn laa adro jah taayh laa Xê-lôt, <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />Ju-đa koot Ja-kơ, ji Ju-đa Ich-ka-ri-ôt laa adro jêêk vlôh adro xalih xuum. <verse eid="LUK 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Atêq tuôôy hooy pôôt dii oot, Kadraq dưk đnư muuyq aduq vari manay kling kung muuyq bing karôp khơl xatyauq Kadraq, ji bing manih dii sôôq manih karôp lơyq truh xing loch dêh Ju-đê ji Jê-ru-sa-lem, kung đaji dêh gah tahli Ti-rơ ji Si-đôn, <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />Khơl adro nưq heq truh xôq domq tameng Kadraq ji xôq jah payơh klơlh kaluh tăk bingq ku oot. Khơl adro biq kamuuych 'moh nhôp kung jah payơh. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />Dêq bing tamooy kưq axek kach avêq muut Kadraq vii taay yaak vlôh xing Kadraq ji payơh tôôy adro.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Yôôch Lôôk Jê-xu, 'ngơơk mot kadraq ngưưr truh khơl xatyauq ku Kadraq, ji đnooy: “Vanong ka oh ay laa manih adrah, vii daak dêh Kơy Plêêk laa ku oh ay. <verse eid="LUK 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />Vanong ka oh ay juneq đong pangoot, vii oh ay hnoq jah phiq phơh. Vanong ka oh ay juneq đong alo nhim, vii oh ay hnoq hlah xagiel. <verse eid="LUK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />Oh ay jah vanong tuôôy khơl drơy 'yarơ geet oh ay, tuôôy oot dơyh ka'lăk oh ay, đnooy axaap ji dơyh ka'lăk anơng oh ay đaji adro xơk tauq vii kơq Koot Manih. <verse eid="LUK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />Đom hngơy nưq, dayh hlah hlaak ji ayuch atok hlah hlaak vii, 'yo hơq, phon kadrool ku oh ay tol plêêk laa thier kôt, vii mo kơy ku oot heq xa dơơp dii khơl kơy hlit tyauq kach đanưq. <verse eid="LUK 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />Lunư, ra ơơh ka oh ay, laa adro karoh, vii oh ay heq nhonq varơuq hlơq hlôôp ku oh ay. <verse eid="LUK 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />Ra ơơh ka oh ay laa adro juneq đong phiq phơh, vii oh ay hnoq pangoot. Ra ơơh ka oh ay juneq đong xagiel ahrơh, vii oh ay hnoq jiq rơu ji alo nhim. <verse eid="LUK 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />Ra ơơh ka oh ay tuôôy tôôy adro raay đnooy tolh truh oh ay, vii mo kơy ku oot kung heq dơơp tyauq kach đanưq dii khơl kơy hlit pa ôôh.<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />Bơh gô đnooy dii oh ay, khơl adro đong domq tameng, dayh xiaq adro tachơơl oh ay ji dayh xa dơơp kach tolh kaxay dii adro 'yarơ oh ay. <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />Dayh chuk vanong ka khơl karoay axaap oh ay ji dayh xadrook apôôy ka adro dơơp ra ơơh oh ay. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />Đôôyq dii kơyq pađa oh ay aduq tavok piik neq, dayh ăm hloay tavok piik hơq, măn adro varoh xok aau pi gôk ku oh ay, yôôych oh ay kung te niiuq jư aau 'lăp klơlh adro nưq. <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />Paq kê kơyq apôôy xiin oh ay, dayh kahniq ăm, ji te vôôch hlê xing adro xok hloay tuôông kajoq ku oh ay. <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" />Oh ay trôôch khơl drơy dơơp ka oh ay đaleq, dayh dơơp ka oot đanưq. <verse eid="LUK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />Atoh oh ay xiaq khơl adro xiaq oh ay, yôôych nưq laa vanong kiêuh kajoq đôôyq dii oh ay? Vii hloay kaah khơl e kadrôôp kung xiaq adro xiaq oot. <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Atoh oh ay dơơp tolh dii adro dơơp tolh dii oh ay, yôôych nưq laa vanong kiêuh kajoq đôôyq dii oh ay? Adro e kadrôôp kung dơơp dang đanưq. <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />Atoh oh ay ăm khơl drơy xapo đơu oh ay takôô nhonq hlê xing oot, yôôych nưq laa vanong kiêuh kajoq đôôyq dii oh ay? Adro e kadrôôp kung ăm adro e kadrôôp xapo, xôq nhonq hlê dang đanưq. <verse eid="LUK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />Bơh dayh xiaq khơl tachơơl oh ay ji dơơp tolh dii oot, dayh ăm xapo tuôôy leh takôô nhonq hlê, yôôych phon kadrool ku oh ay hnoq laa thier kôt, oh ay hnoq laa koot ku Kơy Thier Yơơt, vii Kadraq măn hwêêt xuum đôôyq dii khơl lưp vanong ji xơk tauq. <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />Dayh e xuum biit angơuq, dang đaji Vaq ku oh ay e xuum biit angơuq. <verse eid="LUK 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />Te xưh xadrah, yôôych oh ay kajưk dik leh biq xưh xadrah. Te tok xadrah yôôych oh ay kajưk dik leh biq tok xadrah. Dayh tha ka'lăk, yôôych oh ay hnoq jah tha ka'lăk. <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />Dayh kahniq ăm, yôôych varơuq hnoq jah kahniq ka oh ay: muuyq phon hlơk hlơu klêq — jah dơơp kajưk, jah luk lăk ăm pôôt, jah athêêp ăm galaay viik — oot hnoq kliik muut thơơl aau oh ay. Vii oh ay hlơk mưk leq, yôôych mưk nưq hnoq jah hlơk hlê ka oh ay.”<verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />Kadraq kung taboon ka oot muuyq kadook atoh: “Manih apul leh e paraat jarooy trôôk manih apul, jơq be? Be aalq dêq vaarq raay hnoq gưlh pôôt raluk ih? <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" />Khơl xatyauq yôôych leh iaq thơy, bơh muuyq adro tuôôy jah pato dayq đu tol hnoq jêêk vlôh dang đaji thơy haay. <verse eid="LUK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />Aleq oh ay 'yo hloq apoop kachar đom mot muuyq oh ay haay, đơu oh ay leh nhonq vlôh talok gay đom mot ku haay? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Dơơp đaleq oh ay hnoq ik đnooy dii oh ay haay: ‘Ay lơơy, dayh xôq gô xok apoop kachar đom mot ay vlôh’ tuôôy xăk xamơk oh ay leh 'yo hloq talok gay đom mot ku haay? Adro xuum pa ôôh hơq! Adroyq dêq, dayh xok talok gay vlôh klơlh mot haay, yôôch oh ay đơơu 'yo hloq ro xôq xok apoop kachar đom mot oh ay haay. <verse eid="LUK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />Vii be e ưk ôôlh kaxay vlôh play xơuq, panưh kadrơy, kung be e ưk ôôlh xơuq vlôh play tolh. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />Xing muuyq ưk jah nhonq xet gamưh play ku ưk nưq. Manih nưq leh weelh play pok puut aduq pôôp jaliê, oot kung leh weelh nho aduq pôôp gay rơơk. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" />Manih kaxay jo varơuq tađnưk kaxay tamaq ku xuum klaak dơơp vlôh varơuq kaxay, măn adro xơk xing đom varơuq xơk dơơp vlôh varơuq xơk. Vii xing varơuq galơh galaay đom xuum đơu huuy xăk đnooy vlôh.<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />Aleq oh ay taayh gô: ‘Lôôk, Lôôk,’ đơu leh dơơp tyauq apok gô pato? <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />Gô hnoq ăm oh ay xet adro leq truh dii gô, tameng apok gô ji dơơp tyauq kaluh apok nưq yôôych dang kơyq. <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />Adro nưq dang đaji muuyq adro xơy hnhư, đơu manih neq heq akhwoar vari xiel jaruq ji dơơp xool tol talaat phơu. Nưq yôôch, tuôôy daak ngôp galaay truh, alook daak kaxuyh muut hnhư nưq, đơu ni leh hnoq anhưh anhưưy hnhư ik, vii hnhư heq jah xơy panưk kach jơq dik. <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Măn adro tameng đơu leh dơơp tyauq yôôych dang đaji muuyq adro xơy hnhư tol vari leh e kahnier xool, tuôôy alook daak ngôp muut hnhư nưq, ni hloay hrưp, ji varơuq hư hek ku apoop hnhư nưq laa thier kôt.”<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Atêq tuôôy Kadraq payôôch kaluh apok ku kadraq kangưưr varơuq domq tameng ku manih karôp, Kadraq muut đom theng Ka-bê-na-um.<verse eid="LUK 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Tuôôy nưq, muuyq adro xapok hơq ku kơy xakaq kuun, đơu nưq laa adro thier xung xiaq đôôyq dii kơy, đong biq jiq thier năngq, jeq kaxêêt. <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Atêq tuôôy tameng truh Lôôk Jê-xu, kơy patăk khơl kadraq lơơk Jo Thaiq truh kung Kadraq, apôôy xiin Kadraq truh xôq Kadraq paxêêk yơh xapok ku kơy. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Tuôôy khơl adro nưq truh dii Lôôk Jê-xu, oot dêq xuum apôôy xiin Kadraq, tơơl đaneq: “Kơy nưq yôôych xưngq đangq xôq thơy hnoq dơơp ik varơuq neq ka kơy, <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />vii kơy xung xiaq tamooy haay, kơy kung heq xơy hnhư hơu ka haay.” <verse eid="LUK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Nưq yôôch, Lôôk Jê-xu hooy kung dii oot. Bơh tuôôy Kadraq heq măn kach aduq apoop hnhư leh xangưưy, yôôych kơy xakaq kuun atăq taleq dro 'wơyq truh tơơl dii Kadraq: “Kuh Lôôk, xiin te kadih tagay khoq xăk, vii gô leh xưngq đangq xôq Kadraq truh 'laarq apo hnhư gô. <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />Kadih vii anưq, gô pheq đnooy kung leh hloq gô xưngq đangq xôq truh tavơh Kadraq. Lunư, xiin Kadraq xanoh muuyq apok, yôôych xapok gô pheq jah yơh bingq. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Vii gô kung laa adro jah xôq 'laarq da uh qwuyen, đơu e kuun 'laarq qwuyen ku gô, ji gô dăt adro neq: ‘hooy yuh,’ yôôych ni hooy; yôôch dii adro hơq: ‘Truh đnen,’ yôôych ni truh; ji dii xapok gô: ‘Dayh dơơp varơuq neq,’ yôôych ni dơơp.” <verse eid="LUK 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Tuôôy Lôôk Jê-xu tameng đanưq, Kadraq thier tưng hưng truh kơy nưq, yôôch wih hlê manih karôp đong hooy tyauq xăk, Kadraq đnooy: “Gô đnooy dii oh ay, pheq đnooy aduq I-sơ-ra-ên, gô kung koq hmưq hloq xuum tuôq đanưq.” <verse eid="LUK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Tuôôy khơl adro jah patăk hooy xuq hlê truh hnhư, oot hloq dro xapok đong kalh paraat.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Varơuq xalih vlôh muut hngơy atêq, Kadraq hooy muut muuyq theng jah taayh laa Na-in, khơl xatyauq Kadraq ji bing manih thier karôp đong kung hooy dii Kadraq. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Hloay tuôôy Kadraq jeq truh 'mok theng yôôych 'yo hơq, oot đong xakôôk vlôh muuyq adro heq kaxêêt, laa koot kanau muuyq ku miq ni (mo laa mo valơu), muuyq bing thier 'ngưng manih karôp đom theng kung hooy dii mo. <verse eid="LUK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Tuôôy 'yo hloq mo, Lôôk arơơk xuum manưưt angơuq deng ka mo, ji Kadraq đnooy dii mo: “Te nhim.” <verse eid="LUK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Hooy truh jeq, Kadraq avêq ti muut vook, yôôych khơl adro đong xakôôk dưk hlê. Yôôch Kadraq đnooy: “Adro kanau blaay, gô dăt nhu, dayh kah 'ngôôy.” <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Manih kaxêêt kah 'ngôôy ji xarôp athêêk, Yôôch Kadraq atăq nhu ka miq ku nhu. <verse eid="LUK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Nưq laa, varơuq varaal yôq kariik aklum dêq hloay, oot ayuôôt laat Kơy Plêêk, đnooy đaneq: “Muuyq kơy hlit kôt galơh heq jah dưk tok đom katul haay” ji đaneq: “Kơy Plêêk heq truh hlơq tamooy Kadraq.” <verse eid="LUK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Hêêl neq truh Kadraq ahna vlôh loch dêq dêh Ju-đê ji tôôy dêh gah gih.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />Khơl xatyauq ku Jăng taboon hlê ka kơy truh tôôy varơuq nưq. Ji atêq tuôôy ăm taayh vaarq adro xatyauq nưq ku kơy, yôôych Jăng <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />patăk oot truh dii Lôôk, tơơl: “Thơy laa Kơy pheq truh, long 'wot duh takôô Kơy kadrơy?” <verse eid="LUK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Tuôôy truh dii Kadraq, khơl adro nưq tơơl: “Jăng Bap-tit patăk 'wot truh dii Thơy, tơơl: ‘Thơy laa Kơy pheq truh, long 'wot duh takôô Kơy kadrơy?’” <verse eid="LUK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Muut jơq wat nưq, Kadraq payơh 'ngưng manih klơlh bingq tăk, jiq jiêh ji kamuuych 'moh, Kadraq kung khienq 'ngưng manih apul jah 'yo hloq. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />Xôq tơơl apok, Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Atêq tuôôy wiit xuq, dayh taboon hlê ka Jăng kaluh kajoq khơl ay heq hloq ji tameng: manih apul jah hloq tađnah hlê, manih taqwauq tawaak hooy, manih paruh jah xarêh, manih klơk tameng hlolh, manih kaxêêt jah khienq riirh hlê, manih adrah jah tameng hêêl kaxay, <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />ji vanong ka adro leq leh biq xatôôlh lôp vii gô.”<verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Xatyauq đnoyq, atêq tuôôy khơl xatyauq ku Jăng hooy yôôch, Kadraq xarôp đnooy dii bing manih truh Jăng: “Oh ay hooy muut đom wăngq we xôq 'yo kajoq? Muuyq ưk kadeer biq khiel ahrưng ih? <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Wih hlê, oh ay hooy vlôh xôq 'yo kajoq? Muuyq adro jah xa vâk bơơn vaayh lanh ih? 'Yo hơq, khơl adro đom hlưp qwuân aau kaxay dik ji riirh karoh e yôôych măn đom hnhư vuua. <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Nưq bơh, oh ay hooy vlôh xôq 'yo kajoq? Muuyq kơy hlit ih? Jơq, gô đnooy dii oh ay, măn iaq muuyq kơy hlit đnoyq. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" />Nưq laa truh kơy đơu apok neq heq jah valơk:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">‘Nee, Gô patăk adro jah patăk Gô hooy pi adroyq kangưưr Koot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">adro hnoq deep trôôk ku Koot kangưưr Koot.’<verse eid="LUK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />Gô đnooy ka oh ay xet, đom sôôq khơl adro jo khơl drê pa iir vlôh, leh kơyq laa kôt iaq Jăng, bơh adro de dik đom daak dêh Kơy Plêêk yôôych kôt iaq kơy nưq.” <verse eid="LUK 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />(Tuôôy heq domq tameng, yôôych tôôy adro, kê kaah khơl adro xok xơu, raay xưng Kơy Plêêk laa hyioh jăk, tuôôy chiuq bap-tem tyauq pheep bap-tem ku Jăng. <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Bơh khơl manih Pha-ri-si ji khơl thơy pato ganuun heq chôôyq ka'lăk iq đinq ku Kơy Plêêk deng ka oot, tuôôy leh chiuq kơy dơơp bap-tem.) <verse eid="LUK 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />“Nưq yôôych, gô hnoq taso khơl manih thuôk adrơơk neq dii kajoq neq? Oot dang đaji kơyq? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Oot dang đaji bing oh de 'ngôôy aduq tabôôt xa, pariau taayh mamuuyq, oot đnooy: ‘Bing 'wot klôôp taliaq ka êêp đơu êêp leh ayuch ayauq. Bing 'wot kacheeu baai hlu rơu đơu êêp be nhim alo.’ <verse eid="LUK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />Vii Jăng Bap-tit heq truh, leh xa tôôp, kung be hôôch lok, yôôych khơl kơy đnooy: ‘Kơy nưq biq kamuuych nhôp.’ <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Koot Manih heq truh, xa ji hôôch, yôôych khơl kơy dăt: ‘'Yo hơq, muuyq adro ka aak xa ji giel hôôch, khơl 'wơyq ku khơl xok xơu ji bing manih e kadrôôp!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Bơh varơuq khôôt xet heq jah đnooy hyioh bơyh dêq hloay koot xau ku ni.”<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />Tuôôy nưq, muuyq đom sôôq khơl manih Pha-ri-si mơơy Kadraq xôq xa waal dii kơy. Tuôôy heq muut đom hnhư manih Pha-ri-si nưq, Kadraq 'ngôôy aduq para xa. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />'Yo hơq, e muuyq khơl kadrê đom theng, đơu mư nưq laa adro e kadrôôp. Tuôôy nhonq xet đaneq Kadraq đong 'ngôôy aduq para xa măn ma hnhư manih Pha-ri-si, mư xagook xatyauq muuyq kave ngok tađnưk jơu thơơm, <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />ji truh dưk piik katoor, jeq aduq jôôk Kadraq, đơu nhim. Mư xarôp dơơp voq jôôk Kadraq bơơn daak mot, yôôch mư 'nhuôôt ni dii kapoyh hlôôk tol akoq mư, hiip jôôk Kadraq ji para jơu thơơm tok. <verse eid="LUK 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Tuôôy manih Pha-ri-si, laa manih heq mơơy Kadraq, hloq anưq, kơy nưq kadih biit, đaneq: “Atoh kơy neq laa hnhư kơy hlit, yôôych kơy nưq dik pheq xet khơl kadrê đơu đong avêq truh kơy laa kơyq ji thuôk khơl manih leq, đaneq mư nưq laa adro kadrôôp maroh.” <verse eid="LUK 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Xôq tơơl hlê, Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii kơy: “Si-môn, gô e varơuq neq xôq đnooy dii kơy.” Kơy nưq đnooy: “Thơy lơơy, xiin kưq đnooy!” <verse eid="LUK 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />“E vaarq koot thiuq ku muuyq adro ăm xapo jêêt nưq. Muuyq dro thiuq dăp hreek Đơ-ni-ê, măn adro hơq thiuq dăp kưl. <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Tuôôy oot raay leh e xôq bla, kôôch lôôkq heq tha ka dêq vaarq. Nưq yôôych, kơyq đom sôôq vaarq adro hnoq xung xiaq kơy nưq iaq?” <verse eid="LUK 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Tuôôy Si-môn ăm vlôh apok tơơl, kơy đnooy: “Gô dik biit đaneq adro đơu kôôch lôôkq heq tha 'ngưng iaq.” Kadraq đnooy dii kơy: “Kơy đnooy jơq dik.” <verse eid="LUK 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Yôôch wih hlê pi adro kadrê, Kadraq đnooy dii Si-môn: “Kơy hloq adro kadrê neq be? Gô muut đom hnhư ku kơy. Kơy leh ăm gô daak 'nhaau jôôk, măn mư dơơp voq jôôk gô bơơn daak mot, yôôch 'nhuôôt ni dii kapoyh hlôôk ku mư. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />Kơy heq leh ăm gô poop hiip leq, măn mư, xing tuôôy gô hooy muut, heq leh padơy hiip jôôk gô. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />Kơy be para jơu tol akoq gô, măn mư heq para jôôk gô dii jơu thơơm. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Vii kơq nưq, gô đnooy dii kơy, kadrôôp maroh ku mư, ju 'ngưng, heq jah tha ka'lăk, vii mư xung xiaq 'ngưng. Măn kơyq jah tha ka'lăk axit yôôych xung xiaq axit.” <verse eid="LUK 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Yôôch Kadraq dăt mư nưq: “Kadrôôp maroh mư heq jah tha ka'lăk.” <verse eid="LUK 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Khơl adro đong 'ngôôy aduq para xa xarôp tajauq katul wat oot: “Adro neq laa kơyq đơu kung tha kadrôôp?” <verse eid="LUK 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Yôôch Kadraq đnooy dii adro kadrê: “Xuum tuôq ku mư heq wơơt mư. Dayh hooy đom hrok hrol.”<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Varơuq xalih vlôh muut đom kawat hloay atêq nưq, Kadraq măn kưq dưk tok hooy hlê theng neq, palơy hơq, pato dayq kung đaji padoh taboon hêêl kaxay truh daak dêh ku Kơy Plêêk, ji kưl vaarq adro jah rơơlh hooy dii Kadraq, <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />kung muuyq sôôq khơl kadrê hơq laa khơl adro heq jah paxêêk yơh klơlh kamuuych ting ji bingq tăk: Ma-ri, manih jah taayh laa Ma-đơ-len, đơu xing mư e pơh kamuuych xơuq heq vlôh klơlh; <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />Jan-nơ kadrê Chu-xa, adro xakaq ku Hê-rôt; Xu-xa-nơ; ji 'ngưng khơl kadrê kadrơy; oot hơu varơuq nhomq ku Kadraq bơơn kaluh garuh anôôp oot đong e.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Tuôôy bing manih karôp anguk hlê xing kaluh theng hooy truh kung Lôôk Jê-xu, Kadraq đnooy pato bơơn kadook atoh: <verse eid="LUK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />“Muuyq adro paraay adrek hooy vlôh xôq paraay kalook adrek ku ni, ji đom tuôôy ay nưq paraay, muuyq sôôq kalook adrek klêh pi trôôk, biq joaq 'laarq jôôk ji xêêp plêêk vok dêq sôôq kalook nưq. <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />Sôôq kalook kadrơy klêh tol phơu, lunưq tuôôy vlok tok, sôôq nưq biq kateh ha'yauq, vii be e hơơy xa uuh. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Sôôq kadrơy đnoyq klêh muut katul pôôp jaliê, yôôch tuôôy vlok tok, yôôych jaliê dơơp ka ni hach hwaal. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Ji muuyq sôôq kalook kadrơy klêh muut aduq vari kaxay, lunưq tuôôy kôt tok, ni vlôh play gôp hreek yưk iaq.” Atêq tuôôy đnooy payôôch kaluh apok nưq, Kadraq taayh tok: “Kơyq e tôôr xôq tameng, dayh tameng.”<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Atêq nưq, khơl xatyauq ku Kadraq vôôch Kadraq: “Kadook atoh nưq laa aleq?” <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />Kadraq tơơl: “Oh ay heq jah kahniq vanong xôq hlolh xet kaluh varơuq hmưq kadook truh daak dêh ku Kơy Plêêk, bơh dii khơl drơy yôôych xok kadook atoh, xôq ‘tuôôy 'yo, oot leh hloq, ji tuôôy tameng, oot leh hlolh.’ <verse eid="LUK 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />Kadook atoh nưq laa đaneq: Kalook adrek laa đaauq ku Kơy plêêk. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Kaluh aduq tol trôôk laa khơl adro heq tameng, bơh atêq nưq kamuuych truh ji varoh xok đaauq klơlh xuum oot hlơu ka oot leh tuôq xôq jah wơơt. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Kaluh aduq tol phơu pato truh khơl adro tuôôy oot heq tameng, yôôych dii varơuq hlah hlaak, oot nhonq xok đaauq. Bơh oot leh e rayah, 'ngưq laa khơl adro vơ tuôq muuyq kawah, ji đom tuôôy rôp toop, yôôych oot ka'lăk. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Măn truh muuyq sôôq kalook heq klêh katul kaluh pôôp jaliê, yôôych aduq neq laa khơl adro heq tameng, yôôch tuôôy ratuut tawaak hooy đom đơơy oot, oot biq dơơp ka hach hwaal xing kaluh lo biit, varơuq karoh kariêp ji agưt agooh đơơy neq, ji oot leh kôt tok ik. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />Bơh truh phon klong adrek tol vari kaxay, neq laa khơl adro dii xuum klaak dong dik ji kaxay iq, atêq tuôôy tameng đaauq yôôych oot jư kajưk xok ji vlôh play đom varơuq wêêt xuum.<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />Atêq tuôôy ataak đeen, be kơyq up ni hlê bơơn đêêk long xôq 'laarq chanưng. Tađôôy muut đnư, oot xôq ni taalh jôôk đeen xôq khơl manih tawaak muut hnoq ik 'yo hloq xaraar tađnah. <verse eid="LUK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />Vii be e varơuq kajoq ik kadook kinq đơu hnoq leh biq kahnoq vlôh, kung be e padu kadook leq đơu kajưk dik leh biq tauq vlôh ji kahnoq vlôh ro raang. <verse eid="LUK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />Lunưq, dayh rơơt rol truh kach oh ay tameng, vii kơyq e hnoq jah ăm athêêp, măn kơyq leh e, pheq đnooy varơuq adro nưq biit ni e kung hnoq biq xok hloay klơlh ni.”<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Tuôôy nưq miq ji khơl oh Kadraq truh dii Kadraq, bơh oot leh hnoq truh jeq Kadraq ik vii kơq bing karôp. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Yôôch, varơuq nưq jah tauq ka Kadraq: “Miq thơy kung khơl oh ku thơy đong dưk pi gôk, xung tavơh thơy.” <verse eid="LUK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Bơh tuôôy tơơl apok, Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Neq laa miq gô ji oh ay gô, laa khơl adro tameng ji dơơp tyauq apok Kơy Plêêk.”<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Varơuq xalih vlôh muut muuyq hngơy hơq, Kadraq kung dii khơl xatyauq ku kadraq tawaak tok muuyq poop ge, ji Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Haay duh pheq hooy hlê gah hlôôk pi hơq.” Yôôch oot tok ge hooy. <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Đom tuôôy oot awaayh ge yôôych Kadraq vik. Kaplah nưq, muuyq đơơt khiel kaxơlh puh kaxuh klôôp pôôt tol tahli hlôôk, oot biq daak muut viit ge ji thier pơơl hwơơl. <verse eid="LUK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Oot truh jeq nhơk Kadraq kah, đaneq: “Thơy lơơy! Thơy lơơy! Haay jeq kaxêêt!” Bơh tuôôy Kadraq kadrăch kah, Kadraq toah khiel ji daak ralaaq kahlôôp, yôôych ni langưm hlê ji varơuq nưq jêêk vlôh langưưp hnhep. <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Xuum tuôq ku oh ay ka'leq?” Đom varơuq varaal yôq, oot tưng hưng đnooy kung mamuuyq: “Yôôch dik thơy laa kơyq đơu thơy vlôh tanưưl ka kaah khiel dii daak, ji ni pheq tameng tyauq thơy?”<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Yôôch oot awaayh ge truh dêh Jê-ra-sê, laa aduq măn tahyioh dii dêh Ga-li-lê. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Tuôôy Kadraq tawaak tok gah, muuyq adro nưq thuôk theng nưq hooy vlôh klơl Kadraq, adro nưq biq kamuuych nhôp. Heq muuyq kawat xiik, ay nưq leh hlưp qwuân aau, kung leh riirh đom hnhư, bơh măn aduq kalo xanưng. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Tuôôy 'yo hloq Lôôk Jê-xu, ay nưq alo tok, kul pôôt kangưưr Kadraq ji đnooy kalh xarooy: “Kuh, Jê-xu, Koot Kơy Plêêk Thier Yơơt, gô dii Kadraq e huq apiq kajoq? Gô apôôy Kadraq, xiin te dơơp ra ơơh gô.” <verse eid="LUK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />Vii Kadraq heq vlôh tanưưl ka kamuuych 'moh hooy vlôh klơlh adro khơl kanau nưq. Bơyh 'ngưng yưk ni nhôp muut ay, măn ay 'miêh heq biq kal hlê bơơn looy tooy ji kal, long ăm biq jư 'yo, yôôych bơyh kamuuych, tôôy tuôôy parach kloh kal, ay biq jarooy taluq muut wăngq we. <verse eid="LUK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Tuôôy nưq, Lôôk Jê-xu vôôch ni: “Anơng may laa kajoq?” Ni tơơl: “Kuun Karôp,” vii 'ngưng kamuuych heq nhôp muut ay nưq. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Yôôch oot kưq apôôy xiin Kadraq xôq Kadraq te vlôh tanưưl ka oot pheq hooy pôôt bơk jaruq. <verse eid="LUK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Aduq nưq e muuyq bơy xuur thier karôp đong xa tol ahmaat adroay, oot xiin Kadraq xôq Kadraq ăm pheep oot nhôp muut bơy xuur. Ji Kadraq ăm pheep oot. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Nưq laa, tuôôy heq vlôh klơlh adro khơl kanau, kaluh kamuuych nhôp muut bơy xuur, yôôch dêq bơy kuu akoq charơơk tyauq ahmaat bơk kalong pôôt hlôôk ji biq kaxêêt karăp. <verse eid="LUK 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Atêq tuôôy khơl adro ajư xuur dưk xanưk kaluh varơuq vơơ xalih vlôh, yôôych oot xadăk klôônq ji taboon hlê varơuq nưq đom theng hloay đom ma dêh katu. <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Lunưq, manih karôp garuk truh xôq 'yo varơuq heq xalih vlôh, oot truh aduq Lôôk Jê-xu ji hloq adro khơl kanau, đơu kaluh kamuuych heq vlôh klơlh, đong 'ngôôy aduq jôôk Lôôk Jê-xu, jah hlưp qwuân aau, ji akoq ngook talăng jăk, yôôych oot biq varaal hwaal. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Khơl adro heq dưk xanưk taboon hlê ka oot kach leq đơu manih biq kamuuych nhôp heq jah wơơt yơh. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Hloay bing karôp đom dêh Jê-ra-sê xiin Kadraq chuh klơlh oot, vii oot biq đơơt varaal hwaal paq ik wi kajưk. Lunưq, Kadraq tawaak tok ge ji wiit xuq. <verse eid="LUK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Adro khơl kanau, đơu kaluh kamuuych heq vlôh klơlh, apôôy xiin Kadraq xôq măn kung Kadraq, bơh Kadraq ăm ay xuq, đnooy đaneq: <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />“Dayh wiit xuq aduq hnhư ku ay ji dayh taboon hlê tôôy varơuq Kơy Plêêk heq dơơp ka ay.” Yôôch ay dưk hooy padoh loch dêq theng tôôy varơuq Lôôk Jê-xu heq dơơp ka ni.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Tuôôy Lôôk Jê-xu wiit xuq, muuyq bing manih karôp đoonq tiip Kadraq, vii tôôy adro raay đong takôô Kadraq. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Ji 'yo hơq, muuyq adro tawaak truh, anơng ku kơy laa Jai-ru, kơy laa adro jư 'yo hnhư hơu. Kuu pôôt aduq jôôk Lôôk Jê-xu, kơy apôôy xiin Kadraq hooy truh hnhư kơy, <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />vii adro koot kadrê vơ muuyq đôôyq dii kơy, kơh kưl vaarq xanưm, oh nga đong hoot heet kađơơh. Tuôôy Kadraq đong hooy tol trôôk, bing manih karôp hnen hnek rawiit Kadraq.<verse eid="LUK 8:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />E muuyq mư kadrê dii biq bingq be drơy heq kưl vaarq xanưm, long heq tayuh dêq jêêt baak ka thơy jarơơu, đơu be e paq kê kơyq hnoq payơh ik bingq ka mư. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />Bơơn kach truh jeq xing piik katoor, mư avêq muut thơơl aau ku Kadraq, ji hloay jơnưq, bingq be drơy ku mư dưk hlê. <verse eid="LUK 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy: “Kơyq laa dro heq avêq muut gô?” Bơh kơyq nưq raay leh nhonq, Phi-e-rơ tơơl apok: “Thơy lơơy, bing karôp manih đong wi rawiit ji hnen hnek thơy.” <verse eid="LUK 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Bơh Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy: “Muuyq kơyq nưq heq avêq muut thơy, vii thơy xet taay yaak xing thơy heq hooy vlôh.” <verse eid="LUK 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Tuôôy nưq, tuôôy adro khơl kadrê nhonq hloq đaneq mư heq leh padu kadook ik, yôôych mư padrau tahrik tawaak truh ji atêq tuôôy kuu xăk pôôt kangưưr Kadraq, mư tauq vlôh kangưưr dêq hloay manih karôp vii kakơq kajoq đơu mư heq avêq muut Kadraq ji mư heq jah payơh hloay jơnưq đaleq. <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Kadraq đnooy dii mư: “Koot kadrê lơơy, xuum tuôq ku koot heq payơh koot. Dayh hooy đom varơuq hrok hrol.”<verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Tuôôy Kadraq măn đong đnooy, kơyq nưq xing hnhư ku manih dưk jư hnhư hơu truh tauq đaneq: “Koot kadrê kơy heq kaxêêt. Te dơơp ngơyq thơy đnoyq.” <verse eid="LUK 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Bơh tuôôy Lôôk Jê-xu tameng apok nưq, Kadraq tơơl kung kơy: “Te yôq, dayh e xuum tuôq đơu heq yôôych oh nga hnoq jah wơơt.” <verse eid="LUK 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Tuôôy heq hooy truh hnhư, Kadraq leh ăm kơyq muut dii Kadraq, đêh vlôh Phi-e-rơ, Jăng, Ja-kơ, kung vaq ji miq ku oh de. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Dêq hloay đong nhim ook ji tuk tada vii oh de, bơh Kadraq đnooy: “Te nhim, vii oh de koq kaxêêt, đơu vơ đong vik.” <verse eid="LUK 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Oot xagiel aklêêu Kadraq, vii xet đaneq adro de heq kaxêêt. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Bơh atêq tuôôy adrơk ti oh de, Kadraq taayh kalh, đaneq: “Oh nga lơơy, dayh kah yơu.” <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Phool hiel ku oh de wiit hlê ji oh de hloay jơnưq kah 'ngôôy, yôôch Kadraq dăt ăm oh de xa. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Miq vaq oh de thier kung dơơp akêh, bơh Kadraq patăk dăt oot leh đnooy dii kơyq truh varơuq heq xalih vlôh.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Atêq tuôôy taayh kưl vaarq adro jah rơơlh anguk hlê, Kadraq kahniq ka oot da uh, ji taay yaak galơh ataalh dêq hloay kaluh kamuuych ji xôq payơh bingq, <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />yôôch Kadraq patăk oot vlôh hooy xôq padoh taboon truh daak dêh Kơy Plêêk ji xôq payơh manih bingq. <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Te xok tyauq thưq kajoq ka varơuq hooy — leh gay, leh droong, leh tôôp, leh baak — kung te xagook tyauq vaarq poop aau. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Oh ay muut đom hnhư leq, dayh măn aduq đnư ji dayh xing nư vlôh hooy. <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />Đom dong varơuq aduq leq đơu oot leh tawooyh oh ay, yôôych tuôôy chuh klơlh theng nưq, dayh tapolh thul klơlh jôôk oh ay đaji apok xanưk tachơơl kung oot.” <verse eid="LUK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Nưq laa tuôôy dưk hooy, khơl jah rơơlh hooy dalơh kaluh palơy pla, padoh taboon hêêl kaxay ji payơh jiq jiêh loch aduq.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />Tuôôy vuua dưk xanok Hê-rôt tek truh tôôy varơuq đong xalih vlôh, kơy nưq thier xôôl dôôl, vii apok taleq adro đnooy đaneq Jăng heq xing aduq kaxêêt riirh hlê, <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />bơh muuyq sôôq yôôych đnooy đaneq Ê-li heq rama vlôh, măn sôôq kadrơy ăm đaneq muuyq đom khơl kơy hlit tuôôy hnu heq riirh hlê. <verse eid="LUK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Bơh Hê-rôt đnooy: “Gô heq dool akoq Jăng yôôch, măn adro neq laa kơyq đơu gô tek kaluh varơuq đanưq truh kơy?” Yôôch kơy nưq axek kach tavơh Kadraq.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />Tuôôy khơl jah rơơlh heq wiit xuq, oot taboon hlê ka Kadraq xet kaluh varơuq oot heq dơơp. Ji atêq tuôôy jarooy oot kung hooy, Kadraq kadih wiit xuq muuyq theng jah taayh laa Bêt-sai-đa. <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Bơh tuôôy bing manih karôp nhonq vlôh ik, yôôych oot hooy tyauq Kadraq. Kadraq tawooyh đoonq oot, padoh vlôh ka oot truh daak dêh Kơy Plêêk, ji Kadraq paxêêk khơl adro duh jah payơh. <verse eid="LUK 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Hngơy jeq yôôp klôôy, tuôôy nưq, tuôôy kưl vaarq dro jah rơơlh hooy truh, oot tơơl dii Kadraq: “Xiin thơy pachaay bing manih xôq tuôôy hooy muut đom kaluh palơy ji dêh katu gah gih đnen, oot hnoq ik axek aduq măn ji tuôông xa, vii kađnen, haay đong măn katul muuyq aduq wăngq we.” <verse eid="LUK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Lunư, Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Oh ay dayh ăm oot xa.” Bơh oot tơơl: “Be e thưq kajoq aduq 'wot 'ngưng iaq dăp poop tôôp ji vaarq poop kaa — đêh vlôh 'wot hooy root tuôông xa ka sôôq manih karôp neq.” <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />(Vii e kơh dăp ravơu khơl kanau.) Kadraq đnooy dii khơl xatyauq kadraq: “Dayh dăt oot 'ngôôy pôôt xôq xa tyauq tưng bing, kơh dăp kưl dro.” <verse eid="LUK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Oot dơơp tyauq đanưq, ăm dêq bing karôp 'ngôôy pôôt xôq xa. <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Atêq tuôôy xok dăp poop tôôp ji vaarq poop kaa, 'ngơơk mot tok plêêk, Kadraq kuh kway truh tuôông xa nưq, yôôch pleh vlôh, palo ăm khơl xatyauq xôq aklah ahlook ka bing karôp. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Dêq hloay raay xa phiq phơh, ji kaluh kajoq măn raah jah tagoop tôôch ka oot laa kưl vaarq đêêk tôôp tapleh.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Varơuq xalih vlôh đom tuôôy Kadraq đong xadrook apôôy đêh, khơl xatyauq 'miêh hooy raa dii Kadraq, yôôych Kadraq vôôch oot đaneq: “Manih karôp đnooy thơy laa kơyq?” <verse eid="LUK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />Tuôôy bla apok, oot tơơl: “Laa Jăng Bap-tit, măn sôôq kadrơy đnooy thơy laa Ê-li, bơh sôôq kadrơy đnoyq đnooy thơy laa muuyq đom khơl kơy hlit tuôôy hnu riirh hlê.” <verse eid="LUK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />Yôôch Kadraq vôôch oot đnoyq: “Măn oh ay đnooy thơy laa kơyq?” Tuôôy nưq, tuôôy Phi-e-rơ bla apok, kơy tơơl: “Thơy laa Kơy Wơơt Dêh ku Kơy Plêêk.” <verse eid="LUK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Bơh xôq kơmq oot, Kadraq patăk dăt leh ik taboon varơuq neq dii kơyq, <verse eid="LUK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />tuôôy đnooy đaneq: “Koot Manih pheq chiuq 'ngưng pơơl dal, biq khơl draq lơơk, khơl thơy tơơk tưp kôt, ji khơl thơy pato ganuun ka'lăk, yôôch hnoq biq păk kaxêêt, ji truh hngơy thưq pe hnoq riirh hlê.” <verse eid="LUK 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Yôôch Kadraq đnooy dii dêq hloay oot: “Atoh kơyq xung hooy tyauq thơy yôôych pheq ka'lăk xăk, tôôy hngơy hlôôy gay charăk xăk ji tyauq thơy. <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" />Vii atoh kơyq xung wơơt varơuq riirh xăk yôôych adro nưq hnoq hlơơp ni, măn atoh kơyq vii thơy chiuq hlơơp varơuq riirh ku xăk, yôôych adro nưq hnoq wơơt jah ni. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />Vii muuyq adro jah ich lơơy kajoq, tuôôy e dêq dêh araak, bơh laay kadih păk kaxêêt long dơơp hlơơp kadih xăk? <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />Vii atoh kơyq kamưưl truh thơy ji apok ku thơy, yôôych Koot Manih hnoq kamưưl truh adro nưq tuôôy Kadraq truh đom tađnah tađnaak ku kadraq, kung ku Vaq ji ku khơl kơy yaak vah. <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Bơh dong dik, thơy đnooy dii oh ay, e toleq dro đom khơl manih đong dưk đnen, laa khơl manih kajưk dik hnoq leh hmưq tavơh varơuq kaxêêt dong truh tuôôy oot hloq daak dêh Kơy Plêêk.”<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />Varơuq xalih vlôh kawah thơơm hngơy atêq kaluh apok nưq, tuôôy jarooy tyauq Phi-e-rơ kung Jăng ji Ja-kơ, Kadraq hooy tok tol đoot xôq xadrook apôôy. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Varơuq xalih vlôh tuôôy Kadraq đong xadrook apôôy, nưq laa kaphook ku mot Kadraq tađôôy đêh, ji qwuân aau ku Kadraq jêêk vlôh xaraar tađnah ko ploak. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />Ji hơq, vaarq adro đong tadooy athêêk kung Kadraq, nưq laa Môi-se ji Ê-li, <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />đơu oot jah nhonq vlôh đom tađnah tađnaak, đong đnooy truh varơuq vlôh hooy ku Kadraq, laa varơuq Kadraq jeq dơơp dong jêêk yuôôr aduq Jê-ru-sa-lem. <verse eid="LUK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Phi-e-rơ ji khơl adro kung dii kơy 'miêh đong thier lakôôp vik, bơh tuôôy vơơ kadrăch hlê, oot hloq tađnah tađnaak ku Kadraq ji vaarq adro đong dưk dii Kadraq. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Varơuq xalih vlôh tuôôy vaarq adro nưq vlôh hooy klơlh Kadraq, Phi-e-rơ đnoyq dii Lôôk Jê-xu: “Thơy lơơy, dik laa tolh ka haay xôq măn đnen, 'wot hnoq ik panưk pe poop pơ, muuyq poop ka thơy, muuyq ka Môi-se ji muuyq ka Ê-li.” (Kơy leh xet đong đnooy varơuq kajoq). <verse eid="LUK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Bơh tuôôy kơy đong đnooy đanưq, muuyq đum kluk rama vlôh ji kariik klum oot; oot varaal hwaal tuôôy oot muut pi 'lăp đum kluk. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Yôôch xing đom đum kluk ahna vlôh apok đnooy, đaneq: “Neq laa Koot Gô, laa Manih heq jah rơơlh. Dayh tameng Kadraq.” <verse eid="LUK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Tuôôy apok nưq dêq yôôych vơ măn hlê muuyq adro Lôôk Jê-xu. Oot raay hnhep, ji be kơyq taboon truh paq kê varơuq kajoq đơu oot heq hloq đom kaluh hngơy nưq.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Varơuq xalih vlôh muut hngơy atêq, tuôôy oot xing tol đoot pôôt, muuyq bing manih karôp truh tavơh Kadraq. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Ji 'yo hơq, muuyq adro xing bing karôp taayh kalh đaneq: “Thơy lơơy, xiin thơy 'yo truh koot kanau gô, vii ni laa koot kanau muuyq ku gô. <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />'Yo neq, muuyq garu xi rôp jư oh de ji oh de long tưng hưng alo tarok, yôôch ni pangơlh oh de kamalh kajưk kung xatyauq kamuh padriaap huuy. Ni dang đaji leh vlôh klơlh oh de, kưq dơơp ra ơơh oh de xataat xateek. <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Gô heq xiin khơl xatyauq ku thơy aleq ăm oot druyh ni hooy, bơh oot leh e da uh.” <verse eid="LUK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Tuôôy tơơl apok, Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy: “Wơơy lơơy muuyq đơơy adrơơk lưp tuôq ji xơk tauq, gô hnoq măn dii êêp ji chiuq uunq êêp ăm truh dong leq? Dayh jarooy koot kanau ay truh đnen.” <verse eid="LUK 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Vơơ tuôôy oh de truh, kamuuych pagưlh kalh ni pôôt vari ji khienq ni vlôh đơơt kamalh kajưk. Bơh Lôôk Jê-xu toah kamuuych ting ji paxêêk yơh oh de, yôôch Kadraq atăq ni hlê ka vaq ni. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Dêq hloay raay biq dơơp akêh adroyq taay yaak tađnah tađnaak ku Kơy Plêêk. Bơh đom tuôôy tôôy adro măn e đong tưng hưng adroyq tôôy varơuq Kadraq dơơp, yôôych Kadraq đnooy dii khơl xatyauq kadraq: <verse eid="LUK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />“Oh ay dayh xôq kaluh apok neq muut tôôr oh ay: Vii Koot Manih jeq biq rôp atăq muut ti khơl drơy.” <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Lunư, oot leh hlolh apok nưq ji varơuq neq 'miêh đong biq đơ kađoq đôôyq dii oot, lunưq oot be hlolh ik ni, oot laay yôq xôq thăk măk dii Kadraq truh apok nưq.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Atêq nưq, katul oot duôôl tok varơuq apleh tagêh xôq 'yo adro leq đom sôôq oot laa kôt nhưk. <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Bơh vii Lôôk Jê-xu xet varơuq jauq biit đom xuum oot, yôôych atêq tuôôy jarooy hlê muuyq oh de, Kadraq xôq oh de nưq pi gah Kadraq, <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />ji đnooy dii oot: “Atoh kơyq taayh yal thơy tiip oh de neq, yôôych adro nưq tiip thơy, ji atoh kơyq tiip thơy, yôôych adro nưq tiip Kơy heq patăk thơy. Vii adro leq laa de nhưk đom dêq hloay oh ay, yôôych adro nưq laa yơơt galơh nhưk.”<verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Tuôôy Jăng tơơl apok, kơy đnooy: “Thơy lơơy, 'wot hloq e manih taayh yal thơy đuôôy kamuuych ji 'wot heq klơl manih nưq hlê, vii manih nưq leh kung hooy achung dii haay.” <verse eid="LUK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Bơh Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii kơy: “Te đơ klơl, vii adro leq leh aalq laa tachơơl hlê dii oh ay yôôych dưk xuq pi oh ay.”<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Varơuq xalih vlôh laa tuôôy hngơy varơuq xagook tok plêêk ku Kadraq đong truh jeq, yôôych Kadraq đinq ngưưr xôq hooy truh theng Jê-ru-sa-lem. <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />Kadraq patăk khơl jah patăk hooy adroyq kangưưr Kadraq, ji tuôôy hooy, oot muut đom muuyq palơy pla ku manih Sa-ma-ri xôq ralauq palauq ka Kadraq. <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />Oot leh tiip đoonq Kadraq vii ngưưr ku Kadraq laa đong hooy truh Jê-ru-sa-lem. <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" />Khơl xatyauq laa Ja-kơ ji Jăng, tuôôy hloq đanưq, oot tơơl: “Kuh Lôôk, Kadraq e xung 'wot patăk ka ôôlh xing plêêk pôôt huur vuh oot be?” <verse eid="LUK 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Bơh atêq tuôôy wih hlê, Kadraq toah trek oot, <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />yôôch oot hooy hlê palơy kadrơy.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Tuôôy oot đong hooy tol trôôk, muuyq adro hơq tơơl dii Kadraq: “Gô hnoq tyauq thơy paq kê aduq leq thơy hooy.” <verse eid="LUK 9:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy kung ay nưq: “Xo karaak e troop ji xêêp plêêk e tapu, bơh Koot Manih leh e aduq angôôlh akoq.” <verse eid="LUK 9:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Kadraq đnooy dii muuyq adro kadrơy: “Dayh tyauq thơy.” Bơh adro nưq tơơl: “Kuh Lôôk, xiin ăm pheep gô hooy vlôh xôq up vaq gô adroyq.” <verse eid="LUK 9:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Bơh Kadraq đnooy dii ay nưq: “Dayh xôq khơl manih kaxêêt up deep khơl manih kaxêêt ku oot. Măn tuôôy ay hooy vlôh, dayh padoh taboon daak dêh ku Kơy Plêêk.” <verse eid="LUK 9:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />Nưq yôôch, muuyq adro kadrơy đnoyq đnooy: “Kuh Lôôk, gô hnoq tyauq Kadraq, bơh adroyq dêq xiin ăm pheep gô xuq patek khơl manih đom hnhư gô.” <verse eid="LUK 9:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Lunư, Lôôk Jê-xu tơơl: “Leh kơyq, tuôôy heq palo ti xăk muut akay đơu măn e 'yo xuq pi atêq, laa taxưngq dik ka daak dêh ku Kơy Plêêk.”<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Atêq kaluh varơuq nưq, Lôôk kung pato đinq pơh kưl vaarq dro kadrơy đnoyq, ji patăk dăt oot tưng đôôy muuyq hooy adroyq kangưưr Kadraq truh tôôy theng thiq ji kaluh aduq đơu kadih Kadraq jeq truh. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Ju muua goch yôôych dik troq, bơh thơq goch yôôych axit dik. Nưq dayh apôôy xiin Lôôk ku muua goch xôq Kadraq patăk dăt thơq goch muut tuôôy xiêk goch ku Kadraq. <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />Dayh tok trôôk. 'Yo hơq, thơy patăk oh ay hooy đaji ôô trưưu koot măn katul bơy xo vari. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />Te xagook tyauq thuuyq jêêt, droong hooy trôôk, kaxôôp jeep, ji te vôôch hrok akơyq tol trôôk hooy. <verse eid="LUK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />Atoh hnhư leq oh ay tawaak muut, adroyq dik dayh chuk: ‘Hrok hrol ka hnhư neq.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Atoh koot ku varơuq hrok hrol măn đnư, yôôych varơuq hrok hrol ku oh ay hnoq truh tol adro nưq; măn atoh leh, ni hnoq wiit xuq dii oh ay. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" />Dayh kưq măn hlê đom hnhư nưq, xa ji hôôch kaluh kajoq nhonq xing oot, vii adro dơơp kông đangq jah kông jêêt ni. Te dưk hooy xing hnhư neq hlê hnhư kadrơy. <verse eid="LUK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />Atoh theng leq oh ay hooy muut ji oot tiip đoonq oh ay, dayh xa kaluh kajoq jah adoot vlôh ka oh ay, <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />dayh payơh manih bingq măn kađnư, ji đnooy dii oot, ‘Daak dêh Kơy Plêêk heq truh jeq đôôyq dii oh ay.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />Măn atoh theng leq oh ay hooy muut đơu oot leh tiip đoonq oh ay, yôôych atêq tuôôy hooy vlôh pi trôôk ku theng nưq, dayh đnooy: <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />‘Hloay kaah thul vari aduq theng ku êêp tagăp tol jôôk 'wot, yôôych 'wot tapolh xarêh xôq tachơơl êêp! Bơh dayh xet varơuq neq, nưq laa daak dêh ku Kơy Plêêk heq jeq.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />Thơy đnooy dii oh ay đaneq đôôyq dii theng Sô-đôm muut hngơy nưq, ni hnoq đangq ka'lăk iaq theng nưq. <verse eid="LUK 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />Ra ơơh ka may, theng Kô-ra-xin! Ra ơơh ka may, theng Bêt-sai-đa! Vii atoh kaluh varơuq taay yaak, đơu ni dơơp vlôh đom katul êêp, heq jah ăm xalih vlôh aduq Ti-rơ ji Si-đôn, yôôych oot dong dik heq wiit xuum, tuôôy 'ngôôy đom vlo kung dii aau sô xing xiik yôôch. <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Lunưq, hnoq đangq ka'lăk ka Ti-rơ ji Si-đôn đom varơuq xưh xadrah iaq êêp. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />Măn may, Ka-bê-na-um, be aleq adro hnoq jah tơơk tok truh tol plêêk? May hnoq biq klêh pôôt truh aduq kaxêêt. <verse eid="LUK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />Manih chiuq tameng oh ay laa chiuq tameng thơy, ji manih ka'lăk oh ay laa ka'lăk thơy, bơh manih ka'lăk thơy laa ka'lăk Kơy heq patăk dăt thơy.”<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Yôôch pơh kưl vaarq dro xatyauq wiit xuq dii varơuq hlah hlaak, tơơl: “Kuh Thơy, đom yal Kadraq, hloay kaah kaluh kamuuych kung biq tameng xatyauq adroyq 'wot.” <verse eid="LUK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Bơh Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Thơy 'miêh heq hloq Sa-tan xing plêêk ahlea pôôt đaji bliek. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" />Dayh 'yo, thơy heq kahniq ka oh ay taay yaak xôq joaq jalon tol volh ji ding dip, kung taalh dêq hloay qwuyen lưk ku khơl tachơơl, lunưq kajưk dik leh e paq kê varơuq kajoq hnoq ik dơơp ra ơơh oh ay. <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Lunư, te hlah hlaak truh varơuq nưq, 'ngưq laa varơuq kaluh kamuuych biq tameng xatyauq adroyq oh ay, đơu dayh hlah hlaak vii anơng ku oh ay heq jah valơk tol daak plêêk.”<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Aduq tuôôy kawat nưq, Kadraq thier hlah hlaak đom Kơy Phool Hiel ji đnooy: “Kuh Vaq, laa Lôôk ku plêêk ji vari, koot ayuôôt laat Vaq vii Vaq heq padu kinq kaluh varơuq neq klơlh khơl manih khôôt xet ji khơl adro hlolh xet, đơu Vaq heq kahnoq vlôh oot ka oh de. Kuh Vaq, jơq, vii đanưq laa varơuq kaxay tamaq adroyq kangưưr Vaq.” <verse eid="LUK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />“Tôôy varơuq heq jah pahnăp ka koot xing Vaq ku koot, leh kơyq xet Koot laa kơyq đêh vlôh Vaq, ji leh kơyq xet Vaq laa kơyq đêh vlôh Koot ji adro leq đơu Koot xung kahnoq vlôh ăm.” <verse eid="LUK 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Yôôch atêq tuôôy wih hlê khơl xatyauq, Kadraq đnooy dii đêh oot: “Vanong ka mot hloq varơuq đơu oh ay hloq. <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />Vii thơy đnooy ka oh ay xet đaneq 'ngưng kơy hlit ji vuua lôôk heq biit trôôch hloq varơuq đơu oh ay hloq, bơh leh hloq ik, ji tameng varơuq oh ay tameng, đơu be tameng ik.”<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />Ji hơq, muuyq thơy pato ganuun nưq dưk tok xôq thư Kadraq, tuôôy đnooy: “Thơy lơơy, gô hnoq jah varơuq riirh đơơy đơơy tuôôy dơơp varơuq kajoq?” <verse eid="LUK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Bơh Kadraq đnooy dii kơy nưq: “Varơuq kajoq jah valơk đom ganuun? Kơy đok hloq đaleq?” <verse eid="LUK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />Tuôôy tơơl apok, kơy nưq đnooy: “Koot pheq xiaq Lôôk laa Kơy Plêêk ku koot dii dêq hloay xuum klaak koot, dii dêq hloay phool hiel koot, dii dêq hloay paraat kalh koot, dii dêq hloay ngook biit koot, ji pheq xiaq manih gah gih ku koot đaji kadih koot.” <verse eid="LUK 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />Nưq laa Kadraq đnooy dii kơy: “Kơy tơơl apok jơq dik. Dayh dơơp đanưq yôôych kơy hnoq riirh.” <verse eid="LUK 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Bơh vii xung kahnoq vlôh xăk hyioh jăk, kơy nưq tơơl dii Lôôk Jê-xu: “Nưq kơyq laa manih gah gih ku gô?” <verse eid="LUK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Yôôch xôq tơơl apok, Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy: “Muuyq adro hơq đong hooy xing theng Jê-ru-sa-lem aloh theng Jê-ri-kô, yôôych ay klêh muut ti bing xa atôk, laa khơl xok xarêh tuôông ay ji atêq tuôôy hmơt ka xataat xateek, bing oot ka'lăk hooy, măk kê ay riirh phoch kaxêêt phoch. <verse eid="LUK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />Đom varơuq ta galôp, muuyq thơy tơơk tưp nưq đong hooy aloh ka trôôk nưq, ji tuôôy 'yo hloq ay, kơy nưq wek hlê pi hơq. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />Kung anưq, muuyq manih Lê-vi, tuôôy hooy truh aduq neq ji hloq adro biq naanq, manih nưq kung wek hlê pi hơq. <verse eid="LUK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />Bơh muuyq manih Sa-ma-ri nưq, đom tuôôy hooy trôôk, heq truh aduq dro biq naanq, ji tuôôy 'yo hloq, yôôych ay nưq arơơk xuum biit angơuq. <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />Tuôôy heq truh hlê jeq, ay vek paxêêk hlêêl xưr ku adro biq naanq, tôh jơu ji lok tok. Atêq tuôôy rôôk adro naanq tok ôô lưưa ku ay, ay jarooy dro nưq truh muuyq hnhư padơy ji paxêêk văch ka dro neq. <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Muut hngơy atêq, tuôôy xok vlôh vaarq đơ-ni-ê, ay ăm ka kôôch hnhư ji dăt: ‘Dayh paxêêk văch ay nưq, ji atoh kơy pheq tayuh iaq paq kê thưq kajoq, yôôych tuôôy gô wiit hlê, gô hnoq bla hlê ka kơy.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />Kơy biit kơyq đom pe dro nưq heq jêêk vlôh manih gah gih dii manih naanq biq klêh muut đom ti khơl atôk?” <verse eid="LUK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Kơy nưq tơơl: “Adro heq kahnoq xuum biit angơuq deng ka manih biq naanq.” Nưq laa Lôôk Jê-xu dăt kơy: “Kơy dayh hooy ji dơơp đanưq.”<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />Tuôôy oot hooy trôôk, Kadraq muut đom muuyq palơy hơq, ji muuyq adro kadrê nưq anơng Ma-thê đoonq tiip Kadraq. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Mư e adro oh kadrê anơng Ma-ri, 'ngôôy aduq jôôk Lôôk Jê-xu, domq tameng apok Kadraq. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Bơh Ma-thê đong biq pơl wol dii thier 'ngưng kông varơuq ralauq palauq, yôôch mư truh tơơl: “Kuh Lôôk, Kadraq leh nhonq hloq đaneq ma oh kadrê gô ka'lăk gô muuyq adro dơơp varơuq ih? Lunưq, xiin dăt oh gô, xôq ni hnoq ik waak gô.” <verse eid="LUK 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Lunư, tuôôy tơơl apok, Lôôk đnooy dii mư: “Ma-thê lơơy, Ma-thê ne, mư lo biit ji biq xôôl dôôl truh 'ngưng varơuq, <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />bơh vơ muuyq varơuq laa duh dik đơu heq. Vii Ma-ri heq rơơlh phon tolh, laa phon hnoq leh biq xok hlơơp klơlh mư nưq.”<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Varơuq xalih vlôh tuôôy Kadraq đong xadrook apôôy ka muuyq aduq nưq, tuôôy Kadraq xadrook apôôy payôôch, muuyq đom khơl xatyauq tơơl dii Kadraq: “Kuh Lôôk, xiin pato 'wot xadrook apôôy, đaji Jăng kung heq pato khơl xatyauq kơy.” <verse eid="LUK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Yôôch Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Tuôôy oh ay xadrook apôôy, dayh tơơl:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">‘Kuh Vaq, apôôy yal Vaq jah hlăng vah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:2">Apôôy daak dêh Vaq jah truh.<verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />Xiin ăm 'wot koot tuôông xa duh xa tôôy hngơy ku 'wot koot.<verse eid="LUK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />Xiin tha ka'lăk 'wot koot truh kadrôôp maroh ku 'wot koot,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">vii 'wot koot kung tha ka'lăk tôôy adro măk lôôkq 'wot koot.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">Apôôy te jarooy 'wot koot muut varơuq adô aluut.’”<verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Ji Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “kơyq đom oh ay e 'wơyq, ji katul mưng truh dii ay nưq, yôôch đnooy kung ay nưq: ‘'Wơyq lơơy, xiin ăm gô xapo pe poop tôôp, <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" />vii muuyq adro 'wơyq ku gô xing xangưưy truh kung gô, đơu gô leh e kajoq xôq adoot ka ay nưq’? <verse eid="LUK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />Tuôôy manih hơq tơơl hlê xing pi'lăp hnhư, ay nưq e hnoq đnooy: ‘Te dơơp ngơyq gô. 'Mok heq kađnoch yôôch, ji khơl koot gô đong măn tol chanưng kung dii gô. Gô leh hnoq kah ăm ay kajoq ik.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Thơy đnooy dii oh ay, pheq đnooy ju adro nưq leh kaah xôq xok ka ay hơq vii laa khơl 'wơyq ku ni, bơh xing kơq varơuq chaay mot vôôch ratuut ku ay hơq, lunưq tuôôy đong biq panưk kah, adro neq hnoq xok ka ay hơq đu sôôq tôôp ay hơq duh. <verse eid="LUK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />Thơy kung đnooy dii oh ay, dayh xiin, yôôych varơuq nưq hnoq ik kahniq ka oh ay; dayh axek, yôôych oh ay hnoq tavơh; dayh ahngoq 'mok, yôôych 'mok hnoq luh ka oh ay. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Vii atoh kơyq xiin yôôych jah; kơyq axek yôôych tavơh; ji 'mok hnoq jah luh ka dro leq ahngoq. <verse eid="LUK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />Adro vaq leq đom oh ay, tuôôy koot xăk xiin kaa, yôôych adro nưq ăm ni volh tađôôy vii kaa? <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />Long adro koot xiin katăp, yôôych adro nưq ăm ni ding dip? <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Lunưq, atoh oh ay, ju laa xơuq, heq xet kaluh kadrool tolh xôq ka koot xau oh ay, yôôych Vaq laa Kơy măn tol plêêk hnoq kahniq Kơy Phool Hiel ka adro xiin Kadraq 'ngưng galơh iaq đaleq?”<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Kadraq vơơ druyh avlôh muuyq kamuuych hôp. Nưq yôôch, varơuq xalih vlôh tuôôy kamuuych heq vlôh yôôch, adro hôp đnooy ik, ji bing manih thier tưng hưng. <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />Bơh taleq dro đom sôôq nưq đnooy: “Kơy nưq druyh kamuuych, gamưh Bê-ên-xê-bun, laa lôôk kamuuych.” <verse eid="LUK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Măn sôôq kadrơy, vii xôq thư Kadraq, oot đooy vôôch aduq Kadraq muuyq hlêêl akêh xing plêêk. <verse eid="LUK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Bơh bơyh heq xet xuum biit ku oot, Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Daak leq tuôôy biq ahlook aklah kadih tachơơl hlê ni yôôych biq dơơp ka pachaay waay, ji hnhư tachơơl hlê hnhư yôôych hrưp naat. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Atoh Sa-tan kung biq ahlook aklah kadih tachơơl hlê kadih ni, yôôych dơơp aleq daak dêh ku ni măn hlê ik? Vii khơl kơy đnooy gô druyh kamuuych gamưh Bê-ên-xê-bun. <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Atoh gô druyh kamuuych gamưh Bê-ên-xê-bun, yôôych gamưh kơyq đơu koot xau khơl kơy druyh kamuuych? Vii anưq, oot hnoq laa khơl adro xưh xadrah khơl kơy. <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Lunư, atoh gô druyh kamuuych gamưh lôk ti ku Kơy Plêêk, yôôych daak dêh ku Kơy Plêêk heq truh dii khơl kơy. <verse eid="LUK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />Tuôôy muuyq adro kalh paraat jah jaauq maak viik ngăk jư 'yo hnhư ni, yôôych garuh anôôp ku adro nưq jah jư hlê, <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />bơh tuôôy muuyq adro kalh iaq ay nưq kathôp hmơt, yôôych adro nưq jay iaq ay nưq, varoh xok jaauq maak ku ay, laa thưq đơu ay nưq ganưq gamưh muut, yôôch adro nưq aklah ahlook kua varoh jah xing ay nưq. <verse eid="LUK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />Adro leq tuôôy leh măn dii gô laa tachơơl hlê gô, ji adro leq tuôôy leh anguk hlê kung gô yôôych hyaak hyek. <verse eid="LUK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />Tuôôy kamuuych 'moh heq vlôh klơlh muuyq dro, ni hooy dalơh kaluh aduq kateh hriet axek akhiim aduq padơy. Ji tuôôy leh axek ik, ni dăt: ‘Gô hnoq wiit xuq hnhư gô, laa aduq đơu gô heq vlôh klơlh.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />Atêq tuôôy xuq truh, ni hloq hnhư heq jah rahiing deep xarêh xaraat ji deep xôq e aduq. <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />Tuôôy nưq, ni hooy ji pago tyauq pơh kamuuych kadrơy xơk iaq ni kung muut riirh đom hnhư neq. Ji đơơy riirh tuôôy atêq ku adro nưq jêêk vlôh ra ơơh iaq tuôôy kapa tep.”<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Varơuq xalih vlôh tuôôy Kadraq đong đnooy kaluh apok neq, muuyq khơl kadrê hơq xing katul bing karôp tơơl apok tok, mo đnooy dii Kadraq: “Vanong ka klaak heq pa iir vlôh thơy ji tôôh đơu thơy heq uq.” <verse eid="LUK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Bơh Kadraq tơơl: “dong dik yôôych, vanong ka kơyq tameng apok Kơy Plêêk ji tameng jư xok.”<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />Tuôôy bing karôp đong tưưuq tagumq 'ngưng iaq, Kadraq pa xarôp đnooy: “Adrơơk nooy neq laa muuyq adrơơk nooy xơk tauq. Ni axek akhiim muuyq hlêêl akêh, đơu hnoq leh e hlêêl akêh leq jah kahniq ka ni đêh vlôh hlêêl akêh ku Jô-na. <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />Vii Jô-na heq jêêk vlôh hlêêl akêh đaleq ka manih theng Ni-ni-ve, yôôych Koot Manih kung hnoq laa hlêêl akêh đanưq ka adrơơk nooy neq. <verse eid="LUK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" />Đom hngơy xưh xadrah, Mư vuua Pi Naam hnoq dưk tok kung dii manih ku adrơơk nooy neq, ji tauq kadrôôp oot, vii mo heq truh xing aduq lôôch dik ku vari xôq tameng apok khôôt xet ku vuua Sa-lô-môn, ji 'yo hơq, muuyq Kơy kôt galơh iaq Sa-lô-môn măn đnen. <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" />Đom hngơy xưh xadrah, manih theng Ni-ni-ve hnoq dưk tok kung dii adrơơk nooy neq ji hnoq tauq kadrôôp ni, vii oot heq wiit xuum adroyq apok padoh taboon ku Jô-na, ji 'yo neq, muuyq Kơy măn kôt galơh iaq Jô-na măn đnen.<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />Atêq tuôôy ataak đeen, leh kơyq xôq ni măn aduq kađoq, kung leh măn 'laarq apoop đêêk tađnưk, bơh măn tol jôôk đeen xôq khơl drơy tawaak muut hnoq ik hloq xaraar tađnah. <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />Gooy đeen ku xăk xamơk laa klong mot ku oh ay. Tuôôy mot oh ay laa tolh, dêq xăk oh ay kung jah galaay ngôp xaraar tađnah. Bơh tuôôy ni xơuq, xăk xamơk oh ay kung viik kamơng jaluk. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Vii anưq, dayh rơơt rol, leh kheoq xaraar tađnah đom oh ay laa kamơng jaluk. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Nưq atoh dêq xăk oh ay galaay ngôp xaraar tađnah, leh e phon leq kamơng jaluk, yôôych ni hnoq dêq hloay tađnah tađnaak, đaji tuôôy xaraar đeen jaraak tađnah oh ay.”<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Nưq yôôch, tuôôy Kadraq đnooy payôôch, muuyq adro Pha-ri-si mơơy Kadraq aleq ka Kadraq hnoq ik xa kawaal achung dii kơy. Tuôôy heq hooy truh, Kadraq 'ngôôy muut para xa. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />Tuôôy hloq anưq, manih Pha-ri-si thier tưng hưng vii Kadraq leh dưk dơơp varơuq 'nhaau ti patep dik adroyq kawaal xa. <verse eid="LUK 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Bơh Lôôk đnooy dii kơy: “Juneq, manih Pha-ri-si khơl kơy 'nhaau xarêh pi gôk cheet ji dooy, măn pi'lăp khơl kơy yôôych viik varơuq hmưch trôôch ji xơk tauq. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Khơl adro ta'ngơk hơq! Leh aalq Kơy heq dơơp jêêk pi gôk kung dơơp jêêk pi'lăp ih? <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Ju anưq, dayh kahniq ahlook kaluh kajoq măn pi'lăp đaji varơuq ăm hloh, ji 'yo neq, tôôy thưq laa xarêh ka khơl kơy.<verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />Lunư, ra ơơh ka manih Pha-ri-si khơl kơy, vii khơl kơy tơơk tưp phon kưl baak ha, hôôy hương ji tôôy thưq kaxeq rek đom hluôôt, đơu khơl kơy ka'lăk hlê hyioh jăk ji xuum xung xiaq Kơy Plêêk. Bơh duh pheq dưk dơơp kaluh varơuq neq, ji be ka'lăk hlê kaluh varơuq hơq. <verse eid="LUK 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />Ra ơơh ka manih Pha-ri-si khơl kơy, vii khơl kơy xiaq trôôch aduq 'ngôôy tolh nhưk đom hnhư tagumq ji kaluh apok vôôch hlơq katul aduq tabôôt. <verse eid="LUK 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />Ra ơơh ka khơl kơy, vii khơl kơy dang đaji xanưng rap, ji khơl drơy leh xet tuôôy joaq jalon tok taalh.”<verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Atêq nưq, xôq tơơl hlê, muuyq đom khơl thơy ganuun đnooy dii Kadraq: “Thơy lơơy, thơy kung đnooy ra ơơh 'wot tuôôy đnooy đanưq.” <verse eid="LUK 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Bơh Kadraq dăt: “Ra ơơh ka thơy pato ganuun khơl kơy đnoyq! Vii khơl kơy chơt ka khơl drơy kaluh gengq parêq khoq pơq, măn kadih xăk khơl kơy be bôk muuyq lôk ti khơl kơy muut gengq parêq nưq. <verse eid="LUK 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />Ra ơơh ka khơl kơy, vii khơl kơy xơy xanưng ka khơl kơy hlit, măn mo kơy khơl kơy heq păk kaxêêt oot. <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Đanưq, khơl kơy dơơp xanưk ji kung trôôch varơuq dơơp ku mo kơy êêp, vii oot heq păk kaxêêt khơl kơy hlit, măn khơl kơy xơy xanưng. <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />Kung vii anưq, varơuq khôôt xet ku Kơy Plêêk xanoh: ‘Gô hnoq patăk khơl kơy hlit ji khơl jah rơơlh truh dii oot, bơh oot hnoq păk kaxêêt ji rôp toop 'ngưng adro đom sôôq oot’ <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />xôq vahaap ku dêq hloay khơl kơy hlit heq kahrôq vlôh xing tuôôy patep panưk jêêk pheq biq vôôch aduq adrơơk đơơy neq, <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />xing vahaap ku A-bên dong truh vahaap ku Xa-cha-ri, laa adro heq biq păk kaxêêt măn katul para hơu ji hnhư hơu. Jơq, gô đnooy dii khơl kơy, vahaap nưq hnoq jah vôôch hlê xing adrơơk đơơy neq. <verse eid="LUK 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />Ra ơơh ka khơl thơy ganuun khơl kơy, vii khơl kơy xok hooy gay kal ku hlolh xet, kadih khơl kơy leh muut, đơu khơl kơy klơl hlê khơl drơy muut.”<verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Atêq tuôôy Kadraq vlôh klơlh aduq nưq, khơl thơy pato ganuun ji manih Pha-ri-si pa xarôp tachơơl hlê Kadraq đangq đik ji takaay tayaat dii Kadraq truh 'ngưng varơuq, <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />axek trôôk xôq anơk rayaalh Kadraq truh apok đnooy vlôh xing huuy Kadraq.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />Đom tuôôy nưq, tuôôy bing karôp karavơu manih tưưuq anguk hlê pheq đnooy joaq jalon tok mamuuyq, yôôych adroyq dik, Kadraq pa xarôp đnooy dii khơl xatyauq kadraq: “Dayh rơơt rol jư 'yo xăk xamơk klơlh tape ku manih Pha-ri-si, 'ngưq laa katik xuum pa ôôh. <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" />Bơh be e varơuq kajoq biq kadook kadrưp đơu hnoq leh jah kahnoq vlôh, long padu kadook đơu hnoq leh biq khơl drơy xet. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Anưq, atoh kaluh kajoq đơu oh ay đnooy đom kamơng jaluk hnoq jah tameng măn aduq tađnah, ji kaluh kajoq oh ay đnooy vahaat aduq tôôr đom phong kinq hnoq jah đnooy vlôh tol apo hnhư. <verse eid="LUK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />Lunư, thơy đnooy dii oh ay laa khơl manih 'wơyq ku thơy, te biq varaal yôq xing khơl păk kaxêêt xăk xamơk, yôôch atêq nưq leh măn kajoq xôq dơơp galơh ik đnoyq. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Bơh thơy hnoq kahnoq vlôh ka oh ay xet pheq yôq kơyq. Dayh yôq Kơy, atêq tuôôy heq păk kaxêêt xăk xamơk, e qwuyen avih manih nưq muut aduq karuk manih kaxêêt. Jơq, thơy đnooy dii oh ay, dayh kuh yôq Kơy nưq. <verse eid="LUK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />Be aalq dăp poop xêêp varek tek jah vaarq đông baak ih? Đơu be muuyq apoop leq đom sôôq xêêp laa biq ka'lăk tawol kangưưr Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />Hloay kaah hlôôk tol akoq oh ay pheq đnooy heq jah jauq dêq. Te yôq: oh ay măn kôt iaq taso dii 'ngưng apoop xêêp varek. <verse eid="LUK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />Thơy đnooy dii oh ay atoh kơyq xưng nhonq thơy kangưưr khơl drơy, yôôych Koot Manih kung hnoq xưng nhonq adro nưq adroyq khơl kơy yaak ku Kơy Plêêk, <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />măn kơyq chôôyq ka'lăk thơy kangưưr khơl drơy yôôych hnoq biq chôôyq ka'lăk kangưưr khơl kơy yaak ku Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="LUK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />Ji paq kê adro leq đnooy apok tachơơl kung Koot Manih hnoq jah tha, bơh dii adro đnooy katơơk galơh truh Kơy Phool Hiel hnoq leh jah tha 'leq. <verse eid="LUK 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />Bơh tuôôy khơl drơy jarooy oh ay truh kaluh hnhư tagumq, khơl padrok xadrah ji khơl padrok xanok, te biit oh ay pheq đnooy tagêh bing đaleq long varơuq kajoq, long oh ay pheq đnooy kajoq, <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />vii đom kadih wat nưq, Kơy Phool Hiel hnoq pato oh ay kaluh varơuq duh đnooy.”<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Atêq nưq, muuyq dro đom bing karôp đnooy dii Kadraq: “Thơy lơơy, xiin dăt ay gô ahlook garuh anôôp dii gô.” <verse eid="LUK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Bơh Kadraq tơơl dii adro nưq: “Nee ay, kơyq lâp gô dơơp padrok xadrah long manih dưk katul ahlook garuh anôôp ka khơl ay?” <verse eid="LUK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Yôôch Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Dayh rơơt rol ji jư xăk klơlh kaluh katik hmưch trôôch, vii varơuq riirh ku muuyq adro be măn aduq varơuq raah jôh aduq garuh anôôp ni.” <verse eid="LUK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Atêq nưq, Kadraq taboon ka oot muuyq kadook atoh đaneq: “Hluôôt vari ku muuyq dro karoh hơq troq muua, <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />ji ay kadih biit đaneq: ‘Gô hnoq dơơp kajoq neq, vii gô leh măn aduq xôq tađnưk raak play ku gô?’ <verse eid="LUK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />Ay đnooy: ‘Gô hnoq dơơp đaneq: “Gô hnoq pha ka'lăk kaluh pơ duut gô, xơy kaluh apoop kôt iaq, ji tađnưk muut đnư dêq hloay kalook va kung dii kaluh tuôông tolh ku gô.” <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Yôôch gô hnoq đnooy dii phool hiel gô: “Phool hiel lơơy, may heq e 'ngưng garuh anôôp xôq deng ka 'ngưng xanưm. Dayh padơy pado, xa, hôôch ji hlah hlaak.”’ <verse eid="LUK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />Bơh Kơy Plêêk xanoh dii ay nưq: ‘Adro khưrq vlô hơq, kadih klôôy neng phool hiel may biq vôôch hlê, yôôch kaluh thưq đơu may heq ralauq 'meq hnoq jêêk truh kơyq?’ <verse eid="LUK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />Adro tagoop xôq garuh anôôp ka xăk đơu leh karoh e đom Kơy Plêêk kung đanưq.”<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Yôôch Kadraq đnooy dii khơl xatyauq kadraq: “Xing kơq nưq, thơy đnooy dii oh ay, te lo biit truh varơuq riirh oh ay, hnoq xa kajoq — kung te lo truh xăk xamơk oh ay, hnoq hlưp kajoq. <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Vii varơuq riirh laa galơh iaq tuôông xa, ji xăk xamơk galơh iaq qwuân aau. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />Dayh 'yo xêêp aak, nưq laa ni leh pêêt kung be goch, be e pơ tađnưk long aduq xôq deng ka ni, đơu Kơy Plêêk văch ni. Oh ay kôt galơh iaq paroh xêêp xet taleq! <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Panưh kadrơy, kơyq đom oh ay, gamưh lo biit, hnoq ik tahyơq yơơt athêêp ka hngơy xiêk đơơy ni muuyq axit tra be? <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Nưq, atoh oh ay măn leh dơơp ik vơ muuyq varơuq thier de nưq, yôôych aleq oh ay laay lo biit truh kaluh varơuq kadrơy? <verse eid="LUK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />Dayh 'yo kaluh raak hwuêq — kach ni kôt tok dang aleq. Ni leh dơơp pơơl, kung leh duuy varaay. Bơh thơy đnooy kung oh ay, hloay kaah vuua Sa-lô-môn, dii dêq hloay tađnah tađnaak ku vuua nưq, kung be jah hlưp qwuân aau đaji muuyq raak leq đom sôôq nưq. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Wơơy adro axit xuum tuôq, atoh Kơy Plêêk măn pahlưp đanưq ka raak rek pi gôk laa adrek neng măn tadơh biq avih muut loo, yôôych oh ay măn kôt galơh iaq dong leq. <verse eid="LUK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />Oh ay te akhiim axek oh ay xa kajoq ji hôôch kajoq, kung te lo biit. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />Vii tôôy tamooy tol dêh araak ragơy axek akhiim kaluh varơuq neq, bơh Vaq ku oh ay heq xet đaneq oh ay duh kaluh varơuq nưq. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Lunư, dayh akhiim axek daak dêh ku Kadraq, yôôych kaluh varơuq nưq hnoq jah ăm athêêp ka oh ay. <verse eid="LUK 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />Bơy de lơơy, te yôq, vii Vaq ku oh ay hlah xuum kahniq daak dêh ka oh ay. <verse eid="LUK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />Dayh tek garuh anôôp ku oh ay ji ahlook aklah ka khơl adrah. Dayh palauq ka xăk thuuyq leh biq moon hyaak — 'ngưq laa ku qwuiq leh biq hư haau măn tol plêêk, laa aduq adro atôk leh truh jeq, vlaak kamoor kung leh kek hyaak. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Vii garuh anôôp oh ay măn ka'leq yôôych xuum oh ay kung hnoq măn kađnư.<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />Katêêk ku oh ay pheq jah hnek hlê, kung dii đeen pheq jah jư jaq tađnah, <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />ji oh ay dang đaji khơl adro đong takôô kôôch ku oh ay tuôôy kơy wiit xuq xing waal pajêêk, xôq atêq tuôôy truh ji ahngoq 'mok, oot vơ nhăp hnoq ik luh ka kôôch. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Vanong ka khơl adro xapok nưq laa khơl adro đơu atêq tuôôy xuq truh, kôôch hnoq hloq khơl xapok đong parol takôô. Dong dik, thơy đnooy dii oh ay đaneq kôôch hnoq hnek katêêk kôôch, ji mơơy oot 'ngôôy muut para xa, yôôch kôôch hơu varơuq oot tuôôy hooy dalơh tưng adro. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Hloay kaah tuôôy kôôch truh đom wat vaarq, long pheq đnooy muut wat pe, ji kôôch hnoq ik hloq đanưq, yôôych vanong ka khơl adro xapok nưq. <verse eid="LUK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />Bơh pheq hlolh đaneq, nưq laa atoh kôôch hnhư heq xet wat leq adro atôk truh, yôôych kơy kajưk dik leh xôq hnhư kơy biq leenq muut. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Oh ay kung pheq palauq ralauq, vii muut kawat đơu oh ay leh biit truh, yôôych Koot Manih hnoq truh.”<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Yôôch Phi-e-rơ tơơl: “Kuh Lôôk, Kadraq đong taboon kadook atoh neq ka 'wot, long kung ăm tôôy adro?” <verse eid="LUK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Ji Lôôk tơơl: “Nưq yôôych, kơyq laa adro jư 'yo hyioh jăk, khôôt xet, laa adro đơu kôôch hnoq goch xôq măn taalh khơl xapok ku kôôch, xôq ahlook aklah phon tuôông xa ka oot muut troq kawat? <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Vanong ka xapok nưq, laa adro đơu kôôch ni, tuôôy truh 'yo, hnoq hloq đong dơơp troq đanưq. <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />Dong dik, thơy đnooy dii oh ay đaneq kôôch hnoq goch xôq xapok nưq jư 'yo padêq hloay garuh anôôp ku kơy. <verse eid="LUK 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />Bơh atoh xapok nưq đnooy đom xuum ni, đaneq: ‘Kôôch gô măn xiik đơơu xuq,’ lunưq pa xarôp tiel tu khơl xapok kanau ji xapok kadrê, vơơ xa vơơ hôôch, yôôch biq vuul weel, <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />yôôych kôôch ku xapok nưq hnoq xuq truh đom hngơy đơu ni leh xanih, jơq, muut wat đơu ni leh xet, ji kôôch hnoq tachiah tađôôy ni, yôôch đinq aduq ni achung dii khơl adro lưp tameng. <verse eid="LUK 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />Xapok nưq, laa adro xet iq kôôch ni đơu leh 'meq ralauq long dưk dơơp tyauq iq kôôch, hnoq biq dook 'ngưng. <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Măn xapok leh xet đơu dơơp varơuq đangq phaat hnoq biq dook axit. Panưh kadrơy, kơyq, laa adro heq jah kahniq ăm 'ngưng, yôôych 'ngưng varơuq hnoq biq vôôch hlê aduq adro nưq, ji đôôyq dii kơyq heq jah pahnăp ăm 'ngưng, kaluh kajoq hnoq biq đooy vôôch aduq adro nưq laay kang 'ngưng iaq.<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />Thơy heq truh xôq avih ôôlh pôôt vari, ji thơy biit trôôch varơuq kajoq atoh ni heq jah amô jaq yôôch? <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />Bơh Thơy măn pheq chiuq muuyq pheep bap-tem, ji thơy jiq hlu xet taleq dong truh tuôôy ni jah payôôch! <verse eid="LUK 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />Oh ay biit đaneq thơy truh xôq xagook hrok hrol ka dêh araak ih? Lưp 'leq, thơy đnooy dii oh ay, troq iaq laa varơuq aklah vlôh. <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Vii xing neng, hnoq e dăp adro đom muuyq hnhư biq aklah bing vlôh — pe tachơơl hlê vaarq ji vaarq tachơơl hlê pe. <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />Oot hnoq biq aklah vlôh, vaq tachơơl hlê koot kanau ji koot kanau tachơơl hlê vaq, miq tachơơl hlê koot kadrê ji koot kadrê tachơơl hlê miq, miq kanau tachơơl hlê koot amưưy ni ji koot amưưy tachơơl dii miq kanau.”<verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Yôôch Kadraq kung đnooy dii bing karôp: “Tuôôy oh ay hloq muuyq đum kluk rama vlôh măn pi mot hngơy lôp, oh ay hloay dăt đaneq: ‘Muuyq đơơt jit đong truh,’ ji varơuq xalih vlôh troq đanưq. <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Măn tuôôy khiel naam klôôp, oh ay đnooy đaneq: ‘Hnoq e tôq jaq,’ yôôych varơuq xalih vlôh anưq. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Khơl xuum pa ôôh! Oh ay xet padoh hlolh kaluh kahnoq avlôh ku plêêk ji ku vari, bơh aleq oh ay leh hlolh xet xôq padoh hlolh ka đơơy juneq? <verse eid="LUK 12:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />Aleq oh ay pheq đnooy leh kadih xăk xưh xadrah varơuq kajoq laa troq? <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />Vii hloay tuôôy oh ay đong hooy kung dii adro kienq kaauq oh ay truh hnhư padrok xanok, dayh dơơp dêq paraat xôq palauq ralauq dong varơuq dii adro nưq tol trôôk hooy, xôq axit vlôh adro nưq leh duuy oh ay truh padrok xadrah, yôôch padrok xadrah pahnăp oh ay ka bing kuun, ji bing kuun rôp oh ay muut tu. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Gô đnooy dii oh ay, kajưk dik oh ay hnoq leh vlôh klơlh tu dong truh tuôôy oh ay bla dêq kapah jêêt lôôch dik.”<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Muuyq sôôq manih e mot muut tuôôy nưq taboon hlê ka Kadraq truh khơl manih Ga-li-lê đơu Phi-lat heq khienq vahaap khơl manih nưq aluq dii kuah lêh ku oot. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Tuôôy tơơl hlê, Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Khơl kơy biit đaneq khơl manih Ga-li-lê nưq laa kadrôôp maroh iaq tôôy adro Ga-li-lê kadrơy vii oot pheq chiuq đanưq ih? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Gô đnooy dii khơl kơy, be aalq đanưq. Lunư, atoh khơl kơy leh wiit xuum, yôôych dêq hloay kung hnoq biq kaxêêt hlơơp đanưq. <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />Long đaji kưl thơơm adro hơq, đơu hnhư yơơt aduq Si-lô-ê heq hrưp pôôt kateep tok taalh ji păk kaxêêt oot: Khơl kơy biit đaneq oot laa khơl adro kadrôôp maroh ramêq iaq tôôy adro riirh aduq Jê-ru-sa-lem ih? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Gô đnooy dii khơl kơy, be aalq đanưq. Bơh atoh khơl kơy leh wiit xuum, yôôych dêq hloay kung hnoq biq kaxêêt hlơơp đanưq.”<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Yôôch Kadraq taboon kadook atoh neq: “Adro nưq e ưk pok puut jah pêêt đom hluôôt nho ni, ji kơy truh axek play tol ưk nưq bơh leh hloq. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Kơy đnooy dii adro dơơp hluôôt: ‘Ay 'yo nee, pe xanưm xing tuôôy đơu gô truh axek play aduq ưk pok puut neq đơu be hloq. Dayh kơl ni dơyh. Vii liq jo kajoq đơu ni pheq đnooy tagoa vari lưp yuôôr?’ <verse eid="LUK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />Bơh tuôôy tơơl apok, ay nưq đnooy dii kôôch: ‘Kôôch lơơy, xiin dayh xôq ni hlê athêêp xanưm neng đnoyq, truh mưk đơu gô heq xiel vari rawiit ni ji uk ek. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />Axit vlôh yôôych, truh atêq ni hnoq ik vlôh play … măn atoh dik be e kajoq, kôôch hnoq kơl ni!’”<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Kadraq đong pato dayq đom muuyq hnhư hơu muut hngơy Sa-bat, <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />ji hơq, muuyq adro kadrê biq kamuuych jiq jiêh nhôp tuôôt kưl thơơm xanưm, mư biq kadônq karok ji leh hnoq dưk hyioh ik. <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Tuôôy Lôôk Jê-xu hloq mư, Kadraq ăm taayh yôôch đnooy dii mư: “Nee mư, mư heq jah wơơt xaloot klơlh dong varơuq jiq jiêh ku mư.” <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Kadraq xôq ti tol mư, hloay juneq mư dưk hyioh tok, ji ayuôôt laat Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="LUK 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Bơh tuôôy adro jư 'yo hnhư tagumq tok apok, vii tôq jaraq vii kơq Lôôk Jê-xu heq payơh bingq đom hngơy Sa-bat, lunưq kơy đnooy dii bing karôp đaneq: “E drơu hngơy đơu đom kaluh hngơy neq laa pheq dơơp varơuq. Vii anưq, dayh truh payơh bingq muut kaluh hngơy nưq, bơh leh aalq muut hngơy Sa-bat.” <verse eid="LUK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Bơh Lôôk tơơl hlê kơy nưq, ji Kadraq dăt: “Khơl xuum pa ôôh! Be aalq muut hngơy Sa-bat tôôy adro khơl kơy raay luh talơy vek bo long lưưa ku êêp vlôh klơlh chuông ji jarooy ni hooy hôôch daak ih? <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Măn adro khơl kadrê neq, laa koot kadrê ku Ap-ra-ham, laa adro đơu Sa-tan heq rôp vek, 'yo hơq, đom tuôôt kưl thơơm xanưm, mư leh duh jah luh vlôh klơlh varaq neq muut hngơy Sa-bat ih?” <verse eid="LUK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Tuôôy Kadraq đnooy kaluh apok nưq, tôôy adro tachơơl hlê Kadraq raay kamưưl, măn dêq bing tamooy karôp yôôych hlah hlaak truh dêq hloay kaluh varơuq akêh jah dưk dơơp xing Kadraq.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Nưq yôôch, Kadraq đnooy: “Daak dêh ku Kơy Plêêk yôôych dang dii varơuq kajoq, ji gô hnoq taso ni dii kajoq neq? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />Daak dêh nưq yôôych dang đaji muuyq kalook avơy đơu muuyq adro xok paraay đom hluôôt adro nưq, yôôch ni kôt tok jêêk vlôh muuyq poop ưk, ji xêêp plêêk dơơp tapu tol đook ku ni.”<verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Kadraq laay đnooy: “Gô hnoq taso daak dêh ku Kơy Plêêk dii varơuq kajoq? <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />Daak dêh nưq yôôych dang đaji tape đơu muuyq khơl kadrê xok aluq muut pe hlơk bôôt dong truh tuôôy bôôt vôô dêq tok.”<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Yôôch Kadraq hooy dalơh kaluh theng ji palơy pla, vơơ pato dayq vơơ dưk dơơp varơuq hooy truh Jê-ru-sa-lem. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Tuôôy nưq, muuyq adro hơq tơơl dii Kadraq: “Kuh Lôôk, jơq be vơ muuyq sôôq axit adro jah wơơt?” Kadraq tơơl hlê oot: <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />“Dayh tagoa tadơơp xôq hooy muut hlê 'mok kieep vii, gô đnooy ka oh ay xet, 'ngưng adro hnoq axek kach xôq muut đơu leh ik. <verse eid="LUK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />Atêq tuôôy kôôch hnhư heq xalaak kah ji kađnoch 'mok hlê, oh ay đơơu dưk pi gôk ji ahngoq 'mok, tơơl đaneq: ‘Kuh Lôôk, xiin luh ka 'wot.’ Yôôych tuôôy tơơl hlê oh ay, adro kôôch hnoq đnooy: ‘Gô be xet êêp, long êêp măn ka'leq vlôh.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />Tuôôy nưq, oh ay hnoq luh apok xôq tơơl đaneq: ‘'Wot heq xa hôôch kangưưr Kadraq, ji Kadraq heq pato dayq tol kaluh trôôk theng ku 'wot.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />Bơh kôôch hnhư hnoq tok apok, đnooy kung oh ay: ‘Gô be xet êêp măn ka'leq truh. Dayh chuh xangưưy klơlh gô, dêq hloay bing dơơp kông lưp hyioh jăk hơq!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />Măn aduq nưq, hnoq e nhim ook ji takik kaneeng tuôôy oh ay hloq Ap-ra-ham, I-sak, ji Ja-kôp, kung dêq hloay khơl kơy hlit măn đom daak dêh Kơy Plêêk, đơu leh e oh ay, vii biq avih vlôh pi gôk. <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Manih kadrơy hnoq truh xing đông ji tâây, xing băk ji naam, ji oot hnoq 'ngôôy waal xa đom daak dêh ku Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />Hơq, e khơl adro atêq lôôch đơu oot hnoq jêêk vlôh adroyq, ji e 'ngưng adro măn adroyq đơu oot hnoq jêêk vlôh atêq.”<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Muut kadih wat nưq, taleq dro Pha-ri-si nưq truh jeq, đnooy dii Kadraq: “Xiin thơy vlôh hooy ji dayh hooy xangưưy klơlh đnen vii Hê-rôt xung păk kaxêêt thơy.” <verse eid="LUK 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Dayh hooy, dăt xo karaak nưq: ‘'Yo nee, gô druyh kamuuych ji dưk dơơp kaluh varơuq payơh hngơy neng ji hngơy dơh, yôôch muut hngơy thưq pe gô dơơp payôôch xaleep.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Long anưq, đôôyq dii gô, varơuq duh dik laa pheq dơơp đnoyq varơuq hooy hngơy neng, hngơy dơh ji hngơy tăm ma rơ, vii đôôyq dii muuyq kơy hlit, leh hnoq ik kaxêêt pi gôk theng Jê-ru-sa-lem. <verse eid="LUK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />Ôôy Jê-ru-sa-lem, Jê-ru-sa-lem, may păk kaxêêt khơl kơy hlit ji tiip phơu khơl adro heq jah patăk truh dii may. Xet taleq yưk Gô xung anguk koot xau ku may hlê đaji kach đơu ier kadrok toom koot ni 'laarq panưr, đơu êêp leh trôôch. <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" />Hơq, hnhư ku êêp biq aklah goch klơlh êêp. Gô đnooy dii êêp, êêp kajưk dik leh hloq gô dong truh tuôôy kawat nưq hnoq truh, laa tuôôy êêp đnooy: ‘Đangq ayuôôt laat Kơy truh đom yal Lôôk.’”<verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />Varơuq nưq xalih vlôh tuôôy Kadraq hooy muut hnhư muuyq dro dưk xanok ku adrơơk Pha-ri-si đom muuyq hngơy Sa-bat xôq xa waal, ji oot đong tamaak 'yo tyauq tavooy Kadraq. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Ji hơq, muuyq adro nưq biq jiq bingq pangơlh golh măn hloay kangưưr Kadraq. <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Tuôôy luh apok, Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii khơl thơy ganuun ji manih Pha-ri-si, đaneq: “E ik pheep payơh bingq đom hngơy Sa-bat long be?” <verse eid="LUK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Bơh oot hnhep. Yôôch tuôôy rôôk xok adro bingq, Kadraq payơh adro nưq, ji ăm vlôh xuq. <verse eid="LUK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “kơyq đom khơl kơy e adro koot kanau, long muuyq ôô bo, biq klêh pôôt jiêng đom hngơy Sa-bat đơu leh hloay jơnưq duuy ni tok?” <verse eid="LUK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Oot leh hnoq tơơl hlê ik adroyq kaluh apok neq.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Yôôch Kadraq taboon ka khơl adro jah mơơy muuyq kadook atoh, vii nhonq hloq đaleq oot heq rơơlh kaluh aduq 'ngôôy kôt yơơt, lunưq đnooy dii oot đaneq: <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />“Tuôôy khơl kơy jah kơyq nưq mơơy truh jưq waal pajêêk, te 'ngôôy muut para xa măn aduq tơơl nhưk, leh kheoq hnoq ik e muuyq adro kôt galơh iaq khơl kơy heq jah adro nưq mơơy, <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />tuôôy manih heq mơơy oh ay hloay adro khach hơq hooy truh, đnooy dii khơl kơy: ‘Xiin nhương aduq ka kơy neq,’ yôôych khơl kơy hloay laa pheq nhonq xok aduq lôôch dii varơuq kamưưl. <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />Wih hlê, tuôôy khơl kơy jah mơơy, dayh hooy, 'ngôôy muut para xa măn aduq lôôch, xôq tuôôy adro heq mơơy khơl kơy truh, oot hnoq đnooy dii khơl kơy: ‘'Wơyq lơơy, xiin mơơy tok aduq yơơt iaq.’ Tuôôy nưq, hnoq e varơuq vado deng ka khơl kơy kangưưr tôôy adro 'ngôôy kung para dii khơl kơy. <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" />Vii kơyq vanê xăk tok hnoq biq haaq pôôt, ji kơyq haaq xăk apôôt hnoq jah vanê tok.”<verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Atêq nưq, Kadraq kung đnooy dii adro heq mơơy Kadraq: “Tuôôy kơy adoot waal hngơy dưk long waal klôôy, te mơơy khơl 'wơyq kơy, long oh ay kơy, long oh ay takuul takiel kơy, kung te mơơy khơl manih palơy pla karoh e, leh kheoq, oot kung hnoq ik mơơy hlê kơy, ji varơuq bla lêh xalih truh ka kơy. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Wih hlê, tuôôy kơy luh kawaal, dayh mơơy khơl manih adrah hrah, atul tâk, qwe tawek, apul phil, <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />yôôych kơy hnoq jah vanong, vii oot leh e xôq bla hlê kơy. Bơyh phon bla hlê hnoq jah deng ka kơy đom varơuq riirh hlê ku manih hyioh jăk.”<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Tuôôy muuyq đom khơl adro đong 'ngôôy para xa tameng kaluh apok neq, kơy nưq đnooy dii Kadraq: “Vanong hloay laa adro hnoq jah xa tôôp đom daak dêh Kơy Plêêk!” <verse eid="LUK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Bơh Kadraq đnooy dii kơy: “E adro hơq adoot waal kôt ji mơơy 'ngưng khach. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Truh wat waal, kơy patăk xapok kơy hooy xôq tauq ka khơl adro khach heq jah mơơy: ‘Xiin dayh truh vii waal xa juneq đong ralauq 'miêh.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />Ji dêq hloay oot laay tong adro muuyq đnooy tawaq. Adro adroyq dik đnooy dii kơy: ‘Gô heq root muuyq aloq ruôngq, ji gô e varơuq duh hooy 'yo ni. Xiin kơy ăm gô jah chôôyq ka'lăk.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />Adro kadrơy đnooy: ‘Gô heq root dăp đôôy ôô bo, ji jeq hooy thư paraat ni. Xiin kơy ăm gô jah chôôyq ka'lăk.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />Adro kadrơy đnoyq đnooy: ‘Gô heq xok kadrê, ji vii anưq gô leh hnoq hooy ik.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />Adro xapok xuq, taboon hlê kaluh varơuq nưq ka kôôch ni. Tuôôy nưq, atêq tuôôy tôq jaraq, adro kôôch hnhư heq đnooy dii xapok kơy: ‘Dayh dayh hooy vlôh kaluh trôôk kôt ji xalah de đom theng đơu jarooy xuq đnen khơl manih adrah hrah, atul tâk, apul phil ji qwe tawek.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />Xapok đnooy: ‘Kơy kôôch lơơy, 'wot heq dơơp varơuq kơy dăt, bơh măn e aduq hong.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />Kôôch đnooy dii xapok: ‘Dayh hooy vlôh tyauq kaluh trôôk kôt ji kaluh paga, yôôch hnen adro nưq muut, aleq dong viit hnhư ku gô. <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Vii gô đnooy dii ay đaneq leh kơyq đom bing manih jah mơơy hơq hnoq jah jưq waal ku gô.’”<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Tuôôy nưq, kaluh bing manih karôp thier 'ngưng đong hooy tyauq Kadraq, ji tuôôy wih xăk hlê, Kadraq đnooy dii oot: <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />“Atoh kơyq truh kung gô đơu leh 'yarơ vaq miq, kadrê koot, oh ay kanau, ay oh kadrê ni, ji hloay varơuq riirh ku ni đnoyq, yôôych adro nưq leh hnoq laa khơl xatyauq ku gô. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />Atoh kơyq leh hlôôy gay charăk ni ji tyauq atêq gô, yôôych adro nưq leh hnoq laa khơl xatyauq ku gô. <verse eid="LUK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />Vii manih leq đom oh ay xung xơy muuyq poop thaap, đơu adroyq dik leh 'ngôôy pôôt jauq 'yo tayuh jêêt — ni e đu xôq dơơp payôôch long be? <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />Xôq leh kheoq, atêq tuôôy ay nưq heq xơy xool đơu leh hnoq dơơp payôôch, dêq hloay khơl adro leq 'yo hloq dik laa tok apok xagiel ra ơơh ay nưq, <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />đnooy đaneq: ‘Adro neq xarôp dơơp xơy atok đơu be hnoq dơơp payôôch.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />Long viq vuua leq, tuôôy jeq hooy vlôh hmơt jăk dii vuua kadrơy tol aduq hmơt jăk, leh hnoq 'ngôôy pôôt, adroyq dêq jauq 'yo đaneq atoh vuua e kưl ravơu kuun, yôôych hnoq ik tahmơt dii bing kuun đong truh tachơơl hlê kung vuua dii vaarq kưl ravơu kuun be? <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Atoh laa leh ik, yôôych đom tuôôy vuua hơq măn aduq xangưưy, vuua neq patăk khơl jah patăk hooy apôôy tagu. <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Lunưq, dang đanưq, kơyq đom oh ay đơu leh ka'lăk tôôy thưq ni e yôôych leh hnoq laa khơl xatyauq ku gô. <verse eid="LUK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />Voh yôôych tolh, bơh atoh voh kung biq hlơp hloay viq phaak, yôôych ni hnoq ik panhưưm ăm phaak dii thưq kajoq? <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Ni be e ich ka vari kung leh xôq dơơp phon. Manih nưq kưq avih ka'lăk ni vlôh pi gôk. Kơyq e tôôr xôq tameng, dayh tameng.”<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Tuôôy nưq, dêq hloay khơl adro xok xơu ji adro kadrôôp maroh raay truh dii Kadraq xôq tameng Kadraq. <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />Ji yôôch, dêq manih Pha-ri-si hloay khơl thơy pato ganuun raay ramôôy, đnooy đaneq: “Manih neq jeq khơl adro kadrôôp maroh, ji xa achung dii oot.”<verse eid="LUK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Nưq laa Kadraq taboon kadook atoh neq ka oot, đaneq: <verse eid="LUK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />“Adro leq đom khơl kơy e muuyq hreek ôô trưưu, ji tuôôy biq hyaak hlơơp muuyq poop đom sôôq nưq, yôôych leh xôq hlê xiit kưl xiit poop hơq aduq manay rap ji hooy axek ôô trưưu hyaak dong truh tuôôy axek hloq ni? <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Tuôôy heq axek jah yôôch, adro nưq hlah hlaak hlôôy ni tok vara kơy. <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />Xuq truh hnhư, kơy nưq taayh khơl 'wơyq ji palơy pla kơy anguk hlê, đnooy dii oot: ‘Dayh hlah hlaak dii gô, vii gô heq axek hloq ôô trưưu biq hlơơp ku gô.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Gô đnooy dii khơl kơy đaneq kung muuyq đanưq, hnoq e varơuq hlah hlaak tol plêêk truh muuyq adro kadrôôp wiit xuum, iaq laa truh xiit kưl xiit adro hyioh jăk đơu leh e varơuq duh wiit xuum.<verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />Long adro kadrê leq e kưl đông baak, atoh đaji mư dơơp hlơp muuyq kapah, yôôych leh ataak đeen, rahiing hnhư ji dêq paraat akhiim axek dong truh tuôôy axek jah ih? <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />Tuôôy heq axek jah, mư mơơy khơl 'wơyq ji palơy pla tagumq hlê, đnooy đaneq: ‘Dayh hlah hlaak dii gô, vii gô heq axek hloq đông baak đơu gô dơơp hlơơp.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Kung muuyq đanưq, gô đnooy dii khơl kơy, e varơuq hlah hlaak măn kangưưr khơl kơy yaak ku Kơy Plêêk truh muuyq adro kadrôôp wiit xuum.”<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Atêq nưq, Kadraq taboon: “Muuyq adro hơq e vaarq koot kanau, <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />adro oh đnooy dii vaq, ‘Vaq lơơy, xiin ăm koot phon garuh anôôp thuôk ku koot.’ Ji kơy ahlook garuh anôôp kơy ka baarq. <verse eid="LUK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />Atêq nưq, leh jah taleq hngơy, tuôôy heq anguk agoop tôôy thưq, adro koot lưyq dưk tok hooy dêh xangưưy, măn đnư ay nưq tayuh dêq garuh anôôp ni tuôôy riirh kach agưt agooh. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Tuôôy ni heq tayuh xarêh tôôy thưq, yôôych muuyq đơơt pangoot hrah kôt dik xalih vlôh loch dêh nưq, ji ni pa xarôp biq adrah. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Yôôch ni hooy dơơp xapo ka muuyq adro tamooy đom dêh, ji kôôch patăk ni vlôh manay ruôngq ku adro nưq xôq ajư xuur. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Ni tajôh jah xa xing aduq kadôh tuôh, laa thưq bơy xuur đong xa, đơu be kơyq ăm ni. <verse eid="LUK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />Bơh đong tuôôy biit hlê truh ni, ni đnooy: ‘Xet taleq adro dơơp xapo ku vaq gô e tuôông xa raah jôh, măn gô jeq kaxêêt pangoot măn đnen! <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />Atêq tuôôy xalaak kah, gô hnoq hooy xuq kung vaq ku gô, ji gô hnoq đnooy dii vaq đaneq: “Vaq lơơy, koot heq lôp kadrôôp tachơơl dii plêêk ji kangưưr vaq. <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />Koot be taxưngq jah taayh laa koot ku vaq đnoyq. Xiin 'yo koot đaji muuyq adro dơơp xapo ku vaq.”’ <verse eid="LUK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />Ji tuôôy heq xalaak kah, ni hooy xuq kung vaq ni. Bơh tuôôy ni đong măn xing xangưưy, vaq ku ni heq tamaak hloq ni ji kơy arơơk xuum biit angơuq, yôôch charơơk truh gah, kơy khwuôt kabiin xok ranong ni ji hiip ni. <verse eid="LUK 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />Tuôôy nưq, adro koot đnooy dii vaq: ‘Vaq lơơy, koot heq lôp kadrôôp tachơơl dii plêêk ji kangưưr vaq. Koot be taxưngq jah taayh laa koot ku vaq đnoyq.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />Bơh adro vaq đnooy dii khơl xapok kơy: ‘Dayh dayh xagook aau kahliik tolh nhưk pahlưp ka ni, hlưk kook muut ti ni, ji troaq kaxôôp muut jôôk. <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />Dayh rôp bo koot heq, dơơp ôq ni, ji haay luh waal xa mưng. <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />Vii adro koot kanau neq ku gô 'miêh heq kaxêêt đơu heq riirh hlê, 'miêh heq hlơơp đơu heq jah axek hloq.’ Yôôch oot luh waal hlah hlaak. <verse eid="LUK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />Bơh koot kanau kôt ku kơy 'miêh đong măn pi gôk manay, ji tuôôy wiit xuq, ay hooy jeq truh hnhư, tameng tek hnưm varo kacheeu, ayuch ayauq. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Taayh muuyq adro xapok hlê, ay vôôch varơuq neq laa aleq. <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />Adro xapok tơơl dii ay đaneq: ‘Oh kanau ay wiit xuq ji vaq ay ăm dơơp ôq bo koot heq, vii kơq kơy heq đoonq oh nưq xuq hnhư hrok hrol tơơl dal.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />Lunư, adro koot kôt tôq jaraq, ay leh xung muut pi'lăp, ji vaq ay hooy vlôh adô ahmưk ay. <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />Bơh tuôôy tơơl hlê, ay đnooy dii vaq ay: ‘Vaq 'yo, koot dơơp varơuq ka vaq tuôôt taleq xanưm, ji koot koq hmưq 'yo galiah apok đinq ku vaq, đơu vaq be dong leq ăm koot muuyq ôô vove chwoay xôq koot hnoq ik xa waal dii khơl 'wơyq koot, <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />bơh tuôôy adro koot hơq ku vaq wiit xuq, laa adro heq dơơp xarêh dêq garuh anôôp ku vaq dii khơl xakwoah, yôôych vaq heq ăm dơơp ôq bo koot heq vii ni.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />Nưq yôôch adro vaq đnooy dii ay nưq: ‘Koot lơơy, koot hloay măn kung dii vaq, ji dêq hloay kaluh kajoq ku vaq laa ku koot. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Bơh đong dik đangq xôq luh waal ji hlah hlaak, vii ma oh kanau ku koot neq 'miêh heq kaxêêt đơu laay riirh, hmưq hyaak hlơơp đơu heq jah axek hloq.’”<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Kadraq kung đnooy dii khơl xatyauq: “E muuyq adro karoh hơq laa manih e muuyq adro xakaq 'yo ji adro nưq biq tauq avlôh dii kôôch vii tayuh dêq garuh anôôp ku kôôch. <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Atêq tuôôy taayh adro nưq truh, kôôch đnooy dii adro nưq: ‘Varơuq gô tameng truh ay laa aleq? Dayh đnooy vlôh apok padoh truh varơuq xakaq 'yo ku ay, vii ay leh hnoq dơơp xakaq 'yo đnoyq.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />Nưq yôôch adro xakaq 'yo kadih đnooy dii kadih xăk: ‘Gô pheq dơơp kajoq neq, vii kôôch gô đong xok hlê varơuq xakaq 'yo klơlh gô? Vok vari yôôych gô leh đu paraat, xa xiin yôôych kamưưl dik. <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />Gô xet gô pheq dơơp kajoq xôq tuôôy biq đuôôy klơlh varơuq xakaq 'yo neq, khơl drơy hnoq jarooy gô muut hnhư ku oot.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />Yôôch atêq tuôôy ăm taayh tong adro muuyq đom khơl thiuq lôôkq ku kơy kôôch ni truh, ni đnooy dii adro thưq nhưk: ‘Ay thiuq kôôch gô taleq?’ <verse eid="LUK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />Adro nưq tơơl: ‘Muuyq hreek thung jơu ô-liu.’ Nưq laa ni đnooy dii adro nưq: ‘Adrơk xok jơyq lôôkq ku ay, 'ngôôy pôôt, dayh valơk dăp kưl!’ <verse eid="LUK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />Atêq nưq, ni dăt muuyq adro kadrơy: ‘Măn ay thiuq lôôkq taleq?’ Adro nưq tơơl: ‘Muuyq hreek drong va qwaay.’ Ni dăt adro nưq: ‘Adrơk jơyq lôôkq ku ay, ji valơk thơơm kưl.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />Adro kôôch kheng adro xakaq 'yo lưp hyioh jăk nưq bơyh kơq ni heq dơơp varơuq thier khôôt kheoq. Vii koot xau ku đơơy neq khôôt kheoq iaq taso dii koot xau ku varơuq tađnah đom adrơơk ku ni. <verse eid="LUK 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Măn thơy đnooy dii oh ay, dayh dơơp 'wơyq ka xăk bơơn jêêt kua lưp hyioh jăk, xôq tuôôy kua nưq dêq yôôch, oot hnoq ik jarooy oh ay muut aduq măn đơơy đơơy. <verse eid="LUK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />Adro leq muuyq xuum đom varơuq thier de yôôych kung muuyq xuum đom varơuq kôt ji kơyq lưp hyioh jăk đom varơuq thier de yôôych kung lưp hyioh jăk đom varơuq kôt. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Vii anưq, atoh oh ay leh jêêk vlôh đangq tuôq gamưh đom garuh anôôp lưp hyioh jăk, kơyq hnoq pahnăp atăq ka oh ay garuh anôôp dik? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Ji atoh oh ay leh jêêk vlôh đangq tuôq gamưh đom kaluh varơuq thuôk truh khơl drơy, kơyq hnoq palo ka oh ay kaluh kajoq thuôk truh kadih oh ay? <verse eid="LUK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />Leh muuyq xapok leq hnoq ik hơu varơuq vaarq kôôch, vii xapok nưq hnoq 'yarơ adro neq đơu xung xiaq adro hơq, long ni hnoq vado dii adro neq đơu 'yo galiah adro hơq. Oh ay leh hnoq hơu varơuq Kơy Plêêk hloay jêêt baak tuôông xa ik.”<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />Tuôôy nưq, khơl manih Pha-ri-si, laa khơl adro xung jêêt baak, tameng dêq kaluh apok nưq, ji oot xagiel aklêêu Kadraq. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Khơl kơy laa adro xưng kadih xăk hyioh jăk kangưưr khơl drơy, bơh Kơy Plêêk xet xuum khơl kơy. Vii varơuq yơơt dik đom katul koot manih laay laa varơuq ramêq kangưưr Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="LUK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />Ganuun ji kaluh apok kơy hlit laa dong truh đơơy ku Jăng. Xing nưq kơn hơ, daak dêh Kơy Plêêk jah padoh taboon, ji tôôy adro jôôn paraat tawaak muut đnư. <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />Bơh dik laa klêq iaq ka plêêk ji vari jêêk vlôh rook hlơơp, măn iaq laa muuyq chư valơk đom ganuun jêêk vlôh lưp yuôôr.<verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />Dêq hloay adro leq ka'lăk kadrê ni ji pajêêk adro kadrơy yôôych lôp kadrôôp tuut taat, adro pajêêk khơl kadrê heq biq ka'lăk dii kanau yôôych kung lôp kadrôôp tuut taat.<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />E muuyq adro karoh hơq, kơy nưq hlưp aau tiaq ji varaay goh gool, tôôy hngơy, xa hôôch ahrơh agưt kach karoh e. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Măn muuyq adro adrah nưq anơng La-xa-rơ, xăk viik ple katôôch, jah xagook xôq măn 'mok hnhư manih karoh, <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />ji xuum trôôch jah xa aduq kaluh thưq rôh pôôt xing tol para manih karoh. Lunư, vơ e kaluh xo truh lieeh ple ku ay. <verse eid="LUK 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />Yôôch varơuq xalih vlôh nưq laa adro adrah kaxêêt, ji ay jah kơy yaak xagook truh xuum Ap-ra-ham. Atêq nưq, adro karoh kung kaxêêt ji kơy nưq jah xagook up. <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />Măn aduq manih kaxêêt, đong tuôôy măn đom jiq jiêh, tuôôy 'ngơơk mot ni tok, kơy nưq hloq Ap-ra-ham xing kơn xangưưy, kung dii La-xa-rơ đom xuum ku kơy. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Tok apok taayh tarok, kơy nưq đnooy: ‘Mo kơy Ap-ra-ham lơơy, xiin biit angơuq koot ji xiin dayh patăk La-xa-rơ xôq ay nưq 'nharuuk gooy lôk ti ay muut daak ji dơơp dong langưưp kapiet koot, vii koot thier jiq jiêh đom ôôlh neq.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />Bơh Ap-ra-ham tơơl: ‘Koot lơơy, dayh văch đaneq đom kawah đơơy ku koot, koot heq nhonq phon tolh ku koot, ji dang anưq, La-xa-rơ yôôych nhonq phon pơơl. Bơh juneq ay nưq jah hlơq hlôôp aduq đnen, măn koot dong chiuq jiq jiêh. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Kung dii dêq hloay kaluh varơuq nưq, măn katul haay ji koot heq jah xôq muuyq bơk jaruq thier kôt, aleq ăm manih leq xung tapa xing đnen truh aduq koot laa leh ik, kung leh hnoq tapa xing nưq hlê truh aduq haay ik.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />Nưq laa adro karoh đnooy: ‘Mo kơy lơơy, nưq yôôych koot kuh apôôy kơy đaneq kơy hnoq ik patăk ay nưq truh hnhư vaq ku koot — <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />vii koot e dăp oh ay — xôq ay nưq đnooy dăt oot, aleq ăm oot kung hnoq ik leh aalq hooy truh aduq jiq jiêh neq.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />Bơh Ap-ra-ham tơơl: ‘Oot e Môi-se ji khơl kơy hlit; oot pheq tameng tyauq khơl kơy nưq!’ <verse eid="LUK 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />Lunư, adro karoh tơơl: ‘Lưp 'leq, mo kơy Ap-ra-ham lơơy, wih hlê, atoh kơyq nưq xing aduq kaxêêt truh dii oot, yôôych oot hnoq wiit xuum.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />Bơh Ap-ra-ham đnooy dii kơy nưq: ‘Atoh oot leh tameng Môi-se ji khơl kơy hlit, yôôych atoh ăm kơyq nưq xing aduq kaxêêt riirh hlê, oot kung hnoq leh tuôq.’”<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Yôôch Kadraq đnooy dii khơl xatyauq kadraq: “Varơuq leh hnoq leh xalih vlôh laa kaluh kơq tagay dơơp lôp, bơh ra ơơh ka adro leq đơu dalơh ni, kaluh kơq dơơp lôp xalih vlôh! <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />Dik tolh ka adro nưq atoh đaji muuyq apal phơu jah vek rawiit ranong ni, ji ni biq avih pôôt tahli măn iaq laa xôq ni tagay dơơp lôp ka muuyq đom kaluh adro de neq. <verse eid="LUK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />Dayh 'yo rơơt jư xăk! Atoh muuyq adro oh ay xăk lôp kadrôôp, dayh toah trek adro nưq; ji atoh adro nưq wiit xuum, dayh tha ka'lăk ka ni. <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />Long adro nưq lôp kadrôôp dii oh ay truh pơh yưk đom hngơy, ji pơh yưk wiit hlê đnooy dii oh ay: ‘Gô wiit xuum,’ yôôych oh ay hloay hnoq tha ka'lăk ka ni!”<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Khơl jah rơơlh tơơl dii Lôôk: “Xiin athêêp xuum tuôq ka 'wot.” <verse eid="LUK 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Nưq yôôch, Lôôk tơơl: “Atoh oh ay e xuum tuôq dang muuyq kalook avơy, yôôych đaji tuôôy oh ay đnooy dii ưk jơu neq đaneq: ‘May pheq biq vưyq ưk tok ji jah pêêt 'laarq tahli,’ yôôych ni hloay laa pheq tameng tyauq oh ay. <verse eid="LUK 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />Bơh kơyq đom oh ay e xapok hooy akay ruôngq long xakaq ôô trưưu xing pi gôk manay wiit xuq đơu laay dăt ni: ‘Truh 'ngôôy muut para xa hloay’? <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Tađôôy muut đnư, be aalq adro kôôch hnoq đnooy dii ni: ‘Dayh adoot waal ka gô xa, ji hnek katêêk ni hơu varơuq gô đom tuôôy gô xa hôôch, yôôch atêq kaluh varơuq nưq, ay đơơu jah xa hôôch’ ih? <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />Adro kôôch nưq be kahnoq xuum xet vanong kajoq dii adro xapok vii ni heq dơơp kaluh varơuq jah patăk dăt, troq be? <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Oh ay kung anưq, tuôôy leq oh ay payôôch tôôy varơuq heq jah patăk ka oh ay, dayh đnooy đaneq: ‘'Wot laa khơl xapok lưp xưngq. 'Wot heq dơơp payôôch varơuq 'wot pheq dơơp.’”<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Varơuq xalih vlôh đom tuôôy đong tol trôôk truh Jê-ru-sa-lem, yôôych Kadraq dalơh hlê dêh jaap akăk katul Sa-ma-ri ji Ga-li-lê. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Tuôôy Kadraq muut đom muuyq theng nưq, kưl adro jiq bingq paruh kôô Kadraq, đơu oot dưk xing xangưưy <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />ji oot tok apok tơơl: “Kuh thơy Jê-xu, xiin biit angơuq 'wot.” <verse eid="LUK 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />Tuôôy 'yo hloq oot, Kadraq dăt oot: “Dayh hooy kahnoq xăk dii khơl thơy tơơk tưp.” Ji varơuq xalih vlôh đom tuôôy oot hooy, yôôych oot jah xarêh. <verse eid="LUK 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Yôôch muuyq adro đom sôôq oot, tuôôy hloq đaneq xăk heq jah xarêh, ay wiit xuq hlê, kôt apok ayuôôt laat Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />Ay kuu mot pôôt aduq jôôk Kadraq, kuh kway Kadraq. Ay nưq laa muuyq adro Sa-ma-ri. <verse eid="LUK 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Nưq laa, tuôôy tơơl hlê, Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy: “Leh aalq dêq kưl dro raay jah xarêh ih? Măn xiit dro hơq 'leq? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Aleq leh hloq kơyq wiit hlê kơn tađnah tađnaak ka Kơy Plêêk đêh vlôh adro tamooy kadrơy neq?” <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Yôôch Kadraq đnooy dii ay nưq: “Dayh dưk tok, ji hooy. Xuum tuôq ku ay heq payơh ay.”<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Tuôôy jah khơl manih Pha-ri-si vôôch tuôôy leq daak dêh ku Kơy Plêêk hnoq truh, Kadraq tơơl apok oot, ji đnooy: “Daak dêh Kơy Plêêk leh truh dii varơuq tamaak 'yo ik. <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />Manih nưq kung hnoq leh đnooy: ‘'Yo nee, măn đnen!’ long ‘Hơq hơq!’ Vii, dayh 'yo yơu, daak dêh ku Kơy Plêêk măn pi'lăp khơl kơy.”<verse eid="LUK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Yôôch Kadraq đnooy dii khơl xatyauq: “Hnoq e kaluh hngơy tuôôy đơu oh ay biit trôôch 'yo hloq muuyq đom kaluh hngơy ku Koot Manih, đơu oh ay hnoq leh hloq ik. <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />Ji khơl drơy hnoq đnooy dii oh ay: ‘Hơq, măn hơq!’ long: ‘Nee, măn đnen!’ Te hooy truh, kung te charơơk tyauq oot, <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />vii đaji bliek 'mek amô tađnah xing lawah 'laarq plêêk neq xaraar truh lawah 'laarq plêêk hơq, yôôych Koot Manih kung hnoq đanưq. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Bơh varơuq duh adroyq dêq ka Kadraq laa chiuq 'ngưng pơơl dal ji biq chôôyq ka'lăk bơyh adrơơk neq. <verse eid="LUK 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />Đaji varơuq heq xalih vlôh đaleq đom đơơy Nô-ê, yôôych ni kung hnoq đanưq đom đơơy ku Koot Manih. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />Manih nưq măn xa, hôôch, pajêêk, vôôch — dong truh hngơy Nô-ê muut đom tau, yôôch daak ngôp galaay truh ji păk kaxêêt dêq hloay. <verse eid="LUK 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />Kung anưq, đaji varơuq heq xalih vlôh đom đơơy ku Lot — khơl drơy măn xa, hôôch, root, tek, paraay pêêt, xơy atok, <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />bơh muut hngơy Lot vlôh klơlh Sô-đôm, yôôych jit ôôlh ji lưưu hwinh xing plêêk kahri pôôt, yôôch huur ka'lăk dêq hloay. <verse eid="LUK 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />Varơuq hnoq xalih truh tyauq kach nưq đom hngơy Koot Manih rama vlôh. <verse eid="LUK 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />Đom hngơy nưq, kơyq măn tol apo hnhư đơu garuh anôôp xăk măn đom hnhư, yôôych te pôôt xôq xok ni; ji dang anưq, kơyq măn pi gôk manay yôôych te wiit xuq dii kaluh thưq măn hlê. <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />Dayh văch hlê kadrê ku Lot. <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />Atoh kơyq axek kach jư varơuq riirh xăk yôôych hnoq hlơơp ni, bơh atoh kơyq ka'lăk yôôych hnoq jư 'yo jah ni. <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />Thơy đnooy dii oh ay, đom klôôy nưq, hnoq e vaarq adro achung muuyq chanưng, Muuyq adro hnoq biq xagook hooy, măn adro hơq hnoq jah xôq hlê. <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />Hnoq e vaarq adro apeh va đom kung muuyq aduq. Muuyq adro hnoq biq xagook hooy, măn adro hơq hnoq jah xôq hlê.” <verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" />[Vaarq adro pi gôk manay, muuyq adro hnoq biq xagook hooy, ji adro hơq hnoq jah xôq hlê] <verse eid="LUK 17:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Ji tuôôy tơơl apok, oot đnooy dii Kadraq: “Lôôk lơơy, măn 'leq nưq?” Yôôch Kadraq dăt oot: “Xaak kaxêêt măn 'leq, xêêp aak kung hnoq tưưuq hlê ka đnư.”<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Yôôch Kadraq taboon ka oot muuyq kadook atoh xôq ăm hloq varơuq duh dik đôôyq dii oot laa pheq hloay hloay xadrook apôôy, ji leh gưlh xuum, <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />đaneq: “Aduq theng hơq e muuyq adro padrok xadrah nưq leh kuh yôq Kơy Plêêk, kung be 'yo ra kajoq khơl drơy. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Đom theng nưq e muuyq mo valơu, ji mo kưq truh dii kơy nưq, tơơl: ‘Xiin xưh hyioh jăk ka gô adroyq adro tachơơl hlê gô.’ <verse eid="LUK 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />Tuôôt muuyq kawat kơy nưq leh hmưq 'miêh xuum, bơh atêq nưq, kơy nưq kadih đnooy dii xăk: ‘Long gô leh kuh yôq Kơy Plêêk long be 'yo ra kajoq adro leq, <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />bơh vii mo valơu neq kưq dơơp ngơyq miet ka gô, lunưq gô hnoq xưh hyioh jăk ka mo nưq, xôq mo nưq klơlh dơơp gô galeh galal tuôôy kưq truh luuy dong truh tuôôy payôôch varơuq neq.’” <verse eid="LUK 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Yôôch Lôôk đnooy: “Dayh tameng apok adro padrok xadrah lưp hyioh nưq đnooy. <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />Nưq yôôych, dang aleq Kơy Plêêk leh dưk dơơp hyioh jăk ka khơl adro jah rơơlh ku Kadraq, laa khơl adro klôôy hngơy apôôy xiin Kadraq, đơu Kadraq manưưn manưl hlê dii oot? <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Thơy đnooy dii oh ay đaneq Kadraq hnoq dưk dơơp hyioh jăk ka oot kach talăng jăk. Ju anưq, tuôôy Koot Manih truh, Kadraq dong dik hnoq axek hloq xuum tuôq tol vari be?”<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Yôôch Kadraq kung taboon kadook atoh neq ka muuyq sôôq manih, laa khơl adro kadih tuôq aduq xăk xamơk đaneq oot laa hyioh jăk ji 'yo leh ra kajoq manih drơy: <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />“Vaarq adro hooy tok truh hnhư hơu xadrook apôôy — muuyq adro laa manih Pha-ri-si, ji manih hơq laa manih xok xơu. <verse eid="LUK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />Manih Pha-ri-si dưk xadrook apôôy kaluh apok neq truh kadih xăk: ‘Kuh Kơy Plêêk, koot kuh kway Kadraq vii koot leh aalq dang đaji sôôq manih măn hlê — khơl varoh, khơl lưp hyioh jăk, khơl tuut taat — long pheq đnooy đaji manih xok xơu neq. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />Koot deek xa muuyq twuân vaarq yưk. Koot tơơk tưp phon kưl tôôy thưq koot axek jah.’ <verse eid="LUK 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />Bơh manih xok xơu, tuôôy dưk kơn xangưưy, pheq đnooy leh hôôk 'ngơơk mot tok plêêk, wih hlê kơy tuk tada kơy, tơơl: ‘Kuh Kơy Plêêk, xiin biit angơuq koot, muuyq adro e kadrôôp.’ <verse eid="LUK 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />Thơy đnooy dii oh ay, adro neq hooy xuq hnhư ni jah xưng hyioh jăk nưq leh aalq adro hơq, vii adro leq kadih vanê xăk tok hnoq biq haaq apôôt, bơh kơyq kadih haaq xăk apôôt hnoq jah vanê tok.”<verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Tuôôy nưq, khơl drơy xagook hloay dêq khơl on oh truh dii Kadraq xôq Kadraq avêq truh oot, bơh tuôôy hloq đanưq, khơl xatyauq toah khơl adro nưq. <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />Bơh Lôôk Jê-xu taayh oot hlê, dăt: “Dayh xôq on oh truh dii thơy, ji te klơl kơmq oot. Vii daak dêh ku Kơy Plêêk thuôk truh khơl adro đanưq. <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Dong dik, thơy đnooy dii oh ay, atoh kơyq leh nhonq xok daak dêh ku Kơy Plêêk đaji muuyq dro oh de, yôôych adro nưq kajưk dik hnoq leh ik muut đom nưq.”<verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Muuyq adro padrok nưq vôôch Kadraq, đaneq: “Kuh thơy kaxay xuum, gô hnoq nhonq jah varơuq riirh đơơy đơơy tuôôy dơơp kajoq?” <verse eid="LUK 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Bơh Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii manih nưq: “Aleq ay taayh gô laa kaxay xuum? Be kơyq laa kaxay xuum, đêh vlôh muuyq adro Kơy Plêêk đơu heq. <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />Ay heq xet kaluh varơuq ganeen — te lôp kadrôôp tuut taat, te păk kaxêêt manih, te atôk varoh, te dơơp xanưk pa ôôh, dayh kuh vado miq vaq ay.” <verse eid="LUK 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Nưq bơh ay tơơl: “Gô heq dơơp tyauq dêq hloay kaluh varơuq ganeen nưq xing tuôôy măn de ku gô.” <verse eid="LUK 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Lunư, tuôôy tameng đanưq, Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii adro nưq: “Măn e muuyq varơuq đong thiuq aduq ay. Dayh tek dêq kaluh kajoq ay e ji ahlook ăm ka manih adrah, yôôych ay hnoq e garuh anôôp tol plêêk — ji dayh truh đnen, hooy tyauq gô.” <verse eid="LUK 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Bơh tuôôy tameng taleq apok nưq, ay nưq jêêk vlôh rơu ri dik, vii ay nưq thier karoh. <verse eid="LUK 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Yôôch atêq tuôôy 'yo ay, Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy: “Khơl manih e 'ngưng garuh anôôp muut đom daak dêh ku Kơy Plêêk dik pơơl xet taleq! <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Vii dik laa klêq iaq ka ôô laak đa hooy hlê troop jarưp, taso dii muuyq adro karoh muut đom daak dêh ku Kơy Plêêk.” <verse eid="LUK 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Nưq laa, khơl adro tameng anưq, vôôch: “Nưq yôôych kơyq hnoq ik jah wơơt?” <verse eid="LUK 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Kadraq tơơl: “Kaluh varơuq lưp dơơp ik dii koot manih laa dơơp ik dii Kơy Plêêk.” <verse eid="LUK 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Yôôch Phi-e-rơ tơơl: “Thơy 'yo, 'wot heq ka'lăk tôôy thưq ji tyauq thơy.” <verse eid="LUK 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Nưq, Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Dong dik, thơy đnooy dii oh ay đaneq be e muuyq dro leq đơu heq ka'lăk hnhư, kadrê, oh ay, miq vaq, long koot xau, vii kơq daak dêh ku Kơy Plêêk <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />laay laa adro leh hmưq nhonq hlê 'ngưng phon iaq đom đơơy neq, ji đom đơơy jeq truh, 'ngưq laa varơuq riirh đơơy đơơy.”<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Atêq nưq, tuôôy heq jarooy đêh kưl vaarq dro jah rơơlh vlôh, Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Neq, haay đong hooy tok theng Jê-ru-sa-lem ji tôôy varơuq heq valơk truh Koot Manih bơyh khơl kơy hlit hnoq jah payôôch. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Vii Kadraq hnoq biq rôp muut ti khơl tamooy kadrơy, biq aklêêu tache, biq dơơp ra ơơh, ji biq kaxôh kaxoot. <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />Atêq tuôôy tiel dook Kadraq, oot hnoq păk kaxêêt Kadraq dơyh, ji truh hngơy thưq pe Kadraq hnoq riirh hlê.” <verse eid="LUK 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Khơl xatyauq be hlolh kajoq kaluh varơuq neq, ji apok nưq 'miêh biq đơ kađoq klơlh oot, lunưq oot leh hlolh kaluh varơuq heq jah đnooy.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Varơuq xalih vlôh tuôôy Kadraq hooy jeq truh theng Jê-ri-kô, muuyq dro apul nưq đong 'ngôôy xa xiin gah trôôk. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Tuôôy tameng apok bing karôp hooy dalơh hlê, ay vôôch hlơq varơuq kajoq đong xalih vlôh. <verse eid="LUK 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Oot ăm ay xet đaneq: “Jê-xu manih Na-xa-ret jeq hooy hlê.” <verse eid="LUK 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Ji yôôch ay taayh kôt, đaneq: “Ôôy Jê-xu, koot vuua Đa-vik, xiin biit angơuq gô.” <verse eid="LUK 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Khơl adro hooy adroyq toah ay, xôq ay pheq hnhep apok. Bơh ay kưq alo kôt iaq đnoyq: “Ôôy, Koot vuua Đa-vik, xiin biit angơuq gô.” <verse eid="LUK 18:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Tuôôy nưq, tuôôy heq dưk hlê, Lôôk Jê-xu vlôh tanưưl jarooy ay truh dii Kadraq. Yôôch atêq tuôôy ay truh jeq, Kadraq vôôch ay: <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />“Ay xung gô dơơp kajoq ka ay?” Nưq laa ay tơơl: “Kuh Lôôk, nưq laa ăm gô hnoq ik 'yo hloq.” <verse eid="LUK 18:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii ay: “Dayh 'yo hloq hlê! Xuum tuôq ku ay heq payơh ka ay.” <verse eid="LUK 18:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Hloay jơnưq, ay 'yo hloq hlê ik ji ay hooy tyauq Kadraq, tơơk tưp tađnah tađnaak ka Kơy Plêêk. Tuôôy hloq anưq, tôôy adro raay tơơk tưp apok ayuôôt laat Kơy Plêêk.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Tuôôy heq muut pi'lăp, Kadraq hooy dalơh hlê theng Jê-ri-kô. <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />Ji dayh 'yo muuyq adro, jah taayh anơng laa Xa-chê, kơy laa khơl draq xok xơu, ji kơy nưq karoh e. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />Kơy axek kach 'yo Lôôk Jê-xu laa kơyq, đơu kơy leh hnoq dơơp ik xing đom bing karôp, vii kơy e phook manih lêq de. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Yôôch tuôôy heq charơơk truh pi adroyq, kơy tok tol muuyq ưk thung xôq kơy hnoq ik tamaak hloq Kadraq vii Kadraq jeq hooy dalơh hlê ka trôôk nưq. <verse eid="LUK 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Tuôôy Kadraq hooy truh aduq nưq, 'ngơơk 'yo tok, Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii kơy: “Xa-chê, dayh pôôt dayh, vii hngơy neng gô duh pheq măn aduq hnhư ku ay.” <verse eid="LUK 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Nưq laa kơy pơl wol pahro pôôt ji hlah hlaak đoonq tiip Kadraq. <verse eid="LUK 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Tuôôy hloq đanưq, manih karôp raay ramôôy, đnooy đaneq: “Kơy nưq muut măn hnhư achung dii muuyq adro e kadrôôp.” <verse eid="LUK 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Bơh tuôôy Xa-chê dưk vlôh, kơy tơơl dii Lôôk: “Kuh Lôôk, xiin 'yo neq, gô ahlook muuyq panoot garuh anôôp ku gô ka manih adrah, ji atoh gô heq adô lưưt kơyq thưq kajoq, gô bla hlê galơh poot yưk.” <verse eid="LUK 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Tuôôy nưq, Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii kơy đaneq: “Hngơy neng varơuq wơơt xok heq truh dii hnhư neq, vii ay neq kung laa koot xau Ap-ra-ham. <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" />Vii Koot Manih heq truh xôq axek ji wơơt manih kaxêêt hlơơp.”<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Đong tuôôy oot domq tameng kaluh apok nưq, Kadraq xarôp varơuq taboon muuyq kadook atoh, vii Kadraq đong măn jeq theng Jê-ru-sa-lem, đơu oot biit đaneq daak dêh ku Kơy Plêêk jeq rama vlôh truh aduq yôôch. <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />Bơyh anưq, Kadraq taboon: “Muuyq hnhư karoh hơq hooy truh dêh xangưưy xôq kadih xăk nhonq xok qwuyen vuua yôôch wiit xuq. <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />Atêq tuôôy taayh kưl adro xapok ku kơy truh, kơy pahnăp ka oot kưl mi-na ji đnooy dii oot: ‘Dayh tabôôt xa đom tuôôy gô hooy xangưưy.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />Bơh tamooy ku kơy 'yarơ kơy ji atăq muuyq bing thêq oot tyauq atêq kơy đnooy: ‘'Wot leh xung adro neq dưk xakaq tol 'wot.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />Varơuq xalih vlôh tuôôy kơy wiit xuq atêq tuôôy nhonq xok qwuyen vuua, kơy vlôh tanưưl taayh truh tavơh kơy khơl adro xapok đơu kơy heq pahnăp jêêt, xôq kơy hnoq ik xet oot heq dơơp lơơy jah kajoq xing varơuq tabôôt xa. <verse eid="LUK 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />Nưq yôôch, adro thưq nhưk truh, đnooy: ‘Kôôch lơơy, mi-na ku kơy heq dơơp lơơy athêêp kưl mi-na.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />Kôôch đnooy dii ay nưq: ‘Xapok kaxay tamaq, ik dik. Vii ay heq muuyq xuum đom varơuq thier de, lunưq ay dayh adrơk qwuyen tol kưl theng.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />Ji adro thưq vaarq truh, đnooy: ‘Kôôch lơơy, mi-na ku kơy heq dơơp vlôh dăp mi-na.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />Yôôch kôôch kung đnooy dii ay neq: ‘Ay dayh dưk xakaq dăp theng.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />Muuyq adro kadrơy truh, đnooy: ‘Kôôch lơơy, xiin dayh 'yo mi-na ku kơy đơu gô 'miêh jư, jah anung đom khanh, <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />Bơyh gô yôq kơy, vii kơy laa manih ngiim khăk. Kơy xok đom aduq kơy leh xôq, ji goch đom aduq kơy leh paraay.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />Kôôch dăt ay nưq: ‘gamưh tol apok đnooy ku ay, gô hnoq xưh xadrah ay, adro xapok xơk tauq. Ay xet đaneq gô laa manih ngiim khăk, xok đom aduq gô leh xôq, ji goch đom aduq gô leh paraay. <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />Nưq yôôych vii aleq ay leh atăq jêêt ku gô muut hnhư baak, xôq atoh tuôôy wiit xuq, gô kung xok hlê jêêt nưq kung dii lơơy?’ <verse eid="LUK 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />Yôôch kơy đnooy dii khơl manih đong dưk đnư: ‘Dayh xok mi-na xing adro neq đơu ăm ka adro e kưl mi-na.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />Oot đnooy dii kơy: ‘Kôôch lơơy, ay nưq đong e kưl mi-na yôôch.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />‘Gô đnooy ka khơl ay xet, adro leq e hnoq jah ăm athêêp, bơh xing adro leh e, hnoq biq xok hloay dêq varơuq ni đong e. <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />Măn khơl adro tachơơl ku gô hơq, laa khơl adro leh xung gô dưk xakaq tol oot, dayh jarooy oot truh đnen ji păk kaxêêt oot kangưưr gô.’”<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Atêq tuôôy đnooy kaluh apok nưq, Kadraq dưk hooy đnoyq pi adroyq, kahluh tok truh Jê-ru-sa-lem.<verse eid="LUK 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Varơuq xalih vlôh tuôôy Kadraq hooy jeq truh Bêt-pha-jê ji Bê-tha-ni, truh aduq ngok đoot jah taayh laa Ô-liu, Kadraq patăk dăt vaarq dro xatyauq, <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />dăt đaneq: “Dayh kahluh muut palơy pla kangưưr, tuôôy muut đom nưq, oh ay hnoq hloq muuyq ôô lưưa koot biq vek, đơu tol ôô lưưa nưq koq adro leq hmưq acho. Atêq tuôôy luh talơy vek ni, dayh jarooy xuq đnen. <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />Atoh kơyq nưq vôôch oh ay: ‘Vii aleq khơl ay luh talơy vek ni?’ yôôych oh ay hnoq đnooy đaneq: ‘Lôôk e varơuq duh acho ni.’” <verse eid="LUK 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Nưq laa, tuôôy vaarq adro heq jah patăk dăt vlôh hooy, oot hloq kaluh varơuq dang đaji Kadraq heq đnooy dii oot. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Tuôôy oot đong luh talơy vek lưưa koot, khơl kôôch lưưa đnooy dii oot: “Aleq khơl ay luh talơy vek lưưa koot vlôh?” <verse eid="LUK 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />Oot tơơl đaneq: “Lôôk e varơuq duh acho ni.” <verse eid="LUK 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Yôôch oot jarooy ni xuq ka Lôôk Jê-xu ji atêq tuôôy hlơơk aau kahliik oot tol lưưa koot, oot rôôk Lôôk Jê-xu 'ngôôy tol ni. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Tuôôy Kadraq hooy dalơh, khơl drơy hlơơk aau kahliik ku oot tol trôôk. <verse eid="LUK 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Tuôôy Kadraq kahluh jeq truh ahmaat gôk Ô-liu yôôch, dêq bing khơl xatyauq karôp lơyq xarôp ahrơh hlah, kung xarooy kalh apok ayuôôt laat Kơy Plêêk truh dêq hloay kaluh varơuq taay yaak đơu oot heq hloq, <verse eid="LUK 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />đaneq: “Vanong hloay laa viq vuua truh đom yal ku Lôôk! Hrok hrol tol plêêk, ji tađnah tađnaak tol aduq thier yơơt!” <verse eid="LUK 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Muuyq sôôq manih Pha-ri-si xing đom bing tamooy karôp đnooy dii Kadraq: “Thơy lơơy, xiin toah trek khơl xatyauq ku thơy.” <verse eid="LUK 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Tơơl hlê oot, Kadraq đnooy: “Gô dăt êêp kơy, đaneq atoh oot hnhep yôôych kaluh kuk phơu neq hnoq tarok kôt tok.”<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Tuôôy Kadraq heq truh jeq, tuôôy 'yo hloq theng phôq, Kadraq nhim truh ni, <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />đnooy đaneq: “Jơq kajoq may heq nhonq xet đom hngơy neng, dik kadih may pheq xet, kaluh kajoq taway truh hrok hrol! Lunư, kaluh nưq juneq heq biq đơ kađoq klơlh mot may. <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Vii hnoq e hngơy xalih truh tol may, khơl adro tachơơl ku may hnoq đăp bơk rawiit may, oot hnoq wi rawiit may, ji hmơt ranhuq may xing tôôy panưh. <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />Oot hnoq hmơt pahrưp may kung koot xau may măn katul may. Yôôch oot hnoq be xôq hlê muuyq kuk phơu leq măn rahloot tol muuyq kuk phơu kadrơy măn aduq may, bơyh vii may heq leh nhonq xet kawat may jah hlơq hlôôp.”<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Yôôch tuôôy muut đom hnhư hơu, Kadraq xarôp đuôôy dêq khơl adro tabôôt tek măn đnư, <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />đnooy kung oot: “E apok valơk: ‘Hnhư Gô laa hnhư xadrook apôôy,’ bơh êêp heq dơơp ni jêêk ‘troop tapu ku khơl atôk varoh.’”<verse eid="LUK 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />Tôôy hngơy Kadraq kưq pato dayq đom hnhư hơu. Măn khơl thơy tơơk tưp kôt, khơl thơy pato ganuun ji khơl dưk xanok manih karôp 'miêh đong axek kach păk kaxêêt Kadraq, <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />ji oot măn koq axek jah kach leq đơu oot hnoq ik dưk dơơp, vii dêq hloay manih karôp raay karauq domq tameng Kadraq.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Varơuq xalih vlôh muut muuyq hngơy hơq, tuôôy Kadraq đong pato dayq manih karôp đom hnhư hơu ji padoh taboon Hêêl Kaxay, khơl thơy tơơk tưp kôt ji khơl thơy pato ganuun kung dii khơl draq lơơk garuk truh. <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />Oot đnooy dii Kadraq đaneq: “Xiin ăm 'wot xet bơyh taay yaak leq đơu thơy dơơp kaluh varơuq neq, long kơyq laa manih heq pahnăp ka thơy taay yaak neq.” <verse eid="LUK 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Bơh xôq tơơl apok, Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Gô kung hnoq vôôch khơl kơy muuyq apok, dayh đnooy ka gô: <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />Pheep bap-tem ku Jăng laa xing plêêk long xing koot manih?” <verse eid="LUK 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Nưq laa oot tajauq dii mamuuyq, đnooy đaneq: “Atoh haay đnooy: ‘Xing plêêk,’ kơy nưq hnoq vôôch: ‘Nưq aleq khơl kơy leh tuôq kơy?’ <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Măn atoh haay đnooy: ‘Xing koot manih,’ yôôych hloay manih karôp hnoq tiip phơu haay, vii manih karôp raay tuôq Jăng laa hnhư kơy hlit.” <verse eid="LUK 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Ji yôôch oot tơơl apok đaneq oot leh xet xing leq. <verse eid="LUK 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii oot: “Gô kung leh ăm khơl kơy xet bơyh taay yaak leq gô dưk dơơp kaluh varơuq nưq.”<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />Yôôch Kadraq xarôp taboon kadook atoh neq ka manih karôp: “Muuyq adro hơq pêêt muuyq hluôôt nho, ji ăm khơl adro pêêt nho xapo ni, yôôch hooy truh dêh kadrơy đom muuyq kawat xiik. <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />Truh muua varoot, kơy patăk muuyq dro xapok truh kung khơl pêêt nho xôq oot hnoq atăq ka kơy xok xing play gay ku hluôôt nho. Bơh atêq tuôôy tu tiel, khơl pêêt nho heq đuôôy ay nưq xuq ti hloh. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Kơy laay patăk đnoyq muuyq dro xapok kadrơy truh, bơh ay neq kung anưq, oot heq đuôôy ay xuq ti hloh atêq tuôôy tu tiel ji đnooy ra ơơh. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Yôôch kơy laay patăk đnoyq dro xapok thưq pe truh, bơh bing oot kung tiel ay nưq biq xưr, avih vlôh pi gôk. <verse eid="LUK 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />Nưq laa, kôôch hluôôt nho đnooy: ‘Gô pheq dơơp kajoq neq? Gô hnoq patăk koot kanau xung xiaq ku gô truh. Leh kheoq, oot hnoq kuh yôq ni.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />Bơh tuôôy khơl pêêt nho hloq adro koot, oot tajauq dii mamuuyq, đaneq: ‘Neq laa adro katôôl. Haay dayh păk kaxêêt ni, xôq garuh anôôp neq hnoq ik jêêk vlôh ku haay.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Ji atêq tuôôy vih adro koot nưq vlôh pi gôk hluôôt nho, khơl oot păk kaxêêt ay nưq. Nưq yôôych, kôôch hluôôt nho hnoq dơơp kajoq dii khơl nưq? <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />Kơy nưq hnoq truh păk kaxêêt dêq khơl pêêt nho neq ji pahnăp hluôôt nho ka khơl drơy.” Tuôôy tameng anưq, oot dăt: “Apôôy ăm ka varơuq nưq leh xalih vlôh.” <verse eid="LUK 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />Bơh tuôôy 'yo oot, Kadraq đnooy: “Nưq, apok heq valơk neq e iq đaleq:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">‘Kuk Phơu đơu thơq xơy dơyh ka'lăk,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">kadih ni jah jêêk vlôh phơu muum hnhư’?<verse eid="LUK 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />Adro leq klêh tol phơu nưq hnoq biq naat xaak. Măn atoh kơyq đơu phơu nưq klêh troq, yôôych ni hnoq raniaq naat adro nưq.”<verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Ji yôôch, khơl thơy pato ganuun kung khơl thơy tơơk tưp kôt axek kach tơơk ti dii Kadraq hloay kadih wat nưq, đơu oot yôq manih karôp, vii oot xet đaneq Kadraq taboon kadook atoh nưq đnooy truh oot. <verse eid="LUK 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />Tuôôy tyauq tavooy Kadraq thier kih, oot patăk dăt taleq dro 'yo xoak kadih dơơp vlôh đaji laa hyioh jăk, xôq oot hnoq ik rôp kadrôôp Kadraq đom apok đnooy, xôq pahnăp nôôp Kadraq ka khơl dưk xakaq ji padrok dêh ku kơy padrok xanok. <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Khơl adro nưq vôôch Kadraq đaneq: “Thơy lơơy, 'wot xet nưq laa thơy đnooy ji pato muuyq kach hyioh jăk, leh 'yo nêêh kơyq, đơu thơy pato trôôk daak ku Kơy Plêêk đom varơuq dik. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />Nôôp xơu ka Sê-sa laa varơuq jơq pheep đôôyq dii haay long be?” <verse eid="LUK 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Bơh vii nhonq xet varơuq xuum va ih ku oot, Kadraq đnooy dii oot: <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />“Ăm Gô 'yo muuyq đông đơ-ni-ê. Ni e long lơuq ji yal hlêêl ku kơyq?” Oot tơơl: “Ku Sê-sa.” <verse eid="LUK 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Nưq laa Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Nưq yôôych, dayh bla hlê ka Sê-sa kaluh kajoq ku Sê-sa, ji ăm Kơy Plêêk kaluh kajoq ku Kơy Plêêk.” <verse eid="LUK 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Oot leh hnoq rôp gêh apok tơơl nưq kangưưr manih karôp ik, ji vii dơơp akêh adroyq apok tơơl ku Kadraq, oot raay niinq hnhep.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />Atêq nưq, tuôôy taleq adro thuôk bing Sa-đu-sê kahluh hlê jeq, nưq laa khơl adro đnooy đaneq leh e varơuq riirh hlê, oot vôôch tagêh Kadraq <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />đaneq: “Thơy lơơy, Môi-se heq valơk pôôt ka haay, atoh ay ku adro leq nưq pajêêk kadrê, đơu tuôôy kaxêêt, adro nưq koq e koot, yôôych oh ku dro nưq duh xok adro kadrê valơu neq ji hnoq ik dưk tok muuyq rong nooy ka ay ni. <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Lunưq, hnhư hơq e pơh oh ay kanau, ji atêq tuôôy xok kadrê, adro ay kaa heq kaxêêt leh koot; <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />ji adro thưq vaarq, <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />yôôch adro thưq pe xok nau; bơh kưq đanưq đơu pơh adro raay leh e koot, ji kaxêêt dêq. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Atêq lôôch, adro kadrê kung kaxêêt. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Nưq yôôych, đom hngơy riirh hlê, mư nưq hnoq laa kadrê ku kơyq đom sôôq oot? Bơyh dêq pơh oh ay raay heq xok mư dơơp kadrê.” <verse eid="LUK 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii oot: “Koot xau đơơy neq yôôych pajêêk, ga. <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />Măn khơl kơyq jah 'yo laa xưngq đangq hươngh đơơy atêq ji varơuq riirh hlê xing khơl kaxêêt yôôych leh pajêêk kung leh ga. <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />Bơyh oot kung leh hnoq kaxêêt ik đnoyq, vii oot hnoq đaji kơy yaak; ji oot laa khơl adro koot ku Kơy Plêêk, tuôôy laa koot xau ku varơuq riirh hlê. <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" />Măn truh varơuq manih kaxêêt riirh hlê yôôych hloay đaji Môi-se heq ăm hloq aduq pôôp jaliê, tuôôy kơy xưng Lôôk laa Kơy Plêêk ku Ap-ra-ham, Kơy Plêêk ku I-sak, ji Kơy Plêêk ku Ja-kôp. <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />Kadraq leh aalq laa Kơy Plêêk ku manih kaxêêt, đơu laa ku manih riirh, vii dêq hloay raay riirh đôôyq dii Kadraq.” <verse eid="LUK 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Yôôch tuôôy taleq thơy pato ganuun tơơl hlê, oot đnooy: “Thơy lơơy, thơy đnooy thier troq.” <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Oot be hôôk vôôch Kadraq apok leq đnoyq.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Atêq nưq, Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Aleq đơu khơl drơy đnooy Lôôk Wơơt Dêh laa koot Đa-vik? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" />Vii đom rahlăp Thi Thiên, kadih Đa-vik e đnooy:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">‘Lôôk xanoh dii Lôôk gô đaneq:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">“Dayh 'ngôôy piik akoh Gô,<verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />dong truh tuôôy Gô dơơp ka khơl adro tachơơl ku Koot jêêk đool ka jôôk Koot.”’<verse eid="LUK 20:43" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />Lunưq, Đa-vik xưng Kadraq laa ‘Lôôk’, yôôych dơơp aleq Kadraq laa koot ku vuua nưq ik?”<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Đom tuôôy dêq hloay manih karôp đong domq tameng, Kadraq đnooy dii khơl xatyauq kadraq: <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />“Dayh rơơt rol dii khơl thơy pato ganuun, laa khơl adro trôôch hlưp aau yơơt hooy adaauq, trôôch kaluh apok vôôch hrok măn aduq tabôôt xa, ji kaluh aduq 'ngôôy kôt dik đom hnhư tagumq kung dii aduq kôt đom đaamq waal, <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />đơu bing oot xa luôôt hnhư ku khơl mo valơu, yôôch laay xadrook apôôy xiit rangek xôq kahnoq vlôh. Khơl adro nưq hnoq kang nhonq xưh xadrah parêq parơh iaq.”<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Tuôôy 'ngơơk tok, Kadraq hloq khơl manih karoh tơơk tưp kuah lêh ku oot muut đnaak hnhư hơu. <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />Yôôch Kadraq hloq muuyq mo valơu adrah nưq tơơk tưp muut đnư vaarq đông jêêt de. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Ji Kadraq đnooy: “Dong dik, thơy đnooy dii oh ay đaneq mo valơu adrah neq heq tơơk tưp muut 'ngưng iaq dêq hloay, <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />vii tôôy adro hơq xagook tơơk tưp muut kaluh kuah lêh xing varơuq raah jôh ku oot. Măn mo neq, xing aduq adrah thiuq ku mo, heq tơơk tưp dêq jêêt kuah đơu mo e.”<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Tuôôy taleq adro đong đnooy truh hnhư hơu, đaneq hnhư jah ta'meq 'moq bơơn kaluh kuk phơu kaxay tamaq ji kaluh kuah lêh tơơk tưp, yôôych Kadraq dăt: <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />“Kaluh thưq đơu oh ay đong hloq, hnoq truh hngơy đơu muut tuôôy nưq, be e kalook phơu leq hnoq jah xôq rahloot tol kalook phơu kadrơy đơu leh biq hrưp pôôt.” <verse eid="LUK 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Tuôôy nưq, oot vôôch Kadraq đaneq: “Nưq yôôych, thơy lơơy, tuôôy leq hnoq e kaluh varơuq nưq, ji dơuq hlêêl đaleq tuôôy kaluh varơuq nưq jeq xalih vlôh?” <verse eid="LUK 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Yôôch Kadraq tơơl: “Dayh rơơt rol xôq oh ay klơlh biq aluut pa ôôh. Vii 'ngưng adro hnoq truh taayh yal thơy, đnooy: ‘Kadih laa Gô,’ ji ‘Hngơy hlơơp dêh heq jeq.’ Te hooy tyauq oot. <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />Panưh kadrơy, tuôôy oh ay tameng truh hmơt jăk ji xalôônq xalaaoq, yôôych te varaal yôq, vii kaluh varơuq nưq pheq xalih vlôh adroyq, lunư, varơuq lôôch dik koq aalq laa hloay tuôôy nưq.”<verse eid="LUK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Atêq nưq, Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Tamooy neq hnoq dưk tok tachơơl hlê tamooy kadrơy, ji daak neq tachơơl dii daak hơq. <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />Hnoq e kaah kaluh đơơt ahrưng vari kôt ji 'ngưng đơơt pangoot hrah, kung dii 'ngưng jiq jool măn 'ngưng aduq. Hnoq e kaah kaluh dong varơuq akêh ramêq ji kaluh hlêêl kôt xing plêêk. <verse eid="LUK 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />Bơh adroyq tôôy varơuq nưq, khơl drơy hnoq palo ti ku oot tol oh ay ji hnoq rôp toop oh ay, tuôôy pahnăp atăq ka kaluh hnhư tagumq ji hnhư tu, rôp jarooy oh ay truh kangưưr khơl vuua ji padrok xanok vii kơq yal thơy. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Varơuq nưq hnoq jêêk vlôh kawah xôq oh ay đnooy vlôh apok xanưk. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" />Lunưq, dayh đinq aduq xuum oh ay leh ralauq palauq xôq đnooy bing kadih, <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />vii thơy hnoq kahniq ka oh ay apok xarooy ji varơuq khôôt xet đơu dêq hloay khơl tachơơl oh ay leh hnoq tachơơl hlê long aklơ ka'lăk ik. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />Bơh oh ay pheq đnooy hnoq biq pahnăp nôôp bơyh miq vaq, oh ay, oh ay katul takiel ji khơl 'wơyq, yôôch khơl drơy hnoq păk kaxêêt muuyq sôôq manih đom oh ay. <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />Oh ay hnoq biq tôôy adro 'yarơ geet vii yal thơy. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />Đơu muuyq raq hlôôk tol akoq oh ay kung leh hlơơp 'leq. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Đom varơuq atuq xuum chiuq uunq ku oh ay, oh ay hnoq jah phool hiel oh ay.<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />Bơh atoh tuôôy leq oh ay hloq theng Jê-ru-sa-lem biq wi rawiit xing kaluh bing kuun, yôôych tuôôy nưq dayh xet đaneq varơuq pahyaak pahrưp theng neq heq jeq yôôch. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Tuôôy nưq, kơyq đom dêh Ju-đê, dayh padu tok gôk, kơyq măn katul theng, dayh chuh hooy, ji kơyq măn pi gôk ruôngq, te muut đom theng. <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" />Vii neq laa kaluh hngơy bla hlê xôq tôôy apok heq valơk jah jêêk yuôôr. <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Bơh, jiq jiêh hloay ka khơl kadrê đong măn bonq ji khơl miq đong ăm koot uq đom kaluh hngơy nưq! Vii hnoq e pơơl dal đom dêh, ji đơơt tôq jaraq kahri tol tamooy neq. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />Oot hnoq gưlh kaxêêt 'laarq pla xieh ji oot biq rôp truh tôôy daak dêh, ji theng Jê-ru-sa-lem hnoq biq kaluh tamooy daak kadrơy joaq jalon dong truh tuôôy đơu tuôôy đơơy ku kaluh tamooy daak kadrơy jah xaleep.<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />Hnoq e kaluh hlêêl tol mot hngơy, xiêk kung kaluh xalok, ji varơuq hlu rơu ku kaluh tamooy măn 'laarq vari đom tuôôy xôôl dôôl jo xarooy pariau ook ku daak tahli ji ralaaq tahli puh kaxuh. <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />Khơl drơy phoch langoch vii yôq varaal ji takôô kaluh pơơl dal jeq kahri pôôt koot manih tol vari, vii kaluh qwuyen lưk tol plêêk hnoq hrưng anhưh. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" />Atêq nưq, oot hnoq jah hloq Koot Manih kahri truh đom đum kluk kung dii taay yaak ji tađnah tađnaak kôt lơyq. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Bơh tuôôy kaluh varơuq nưq xarôp xalih vlôh, dayh dưk tok ji 'ngơơk yơơt akoq oh ay, vii varơuq jah wơơt ku oh ay đong truh jeq.”<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Kadraq taboon ka oot muuyq kadook atoh: “Dayh 'yo ưk pok puut ji dêq hloay ưk ôôlh. <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />Paq kê tuôôy leq ni vơơ muh vlok vlôh xamok, oh ay xet, tuôôy kadih tamaak 'yo hloq, đaneq muua tôq heq jeq yôôch. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Kung anưq, tuôôy oh ay hloq kaluh varơuq neq xalih vlôh, oh ay pheq xet đaneq daak dêh ku Kơy Plêêk heq jeq. <verse eid="LUK 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />Dong dik, thơy đnooy dii oh ay đaneq adrơơk neq kajưk dik hnoq leh kaxêêt hlơơp dong truh tuôôy kaluh varơuq hơq xalih vlôh. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Plêêk ji vari hnoq hooy hlơơp, bơh kaluh apok ku thơy kajưk dik hnoq leh dong leq hooy hlơơp.<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />Bơh dayh rơơt rol dii kadih xăk, xôq xuum oh ay klơlh biq dơơp ka parêq parơh đom varơuq xa hôôch, vuul weel ji kaluh varơuq lo đơơy riirh, truh tuôôy hngơy nưq hnoq ik leh xanih ka ôp pôôt tol oh ay <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />đaji rayaalh lolh, vii varơuq nưq hnoq xalih truh ka tôôy adro riirh tol loch raak vari. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Bơh dayh kah parol đom tôôy tuôôy, xadrook apôôy xôq ka oh ay e đu paraat xôq dalơh hlê dêq hloay kaluh varơuq jeq xalih vlôh nưq, ji xôq dưk kangưưr Koot Manih.”<verse eid="LUK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Nưq laa muut ka hngơy, Kadraq pato dayq đom hnhư hơu, măn tuôôy rayôôp klôôy, atêq tuôôy hooy tok tol gôk taayh laa Ô-liu, Kadraq padơy ơơr ka klôôy. <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />Ji tôôy adro truh dii Kadraq muut xaroq meel xôq tameng Kadraq đom hnhư hơu.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />Lêh Tôôp Leh Tape, jah taayh laa lêh Dalơh Hlê, đong jeq truh. <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />Khơl thơy tơơk tưp kôt ji thơy pato ganuun đong axek kach leq đơu oot hnoq ik păk kaxêêt Kadraq, vii oot 'miêh yôq manih karôp.<verse eid="LUK 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Yôôch Sa-tan nhôp muut Ju-đa, adro jah taayh laa Ich-ka-ri-ôt, măn đom sôôq kưl vaarq adro jah rơơlh. <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Ji, tuôôy heq truh tavơh, ni tajauq dii khơl thơy tơơk tưp kôt ji padrok kuun hnhư hơu truh kach ni hnoq ik pahnăp nôôp Kadraq ka oot. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Oot mưng me ji ưng rapa ăm ni jêêt. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Ni ưng anưq ji axek kawah pahnăp nôôp Kadraq ka oot tuôôy leh e mot manih karôp.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Yôôch hngơy lêh Tôôp Leh Tape truh, laa hngơy đơu khơl drơy pheq tơơk tưp trưưu koot lêh Dalơh Hlê. <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Kadraq patăk Phi-e-rơ ji Jăng hooy, dăt: “Dayh hooy ralauq palauq lêh Dalơh Hlê ka haay, xôq haay kung xa.” <verse eid="LUK 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />Oot đnooy dii Kadraq: “Thơy xung 'wot ralauq palauq măn 'leq?” <verse eid="LUK 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Yôôch Kadraq tơơl apok oot: “Nee, tuôôy oh ay heq muut đom theng, muuyq adro khơl kanau ta'nhaak wo daak hnoq tavơh oh ay. Dayh hooy tyauq adro nưq muut đom apoop hnhư đơu ay nưq hooy muut. <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />Ji oh ay hnoq đnooy dii kôôch hnhư: ‘Thơy dăt kơy: “Rawaak phong khach aduq thơy hnoq ik xa lêh Dalơh Hlê dii khơl xatyauq ku thơy măn 'leq?”’ <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Kơy nưq hnoq pato ka oh ay muuyq phong kôt măn tol rawaak e 'miêh kaluh tuôông. Dayh adoot waal xa aduq nưq.” <verse eid="LUK 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Nưq yôôch, tuôôy heq dưk hooy, oot hloq varơuq jơq dang đaji Kadraq heq đnooy dii oot. Ji oot ralauq palauq ka lêh Dalơh Hlê.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Tuôôy wat xa truh, Kadraq 'ngôôy muut para, ji khơl jah rơơlh 'ngôôy kung dii Kadraq. <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Dii xuum biit trôôch, thơy heq xung xa lêh Dalơh Hlê neq dii oh ay adroyq tuôôy thơy chiuq pơơl dal. <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />Vii thơy đnooy dii oh ay, đaneq thơy kajưk dik hnoq leh xa lêh neq dong truh tuôôy lêh nưq jah payôôch đom daak dêh ku Kơy Plêêk.” <verse eid="LUK 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Ji atêq tuôôy xok dooy ji kuh kway, Kadraq dăt: “Dayh nhonq xok dooy neq ji aklah ahlook ka mamuuyq. <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />Vii thơy đnooy dii oh ay, xing neng kơn atêq, thơy kajưk dik hnoq leh hôôch play nho neq, dong truh tuôôy daak dêh ku Kơy Plêêk truh.” <verse eid="LUK 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Ji atêq tuôôy xok tôôp ji kuh kway, Kadraq pleh vlôh ji palo ka oot, đnooy: “Neq laa xăk xamơk thơy, vii oh ay đơu pahnăp ăm. Dayh dơơp varơuq neq đom varơuq dong văch truh Thơy.” <verse eid="LUK 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Kung dang đanưq dii dooy, atêq tuôôy heq xa, Kadraq đnooy: “Dooy neq laa tavek đơơu đom vahaap thơy, laa vahaap biq kahrôq vlôh vii oh ay. <verse eid="LUK 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />Lunư, 'yo hơq, pla ti ku adro xalih xuum thơy măn tol para achung dii thơy. <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />Vii ju Koot Manih vlôh hooy tyauq đaji varơuq heq jah đinq, bơh ra ơơh ka adro nưq, laa adro đơu hlê ni, Kadraq biq aklơ nôôp!” <verse eid="LUK 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Oot xarôp takaay tayaat dii mamuuyq adro đanưq hnoq ik laa kơyq đom bing oot, laa adro đong đinq dơơp varơuq nưq.<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />Nưq yôôch, muuyq đơơt tayaat takaay kung xalih vlôh đom katul oot truh adro leq đom sôôq oot jah 'yo laa kôt iaq hloay. <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />Nưq yôôch, Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Khơl viq vuua ku kaluh daak xok paraat kalh xakaq jư khơl drơy, ji khơl adro adrơk qwuyen tol tamooy jah taayh laa ‘manih kahniq vanong.’ <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" />Bơh dii oh ay yôôych leh ik đanưq. Xaloah muut đnư, adro kôt dik đom oh ay pheq jêêk vlôh đaji adro de nhưk, ji adro dưk xakaq đaji adro hơu varơuq. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" />Vii kơyq kôt iaq, adro 'ngôôy xa long adro hơu varơuq? Be aalq laa adro 'ngôôy xa ih? Nưq đơu thơy măn katul oh ay đaji muuyq adro hơu varơuq. <verse eid="LUK 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />Bơh oh ay laa khơl adro heq măn takhiit dii thơy đom kaluh thưh thek ku thơy. <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />Thơy kung kahniq ka oh ay, đaji Vaq thơy heq kahniq daak dêh ka thơy, <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" />xôq oh ay hnoq ik xa hôôch kung para ku thơy đom daak dêh thơy, ji 'ngôôy tol ngôôy xưh xadrah kưl vaarq adrơơk nooy ku I-sơ-ra-ên.<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />Si-môn lơơy, Si-môn, 'yo hơq, Sa-tan heq đooy atê ôôp ay đaji va qwaay. <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />Bơh thơy heq xadrook apôôy ka ay xôq xuum tuôq ay leh tayuh hlơơp. Ji ay, tuôôy heq rawiit wiit hlê, dayh dơơp ka khơl oh ay haay kalh paraat.” <verse eid="LUK 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Bơh ay tơơl dii Kadraq: “Kuh Lôôk, gô 'miêh xuum kung hooy dii Kadraq hloay kaah muut tu ji truh aduq kaxêêt.” <verse eid="LUK 22:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Bơh Kadraq dăt: “Phi-e-rơ lơơy, thơy đnooy dii ay, hngơy neng ier pôô hnoq leh rok adroyq tuôôy ay leh nhonq xet thơy pe yưk.”<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />Kadraq đnooy kung oot: “Tuôôy thơy patăk oh ay hooy leh xagook tyauq thuuyq jêêt, kaxuuy droong, kaxôôp jeep, oh ay 'leq e thiuq kajoq, jơq be?” Oot tơơl: “Leh kajoq dêq.” <verse eid="LUK 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Yôôch Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Bơh juneq, kơyq e thuuyq jêêt, dayh xok yơu, ji kaxuuy droong kung anưq. Kơyq koq e xieh, dayh tek aau kahliik ni đơu root. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" />Vii thơy đnooy dii oh ay đaneq apok heq jah valơk neq pheq jah jêêk aduq thơy: ‘Ji kadraq heq biq xôq achung dii khơl adro lưp ganuun.’ Vii dik varơuq đnooy truh thơy pheq payôôch.” <verse eid="LUK 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Nưq yôôch, oot tơơl: “Kuh Lôôk, 'yo neq, aduq đnen e vaarq pla xieh.” Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Nưq laa đu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Atêq tuôôy vlôh klơlh, Kadraq hooy truh gôk Ô-liu đaji tôôy ragơy, măn khơl xatyauq kung hooy tyauq Kadraq. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Tuôôy heq hooy truh aduq, Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Dayh xadrook apôôy xôq leh gưlh muut adô aluut.” <verse eid="LUK 22:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Kadraq chuh xangưưy klơlh aduq oot muuyq kawah kơh qwel muuyq look phơu, ji kul takuul pôôt, Kadraq xadrook apôôy, <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />đaneq: “Kuh Vaq, atoh Vaq xung, xiin tơơk dooy neq klơlh Koot. Ju anưq, leh tyauq iq Koot, wih hlê, xiin iq Vaq jah jêêk.” <verse eid="LUK 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />[Muuyq kơy yaak xing plêêk rama vlôh kangưưr Kadraq, athêêp paraat ka Kadraq. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Măn katul varơuq jiq ra ơơh, Kadraq xadrook apôôy kang padêq xuum, ji pa uh Kadraq jêêk vlôh đaji kaluh katoh vahaap klêh pôôt vari.] <verse eid="LUK 22:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Tuôôy dưk tok klơlh aduq xadrook apôôy, Kadraq hooy truh aduq khơl xatyauq, Kadraq hloq oot đong vik vii hlu rơu. <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Aleq oh ay vik? Kadrăch kah xadrook apôôy yơu, xôq oh ay klơlh gưlh muut adô aluut.”<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Tuôôy Kadraq măn đong đnooy, 'yo hơq, muuyq bing karôp ji adro jah taayh laa Ju-đa, muuyq đom kưl vaarq adro jah rơơlh, jarooy adroyq oot. Ni truh jeq Lôôk Jê-xu xôq hiip Kadraq. <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />Bơh Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii ni: “Ju-đa, ay xalih xuum Koot Manih bơơn muuyq yưk hiip ih?” <verse eid="LUK 22:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Tuôôy khơl manih dưk rawiit Kadraq nhonq hloq varơuq jeq xalih vlôh, oot vôôch: “Kuh Lôôk, 'wot e duh hmơt hlê bơơn xieh be?” <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Muuyq adro nưq đom sôôq oot heq dool xapok ku thơy tơơk tưp kôt, ji dool kloh tôôr akoh ku ay nưq. <verse eid="LUK 22:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Bơh tơơl hlê, Lôôk Jê-xu dăt: “Dayh xôq kadih ka varơuq neq!” Ji tuôôy kapi aduq tôôr nưq, Kadraq payơh ka ay nưq. <verse eid="LUK 22:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Atêq nưq, Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy dii khơl adro truh rôp Kadraq, 'ngưq laa khơl thơy tơơk tưp kôt, khơl padrok kuun hnhư hơu, ji khơl draq lơơk, đaneq: “Khơl kơy truh dii xieh ji gay đaji rôp varoh ih? <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />Tôôy hngơy, tuôôy gô măn kung khơl kơy đom hnhư hơu, khơl kơy leh palo ti tol gô. Bơh neq laa wat ku khơl kơy ji qwuyen lưk kamơng jaluk.”<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Yôôch, atêq tuôôy rôp jư Kadraq, oot xagook hooy ji jarooy truh hnhư ku thơy tơơk tưp kôt. Măn Phi-e-rơ tyauq Kadraq xing xangưưy. <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Tuôôy heq atuut muuyq đum ôôlh măn katul chaal ji 'ngôôy anguk hlê kung mamuuyq, Phi-e-rơ 'ngôôy achung dii oot. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Tuôôy nưq, mư xapok kadrê nưq, tuôôy hloq kơy đong 'ngôôy pi tađnah ôôlh yôôych 'yo trưng trưng muut kơy, mư đnoyq: “Kơy neq kung măn dii manih hơq.” <verse eid="LUK 22:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Bơh kơy chôôyq, đaneq: “Nee mư, gô e xet kơy nưq 'leq.” <verse eid="LUK 22:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Muuyq jơy tra, muuyq adro kadrơy, tuôôy hloq kơy, yôôych đnooy: “Ay kung thuôk truh bing oot.” Bơh Phi-e-rơ dăt: “Nee ay, leh aalq gô.” <verse eid="LUK 22:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Kơh muuyq wat kơn atêq, muuyq adro kadrơy đnoyq đnooy kajưk đaneq: “Jơq laa ay neq kung măn kung dii adro hơq, vii ay nưq kung laa manih Ga-li-lê.” <verse eid="LUK 22:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Bơh Phi-e-rơ đnooy: “Nee ay hơq, gô be hlolh ay đong đnooy kajoq.” Hloay lunưq, đom tuôôy kơy măn đong đnooy, muuyq poop ier pôô kôt apok rok. <verse eid="LUK 22:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Lôôk wih hlê 'yo Phi-e-rơ, ji Phi-e-rơ văch hlê apok ku Lôôk, đaleq Kadraq heq đnooy dii kơy đaneq: “Hngơy neng adroyq tuôôy ier pôô rok, ay hnoq chôôyq thơy pe yưk.” <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Ji tuôôy heq hooy vlôh pi gôk, kơy nhim ook kach panuh areh xuum.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Khơl adro jư 'yo Kadraq heq đnooy axaap, hmơt dook Kadraq. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />Biik mot Kadraq hlê yôôch, bing oot đôôq Kadraq đaneq: “Đnooy hlit yơu! Kơyq laa manih hmơt kơy?” <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Oot đnooy kung Kadraq 'ngưng apok katơơk galơh kadrơy đnoyq.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Vơơ tuôôy plêêk tađnah, khơl kadraq lơơk đom manih karôp, e khơl thơy tơơk tưp kôt ji khơl thơy pato ganuun, heq tagumq hlê ji oot xagook Kadraq truh Hnhư Xadrah ku oot, <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />đnooy: “Atoh kơy laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, dayh đnooy dii 'wot.” Bơh Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Atoh gô dăt khơl kơy, kajưk dik khơl kơy leh tuôq; <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />măn atoh gô e vôôch, kajưk dik khơl kơy leh tơơl apok. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Bơh xing neng truh atêq, Koot Manih hnoq 'ngôôy piik akoh ku Kơy Plêêk taay yaak.” <verse eid="LUK 22:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Tuôôy nưq, bing oot raay đnooy: “Nưq, kơy laa Koot ku Kơy Plêêk ih?” Yôôch Kadraq đnooy vlôh dii oot: “Kadih khơl kơy đong đnooy đaneq gô laa Kơy nưq.” <verse eid="LUK 22:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Nưq laa oot dăt: “Haay măn duh dơơp xanưk kajoq đnoyq? Vii kadih haay heq tameng xing huuy ni.”<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Hloay bing khơl oot dưk tok, xagook Kadraq truh Phi-lat. <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />Oot pa xarôp đnooy tauq kadraq, đaneq: “'Wot hloq kadra neq dơơp pa mê tamooy 'wot, klơl kơmq nôôp xơu ka Sê-sa, ji kadih xưng xăk laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, 'ngưq laa vuua.” <verse eid="LUK 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Tuôôy nưq, Phi-lat vôôch Kadraq, đaneq: “E jơq ay laa vuua tamooy Jo Thaiq be?” Bơh tuôôy tơơl apok kơy nưq, Kadraq đnooy: “Kadih kơy đnooy anưq.” <verse eid="LUK 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Atêq nưq, Phi-lat đnooy dii khơl thơy tơơk tưp kôt ji bing karôp: “Gô leh axek hloq kadrôôp xơk kajoq dêq aduq adro khơl kanau neq.” <verse eid="LUK 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Bơh oot kưq kăng ngăk đnooy đaneq: “Ni ahluk ahlul manih karôp, pato dayq loch hloay dêh Ju-đê, xarôp xing Ga-li-lê dong truh ka aduq neq.” <verse eid="LUK 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Tuôôy Phi-lat tameng đanưq, kơy vôôch Kadraq jơq be laa tamooy Ga-li-lê. <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Tuôôy xet ik đaneq Kadraq măn 'laarq qwuyen ku Hê-rôt, kơy nưq atăq Kadraq hlê ka Hê-rôt, kadih vuua kung đong măn aduq Jê-ru-sa-lem đom kaluh hngơy nưq.<verse eid="LUK 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Tuôôy Hê-rôt hloq Lôôk Jê-xu, kơy nưq mưng dik jo kơy 'miêh heq xung tavơh Kadraq xing xiit dik yôôch, vii heq tek taboon truh Kadraq, đơu kơy nưq takôô 'yo hloq pheep akêh leq nưq jah kahnoq vlôh bơyh Kadraq. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Nưq laa, kơy nưq vôôch Kadraq đom 'ngưng apok, bơh Kadraq leh tơơl hlê kơy kajoq dêq. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Măn khơl thơy tơơk tưp kôt ji thơy pato ganuun dưk đnư dik deh tauq kadrôôp Kadraq. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Yôôch kaah Hê-rôt hloay kuun ku kơy nưq đnooy toah Kadraq, ji atêq tuôôy xagiel aklêêu Kadraq, pahlưp aau xadroh ah ka Kadraq, kơy nưq atăq bla Kadraq hlê ka Phi-lat. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Tuôôy nưq, kaah Hê-rôt ji Phi-lat heq jêêk vlôh khơl 'wơyq dii mamuuyq đom hngơy nưq, vii adroyq nưq đong măn e thơơl 'yarơ geet đom katul vaarq adro oot.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Atêq nưq, atêq tuôôy Phi-lat ăm taayh tagumq hlê khơl thơy tơơk tưp kôt, khơl padrok xakaq ji manih karôp, <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />kơy đnooy dii oot: “Khơl kơy jarooy truh ka gô adro khơl kanau neq đaji adro pamê manih karôp, ji 'yo neq, atêq tuôôy vôôch dook ay nưq kangưưr khơl kơy, gô leh axek hloq đom adro neq kadrôôp xơk kajoq đơu khơl kơy đong tauq kadrôôp tachơơl hlê ay neq. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />Bơh leh vơ e anưq, Hê-rôt kung leh hloq kajoq, vii vuua heq pahnăp ay nưq hlê ka 'wot, ji 'yo yơu, be varơuq kajoq heq jah dưk dơơp bơyh ay nưq laa đangq kaxêêt. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />Vii anưq, atêq tuôôy dook ay neq, gô hnoq luh vlôh.” <verse eid="LUK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" />[Panưh kadrơy, muut tôôy đơơt lêh, kơy e varơuq duh dăt pheq luh vlôh muuyq adro tu ka oot.] <verse eid="LUK 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Bơh oot raay pariau kôt, đaneq: “Dayh kađnok adro nưq tok, ji luh vlôh Ba-ra-ba ka 'wot!” <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />(Adro neq 'miêh biq karuk muut tu vii muuyq đơơt aluk alaak nưq xalih vlôh đom theng phôq ji vii kadrôôp păk kaxêêt manih.) <verse eid="LUK 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Tuôôy nưq, Phi-lat đnooy panhăk oot yưk tra, vii xung tha Lôôk Jê-xu. <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />Bơh oot taayh tok đaneq: “Dayh đongq đing! Đongq đing ni tol gay charăk!” <verse eid="LUK 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Yôôch kơy nưq đnooy dii oot yưk thưq pe: “Vii varơuq xơk leq đơu adro neq heq dơơp? Gô be axek hloq kadrôôp xơk kajoq đangq kaxêêt aduq ay nưq. Lunưq, tuôôy dook payôôch, gô hnoq luh vlôh ay nưq.” <verse eid="LUK 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Bơh oot kưq kôt apok kăng ngăk đooy Kadraq pheq biq đongq đing, ji apok đnooy ku oot heq jay iaq. <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Phi-lat heq đnooy vlôh xưh xadrah xôq đooy vôôch ku oot jah dưk dơơp. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Tuôôy nưq, kơy nưq luh vlôh adro biq karuk đom tu vii kadrôôp paloanq ji păk kaxêêt manih, laa adro đơu oot heq vôôch, bơh kơy nưq pahnăp vlôh Lôôk Jê-xu tyauq iq oot.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Đom tuôôy khơl drơy jarooy Kadraq hooy, vii heq rôp eep Si-môn, muuyq adro Si-ren nưq, truh xing dêh katu, đơu oot xôq gay charăk tol adro nưq xôq hlôôy tyauq atêq Lôôk Jê-xu.<verse eid="LUK 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Muuyq bing tamooy thier karôp hooy tyauq Kadraq, ji khơl adro kadrê alo nhim ka Kadraq. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Bơh tuôôy wih hlê oot, Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy: “Koot kadrê Jê-ru-sa-lem lơơy, te nhim vii gô, wih hlê, dayh nhim vii kadih xăk ji vii koot xau khơl mư. <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Vii 'yo hơq, kaluh hngơy jeq truh, đơu đom kaluh hngơy nưq, khơl drơy hnoq đnooy: ‘Vanong ka khơl kadrê thoon, ji klaak leh pa iir, kung tôôh leh ăm uq.’ <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" />Tuôôy nưq, khơl drơy hnoq xarôp đnooy dii kaluh ngok đoot, ‘Dayh klêh pôôt 'wot,’ ji dii kaluh ngok gôk, ‘Dayh kariik galôp 'wot.’ <verse eid="LUK 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />Vii atoh khơl drơy xưh đanưq aduq ưk măn adriilh, yôôych varơuq kajoq xalih vlôh aduq ưk kateh?”<verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Tuôôy nưq, vaarq adro kadrôôp lôp kadrơy kung biq rôp jarooy xôq chiuq păk kaxêêt achung dii Kadraq.<verse eid="LUK 23:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Tuôôy oot hooy truh muuyq aduq jah taayh laa “Kadah Akoq,” yôôych oot đongq đing Kadraq kađnư, kung dii taleq adro kadrôôp lôp — muuyq adro pi bơ măn muuyq adro pi akeng. <verse eid="LUK 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />Yôôch oot bôk palăk ahlook mamuuyq apoop aau ku Kadraq. <verse eid="LUK 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />Manih karôp dưk đnư tamaak 'yo, măn khơl padrok xakaq kung xagiel aklêêu Kadraq, đaneq: “Ni heq wơơt khơl drơy, dayh kadih wơơt xăk yơu, atoh đaji ni laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh ku Kơy Plêêk, Kơy jah Kadraq rơơlh.” <verse eid="LUK 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />Bing kuun kung tache aklêêu Kadraq, hlê jeq tơơk tưp jôômq ka Kadraq, <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />yôôch dăt: “Atoh may laa Vuua tamooy Jo Thaiq yôôych dayh kadih wơơt xăk yơu.” <verse eid="LUK 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />Măn pi taalh Kadraq kung e muuyq riak chư: “Neq laa Vuua tamooy Jo Thaiq.”<verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Muuyq đom vaarq anơng kadrôôp lôp đong biq kađnok đnooy ra ơơh Kadraq, đaneq: “Kơy leh aalq laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh ih? Dayh wơơt xăk xamơk ji 'wot rơy hơu.” <verse eid="LUK 23:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Bơh tuôôy tơơl apok, anơng kadrôôp lôp hơq trek ni, ay nưq đnooy: “May măn leh xet yôq Kơy Plêêk tuôôy may đong chiuq kung muuyq xưh xadrah ih? <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Long haay đaneq laa jơq, vii haay đong nhonq hlê varơuq taxưngq dii varơuq haay heq dơơp, bơh adro neq leh dơơp bơyq varơuq kajoq dêq.” <verse eid="LUK 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Ji ay nưq tơơl: “Thơy Jê-xu, tuôôy thơy muut đom daak dêh thơy, xiin văch truh gô.” <verse eid="LUK 23:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Kadraq dăt ay: “Dong dik, gô đnooy dii ay, hngơy neng ay hnoq jah măn dii gô đom Ba-ra-đi.”<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44" />Tuôôy nưq laa muut kaplah wat thưq drơu yôôch, đơu kamơng jaluk aklum truh kahlôôp katuh loch dêh dong truh wat thưq xiit. <verse eid="LUK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45" />Mot hngơy kamơng langưm hlê. Măn tômq vaayh đom hnhư hơu biq chieh dơơp đôôy. <verse eid="LUK 23:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Atêq tuôôy taayh kôt apok, Lôôk Jê-xu đnooy: “Kuh Vaq, Koot pahnăp atăq phool hiel Koot đom ti Vaq.” Atêq nưq, tuôôy đnooy payôôch apok neq, Kadraq truut hơơy hook heet lôôch dik. <verse eid="LUK 23:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Tuôôy nưq, atêq tuôôy adro padrok kuun dưk 'yo varơuq heq xalih vlôh, kơy ayuôôt laat Kơy Plêêk, đaneq: “Manih neq kajưk dik laa hyioh jăk.” <verse eid="LUK 23:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Tuôôy dêq bing karôp tagumq anguk vii varơuq păk kaxêêt neq dưk 'yo kaluh kajoq heq xalih vlôh, yôôych oot tuk tada wiit xuq. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Măn dêq hloay khơl adro qween xet Kadraq kung dii khơl adro kadrê hooy tyauq Kadraq xing Ga-li-lê, oot 'miêh heq dưk măn kơn xangưưy tamaak 'yo kaluh varơuq nưq.<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50" />Hơq, muuyq dro anơng Jô-sep, laa adro waak hnhư xadrah, laa adro tamaq xuum ji hyioh jăk, <verse eid="LUK 23:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51" />(kơy 'miêh heq be ưng anưq dii khơl xadrah ji varơuq dơơp ku oot) kơy pa iir vlôh xing A-ri-ma-thê, muuyq theng ku manih Jo Thaiq, laa manih đong takôô daak dêh ku Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="LUK 23:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Tuôôy truh tavơh Phi-lat, kadih kơy heq xiin xaak Lôôk Jê-xu. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Ji atêq tuôôy tơq xaak Kadraq pôôt, kơy ahnom guôônq xaak bơơn vaayh lanh, ji up ni đom muuyq phon xanưng jah đuk đom phơu, aduq koq e paq kê kơyq hmưq up xôq. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Hngơy nưq laa hngơy Ralauq Palauq, ji hngơy Sa-bat jeq truh. <verse eid="LUK 23:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Tuôôy nưq, khơl oh ay kadrê, laa khơl adro 'miêh heq kung hooy dii Kadraq xing Ga-li-lê, tuôôy hooy tyauq pi atêq, oot 'yo hloq apoop xanưng ji padoh xaak Kadraq jah up. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Yôôch tuôôy heq wiit xuq, oot ralauq palauq kahlơu jarơơu ji jơu thơơm.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:56">Truh hngơy Sa-bat, oot padơy pado tyauq ganuun đinq.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Nưq yôôch, xaroq meel rahưng tađnah ku hngơy adroyq twuân, oot hooy truh xanưng, xagook tyauq kahlơu jarơơu đơu oot heq palauq ralauq. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />Bơh oot tamaak hloq kuk phơu heq jah palanh klơlh xanưng, <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />lunư, tuôôy muut pi'lăp, oot leh hloq xaak Lôôk Jê-xu. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Varơuq xalih vlôh đom tuôôy oot đong xôôl dôôl truh varơuq neq yôôych, 'yo hơq, vaarq adro khơl kanau hlưp aau tađnah xaraar dưk gah oot. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Tuôôy oot varaal hwaal ji kuu mot pôôt vari yôôych vaarq dro nưq đnooy dii oot: “Aleq khơl mư axek manih riirh đom katul adro kaxêêt? <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />Kadraq leh măn đnen, bơh Kadraq riirh hlê yôôch! Dayh văch hlê Kadraq heq đnooy đaleq dii khơl oh ay tuôôy đong măn aduq Ga-li-lê, <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />dăt đaneq Koot Manih pheq biq atăq muut ti khơl adro kadrôôp maroh ji pheq biq đongq đing tol gay charăk, yôôch truh hngơy thưq pe, pheq riirh hlê.” <verse eid="LUK 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Oot văch hlê apok Kadraq, <verse eid="LUK 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />ji tuôôy xing xanưng wiit xuq, oot taboon hlê tôôy varơuq ka kưl muuyq dro jah rơơlh kung dêq hloay khơl adro kadrơy. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Khơl adro kadrê nưq e Ma-ri Ma-đơ-len, Jan-nơ, Ma-ri miq Ja-kơ, ji khơl adro kadrê kadrơy kung dii oot, taboon hlê ka khơl jah rơơlh kaluh varơuq nưq. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Kaluh apok taboon nưq tameng e veeh leh dik đôôyq dii khơl jah rơơlh, lunưq oot leh tuôq taleq dro mư neq. <verse eid="LUK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Lunư, Phi-e-rơ dưk tok charơơk truh xanưng, ji tuôôy kuu pôôt 'yo muut pi'lăp, kơy vơ hloq vaayh ahnom. Nưq laa kơy hooy xuq hnhư, kadih vôôch varơuq kajoq heq xalih vlôh.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Hơq, đom kadih hngơy nưq, vaarq adro đom sôôq khơl xatyauq đong hooy truh muuyq palơy pla xangưưy anơng laa Em-ma-ut, kawah Jê-ru-sa-lem drơu kưl êch-ta-đơ, <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />ji oot đong athêêk tajauq dii mamuuyq truh tôôy varơuq heq xalih vlôh. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Varơuq xalih vlôh đom tuôôy oot athêêk ji tagêh, yôôych kadih Lôôk Jê-xu truh jeq hooy achung dii oot. <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />Bơh mot oot biq kariik kađoq xôq leh nhonq vlôh Kadraq. <verse eid="LUK 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Tuôôy nưq, Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Taleq varơuq nưq laa kajoq đơu vaarq ay athêêk tajauq dii mamuuyq đong tuôôy hooy trôôk nưq?” Oot dưk tangưưr vlôh nưq, hlu tarôôy dik. <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Yôôch tuôôy tơơl apok, muuyq adro anơng laa Kơ-lê-ô-ba đnooy dii Kadraq: “E jơq vơ muuyq adro kơy laa khach hlơq Jê-ru-sa-lem leh xet kaluh varơuq heq xalih vlôh aduq nưq taleq hngơy neq?” <verse eid="LUK 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Kadraq vôôch baarq: “Varơuq kajoq nưq?” Yôôch baarq đnooy dii Kadraq: “Varơuq apiq truh Jê-xu manih Na-xa-ret, đơu nưq laa muuyq dro, muuyq kơy hlit galaay taay yaak đom varơuq dơơp hloay apok đnooy kangưưr Kơy Plêêk kung dêq manih karôp, <verse eid="LUK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />ji đaleq đơu khơl thơy tơơk tưp kôt kung khơl padrok xanok ku haay heq atăq Kadraq xôq chiuq păk kaxêêt, ji heq đongq đing Kadraq tol gay charăk. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />Măn 'wot 'miêh takôô gamưh đaneq Kadraq nưq laa Kơy truh xôq wơơt xok I-sơ-ra-ên. Wih hlê, leh vơ kung dii dêq hloay kaluh varơuq ataalh, varơuq nưq dalơh hlê truh hngơy neng laa hngơy thưq pe, jauq xing tuôôy kalu varơuq hơq xalih vlôh. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Bơh, taleq khơl kadrê đom katul 'wot dik khienq 'wot pheq tưng hưng, atêq tuôôy oot măn aduq xanưng tuôôy xaroq meel <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />ji tuôôy be axek hloq xaak Kadraq, oot xuq, taboon hlê laa heq hloq varơuq rama truh khơl kơy yaak đnooy Kadraq đong riirh. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Taleq dro đom 'wot hooy vlôh xanưng ji oot heq hloq dang anưq, troq đaji taleq dro khơl kadrê heq đnooy, bơh oot leh hloq Kadraq.” <verse eid="LUK 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Yôôch Kadraq đnooy dii baarq: “Ôôy, khơl adro vlô apoop ji khơl adro xiik hlolh đom xuum xôq tuôq aduq tôôy varơuq đơu khơl kơy hlit heq đnooy! <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />Be aalq Lôôk Wơơt Dêh duh chiuq kaluh varơuq nưq, xôq muut đom tađnah tađnaak ku Kadraq ih?” <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Yôôch xarôp xing Môi-se ji xing dêq hloay khơl kơy hlit, Kadraq padoh hlolh ka oot kaluh varơuq tapa truh Kadraq đom dêq Rahlăp Vah. <verse eid="LUK 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Oot hooy jeq truh palơy aduq oot đinq truh, yôôych Kadraq dơơp đaji đinq hooy xangưưy iaq. <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />Nưq laa oot băt eep Kadraq, đaneq: “Xiin măn hlê dii 'wot, vii plêêk heq jeq klôôy ji hngơy heq dêq yôôch.” Kadraq hooy muut xôq măn hlê dii oot. <verse eid="LUK 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Varơuq xalih vlôh tuôôy Kadraq heq 'ngôôy muut para kung dii oot, adrơk tôôp tok, Kadraq kuh kway, ji atêq tuôôy pleh vlôh, Kadraq palo ka oot. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Tuôôy nưq, mot oot jah luh vlôh ji oot nhonq vlôh Kadraq, yôôch Kadraq heq hooy hlơơp klơlh oot. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Oot đnooy dii mamuuyq: “Be aalq laa xuum haay tôq tơh tuôôy Kadraq athêêk tajauq dii haay tol trôôk hooy, kung đaji tuôôy Kadraq padoh hlolh Rahlăp Vah ka haay ih?” <verse eid="LUK 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Nưq laa tuôôy dưk tok kung muut kadih wat nưq, oot wiit xuq truh Jê-ru-sa-lem. Ji oot axek tavơh kưl muuyq dro jah rơơlh đong tagumq hlê, kung khơl adro e mot dii oot, <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />tauq đaneq: “Lôôk heq riirh hlê dik yôôch, ji Kadraq heq jah Si-môn 'yo hloq.” <verse eid="LUK 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Yôôch oot taboon hlê tôôy varơuq tol trôôk hooy, ji đaleq Kadraq heq kahnoq ka oot xet đom tuôôy pleh tôôp.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Tuôôy nưq, tuôôy oot đong đnooy kaluh varơuq nưq, kadih Kadraq dưk măn katul oot, ji đnooy dii oot: “Hrok hrol ka oh ay.” <verse eid="LUK 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Bơh vii thier yôq ji varaal hwaal, oot biit laa đong hloq yaak plêêk. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Kadraq dăt oot: “Aleq oh ay xôôl dôôl ji vii kơq kajoq đơu varơuq biit ravơq tơơk tok đom xuum oh ay? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Dayh 'yo ti ku thơy ji jôôk ku thơy, đaneq kadih laa thơy neq. Dayh avêq muut thơy ji 'yo. Vii yaak leh e hlek ji khiêk, đaji oh ay nhonq hloq thơy đong e.” <verse eid="LUK 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Đnooy payôôch apok nưq, Kadraq ăm oot 'yo ti ji jôôk kadraq. <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Đom tuôôy oot măn e koq hôôk tuôq ji dơơp akêh vii thier hlah hlaak, Kadraq vôôch oot: “Măn đnen, oh ay e kajoq xa ik be?” <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Tuôôy nưq, oot ăm ka Kadraq muuyq apek kaa vuh; <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />Atêq tuôôy adrơk xok, Kadraq xa kangưưr oot.<verse eid="LUK 24:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Yôôch Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Neq laa kaluh apok ku thơy đơu thơy heq đnooy dii oh ay tuôôy e măn dii oh ay, đaneq tôôy varơuq heq valơk truh thơy đom ganuun Môi-se, kaluh rahlăp kơy hlit ji kaluh Thi Thiên raay pheq jah jêêk yuôôr.” <verse eid="LUK 24:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Tuôôy nưq, Kadraq luh akoq ngook oot xôq hlolh Rahlăp Vah, ji Kadraq dăt oot: <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />đaneq: “Đaji e apok valơk: Lôôk Wơơt Dêh pheq chiuq jiq jiêh, ji xing aduq kaxêêt riirh hlê muut hngơy thưq pe, <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />yôôch varơuq wiit xuum xôq jah tha kadrôôp pheq jah padoh taboon taayh yal Kadraq ăm dêq hloay kaluh tamooy, xarôp xing Jê-ru-sa-lem. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Oh ay laa khơl xanưk truh kaluh varơuq nưq. <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" />Thơy jeq atăq varơuq heq tavek ku Vaq thơy truh tol oh ay. Bơh oh ay dayh măn đom theng dong truh tuôôy oh ay jah hlưp xok taay yaak xing ataalh.”<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Yôôch Kadraq jarooy oot vlôh pi gôk dong truh jeq Bê-tha-ni, ji tuôôy tơơk ti kadraq tok, Kadraq kahniq vanong ka oot. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Varơuq xalih vlôh đom tuôôy Kadraq kahniq vanong ka oot, Kadraq chuh klơlh oot ji jah xagook tok plêêk. <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />Atêq tuôôy kuh kul Kadraq, oot wiit xuq aduq Jê-ru-sa-lem dii xuum hlah hlaak paq ik, <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />ji dêq hloay oot kưq măn đom hnhư hơu, ayuôôt laat Kơy Plêêk.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>